<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Kimbu Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Empola Nsoga kete venaa yaleyandekhwa no Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Empola Nsoga kete venaa yaleyandekhwaa no</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mateo</para>
  <para style="imt">Olongoli</para>
  <para style="ip">Empola Nsoga kete venaa yaleyandekhwaa no Mateo a kemwii mo vetabu venee venaa vepwale kho Ilekhaano la seji venaa vekhopalela wome wa Yesu Kilisto. Kela kemwii cha vetabu evyoo kekhwetwa, “Injili,” Emaana yakwe Mpola Nsoga. Vetabu evi vyalevyandekhwa no Mateo, no Maluko, no Luka no Yohana panaa Yesu aleafwaa. Vantu vanaa valevasoma vakhamanya kekhapanga a ituungo kee lenaa Mpola Nsoga kete venaa yaleyandekhwaa no Mateo, ila vantu vakhoheewa kete yaleyandekhwaa kho mwakha gwa makomi sita panaa Yesu Kilisto alealelwaa. Avivyoo, lwande yenaa Mpola Nsoga eye yaleyandekhwa ikhamanyikha, ila vinki vakhoheewa kete yaleyandekhwa kho nse ya Palestina, ne hamo yalendekhwa kho ihala la Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwandeki a Mateo, yunaa angile mokongan'ya khodi, Yesu panaa angile akhale amowele awee mohemba wakwe. Avivyoo Mateo aleakhomanyekha khwa lina la Lawi. Mateo angile yomwii wa vahemba va Yesu ikomi ne vawele, nanoyo aleavandekelaa Vayahudi Mpola Nsoga eye. Eye ikholagelwa mwalya kho nguno gapwale maandekho khokela ya makomi sita ganaa aleagandekha khopuma kho Ilekhaano la Myakha. Alealamola kholageela kete Yesu amwenee Kilisto, moyawoli yunaa aleasagolwa no Matuunda. Oyo Yesu amwenee yunaa alealotelwa no Matuunda. Avivyoo, Mateo aleandekhaa mpola nyinki jenaa jekhopalela owami wa Matuunda. Vayahudi valevamosowelela kete Kilisto angaalaawa mwami wa nse yawe. Ila Mateo akhopalela visoga, kenaa akhopaala a owami wa kemoye wa Matuunda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Injili kete venaa yalendekhwa no Mateo a ketabu a kesoga kenaa kekopogiwa khowa mwandyo Ilekhaano la Seji kho nguno japalaga mpola nyinki khopuma kho Ilekhaano la Myakha. A kewongelo kesoga kate Malekhaano gawele. Vantu vanaa valevasoma vayangolaga kete hamo Mateo angile akhogema khwigelelya venaa Musa aleandekha vetabu vyakwe venaa a vetabu vetaano vya mwandyo vya Ilekhaano la Myamka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ganaa gapwale</para>
  <para style="io">Mateo akhomyandya Mpola Nsoga khwa khopalela mpola ja kholelwa khwa Yesu Kilisto no mwandyo wa otomami wa Yesu. Kho osho wa 1-4</para>
  <para style="io">Kenaa kekholoonda Mateo akhopalela molemo wa Yesu no maligi gakwe minki. Kho osho wa 5-25</para>
  <para style="io">Lwande ya odugo ya ketabu eke cha Mateo kekhopalela odugo wa molemo mokolo yenaa ikhwigela kho ncha yakwe no khofufokha khwakwe. Kho osho wa 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Odogo wa Yesu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ogo agwene mosololo gwa odogo wa Yesu Kilisto. Yesu Kilisto angile wa odogo wa mwami Daudi. Daudi nanoyo angile wa odogo wa Abulahamu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abulahamu amolelile Isaka, no Isaka akamolela Yakobo, no Yakobo akamolela Yuda ne vadogwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda amolelile Pelesi no Zela, onyinya yawe angile Tamali. Pelesi akamolela Heziloni, no Heziloni akamolela Lami, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lami akamolela Aminadabu, no Aminadabu akamolela Nashoni, no Nashoni akamolela Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni akamolela Boazi, no nyinya Boazi angile Lahabu. Boazi no Lutu angile valeli va Obedi, no Obedi akamolela Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese akamolela mwami Daudi, nanoyo Daudi akamolela Solomoni, onyinya wa Solomoni a oyoo yunaa angile moliji wa Ulia, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni akamolela Lehoboamu, no Lehoboamu akamolela Abiya, no Abiya nanoyo akamolela Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa nanoyo akamolela Yehoshafati, no Yehoshafati akamolela Yolamu, no Yolamu akamolela Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia nanoyo akamolela Yotamu, no Yotamu akamolela Ahazi, no Ahazi nanoyo akamolela Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia nanoyo akamolela Manase, no Manase akamolela Amoni, no Amoni akamolela Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia nanoyo akamolela Yekonia ne vadogwakwe, ituungo panaa Vayahudi angile vakhosamiwaa kho nse ya Babeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ituungo eloo la osaami, Yekonia akamolela Shealitieli, no Shealitieli akamolela Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabeli akamolela Abiyudi, no Abiyudi akamolela Eliakimu, no Eliakimu akamolela Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azoli nanoyo akamolela Sadoki, no Sadoki akamolela Akimu, no Akimu akamolela Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi akamolela Eliazali, no Eliazali akamolela Matani, no Matani akamolela Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo akamolela Yusufu yunaa angile mogwisha wa Malia, no oyoo Malia aleamolela Yesu yunaa akhwetwa Kilisto. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Gechoo, alevepwale veleli ikomi ne venee khopuma khwa Abulahamu mpakha khwa mwami Daudi. No khopuma khwa mwami Daudi mpakha ituungo la osaami wa khopeta Babeli. No khopuma kho osaami wa Babeli mpakha khwa Kilisto alevepwale veleli ikomi ne venee.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kholelwa khwa Yesu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Mpola ya kholelwa khwa Yesu Kilisto angile geeke. Malia nyinya wa Yesu angile abanyagwaa no Yusufu, ila panaa angile vakhale vandye khwikhala palomwi kete moliji no mogwisha, Malia aleigelaa akepolagaa ndaa kho olaala wa Moye wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yusufu angile muntu musoga, aleakhapoga khomopeela nsoni molijakwe khwa vantu, gechoo alealoma khomolekha khwa osweki ili akhamotole khanke. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Yusufu panaa angile khohewaa empola eyoo, motomami wa pachanya khwa Matuunda amwijelaa kho ndoti, amowelaa, “Yusufu, molelwa wa mwami Daudi, okhatungumale khomotoola Malia, kho nguno ndaa yakwe yapumanagaa khwa olaala wa Moye wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Nanoyo Malia alamolela mwana wa kegwisha, nagwe olamweta Yesu, kho nguno omwenee amwenee alavapon'ya vantu vakwe khopuma kho mabe gawe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ega gensi alegapumeela ili idugame mpola yenaa Mwene angile apalagaa khokelela khwa molooti wa Matuunda kete, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Tegelelyaa, mwalele yunaa akhale iitange no mogwisha, alakepola ndaa, nanoyo alamolela mwana wa kegwisha, nanoyo alaetwa lina lakwe, Emanueli” emaana yakwe, “Matuunda palomwi nasu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Yusufu panaa alealawelaa, anojaa kete venaa motomami oyoo wa khochanya khwa Matuunda aleamowelagaa, amosolaa Malia no khomonoja molijakwe. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Ila aleakhagona nanoyo, mpakha panaa aleitungolaa mwana. Nanoyo Yusufu amwetaa mwana oyoo Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Vahenja khopuma keeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu panaa alealelagwa kho ihala la Betelehemu kho nse ya Yudea, ituungo lenaa Helode angile mwami, vamanyi va njota khopuma keeya valevapikha Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />vaawa vakhowolya, “Alekwenii mwana yunaa alelagwa, ili awee mwami wa Vayahudi? Khwameyonaga njota yakwe kepumela keeya, nasu khwijaga khomokumbekha.” <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mwami Helode panaa aleategela mpola eye, aleingelwa no wowa mokolo omwene palomwi ne vantu vensi va Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Apenee Helode aleavakungan'ya valaala vensi va vapumya matambekho va Matuunda palomwi ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa, avawolya, “Kilisto angaalalelwa kwenii?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Nanevo vamoweela, “Alalelwa Betelehemu kho ihala la Yudea. Avyenee molooti wa Matuunda aleandekhaa.<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Nagwe Betelehemu ihala la Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">ogwegwe nkha ihala la khobyeedwa mogamoonga ga mahala ga Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">kho nguno khopuma khwakhoo alapumela mwimeleli yunaa alavaimelela vantu vaane va Izilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Apenee Helode akavaeta khwa osweki vamanyi va njota evoo, ili viije vamopalele visoga ituungo lenaa valevandya khomeyona njota eyoo. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Papenee akavalagelelya vapete Betelehemu, no khovaweela kete, “Mopete momopoge visoga mpakha momanye khonaa mwana oyoo apwale. Nanyu panaa molamowona mwiije mondetele mpola jakwe nyango, ili nane nipete khomokumbekha.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Nanevo vakapuma khokhaye khwa mwami oyoo. Panaa valevapuma, valevameyona njota keeya, valevatogwaa modugo. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Njota eyoo yaleyavalongolya mpakha pa lwande yenaa aleapwale mwana oyoo. Yapeta khwimelela pachanya pa lwande yenaa aleapwale mwana oyoo. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Panaa valevingela mokhate ya nyoomba, vakamowona mwana palomwi no Malia onyinya, vamotungamela no khomokumbekha mwana, papenee vatungula miligo jawe no khomopumelya mfinga ja zahabu no obani palomwi no ogaanga monogu gonaa gokhwetwa manemane. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Matuunda aleavagilya kho ndoti vakhamotuwele khanke Helode, gechoo vatuuwa khokhaye jawe khwa khokelela njela jiinge.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne valeli vakwe vakhokembelela kho nse ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Vamanyi va njota evoo panaa angile vawokhaga, motomami wa khochanya pa Matuunda amopumelaa Yusufu kho ndoti, akamoweela, “Lawelaa, omosole mwana no nyinya mokembelele kho nse ya Misili. Mwikhalage okhoo mpakha panaa ndavawela, kho nguno Helode akhopooga khomowolaga mwana oyo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Apenee Yusufu akalawela, akamosolaa mwana palomwi no nyinya, vakawookha otikho awowoo khopeta kho nse ya Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />ne valevikhala okhoo mpakha panaa Helode aleafwaa. Mpola eyoo aleyanojekha ili empola yenaa aleapalaa Mwene khokelela khwa molooti wa Matuunda idugame. Panaa aleapalaa, “Nalenamweta mwanaane iije khopuma nse ya Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vakeke va kegwisha vakhowolagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helode panaa aleamanyaa kete vamanyi va njota evoo vamopepelaga, aleasimbaa modugo. Apenee akavatoma masinjala vakwe vapete Betelehemu palomwi ne lwande jensi ja pepi, avalagelelya vapete vawawolage vana vakeke vensi va kegwisha. Aleanojaa gechoo khopumana ne ituungo lenaa aleawelwaa ne vamanyi va njota.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Avyenee venaa jalejadugama mpola jenaa jalejapaalwa khokelela khwa Yelemia yunaa angile molooti wa Matuunda kete,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Lolii lwalelwategelekha khopuma kho ihala la Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">nkooto ne losongo nyinki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli khovakotelaa vanaakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">ninga akhaloma khopepeselwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kho nguno vanaakwe vensi vagulalaga.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne valeli vakwe vakhotuuwa khopuma Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Helode panaa aleafwaa, motomami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda akamopumela Yusufu kho ndoti okhoo Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />akamoweela, “Lawelaa, omosole mwana palomwi no nyinya, motuuwe kho nse ya Izilaeli, kho nguno evoo vanaa angile vakhopooga khomowolaga mwana, vafwaaga.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Apenee Yusufu akalawela, akamosola mwana palomwi no nyinya, atuuwa nanevo kho nse ya Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ila Yusufu panaa aleategelaa kete Alikelo angile mwami wa nse ya Yudea panaa ise aleafwaa, aleatungumala khopeta okhoo. Matuunda aleamolanga kho ndoti, gechoo aleapeta kho nse ya Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />akasamela no khwikhala kho ihala la Nazaleti. Apenee yaleyadugama mpola yenaa yaleyapalwa khowogela Yesu khwa khokelela valooti va Matuunda kete, “Alaetwa Munazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mobatiji khovakowelaa mbuuto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Kho ituungo lenaa valevapwale kho ihala la Nazaleti, aleapumela muntu yomwi yunaa alekhwetwa Yohana Mobatiji. Muntu oyoo aleigela kho ipalangwa la Yudea, aleijaa oko akhotangazya khwa khopaala, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Galokhagi no khogalekha mabe genyu, kho nguno owami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda watelelaga.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yohana amwenee yunaa aleapalwa no Isaya molooti wa Matuunda kete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Muntu khojomaa pipalangwa akipaala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">momonogelelye Mwene njela yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Gololagi vejela visoga monaa alakela.”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohana alealyala mwenda gonaa gonogelilwe no wage wa ndimwana yunaa khwetwaa ngamia no khwituunga mokhanki gwa ntila pakeweno chakwe. Endya yakwe angile mpandi no woke. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Vantu vinki valevamopetela khopuma kho ihala la Yelusalemu, no khopuma lwande jensi ja Yudea, no khopuma lwande jensi ja mompelo ja lweje lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Valevapaala mabe gawe paolongolo wa Matuunda no khogalekha, nanoyo Yohana akavabatija kho lweje lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ila Yohana panaa aleawona Mafalisayo ne Masadukayo vakhomopetela khwa winki ili avabatije, akavaweela, “Onywee mole kete njokha, a nanuu yunaa avalangagaa mokekembele kesila cha Matuunda kenaa kiijile? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Gechoo ikhalagi wikhalo wonaa okholageela kete mwalekhaga mabe genyu gensi. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Lekhagi khwiganekha no khwipalela kete, ‘Daada yisu a Abulahamu.’ Nkhovaweela khapanga, Matuunda nokhowolaa khogelolya mabwe ega gawee vana va Abulahamu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Ntemo ya Matuunda yandalelagwa khovatengemekha kete venaa ekhotipa matina ga mapeke. Vantu vanaa vakhavakhonoja manoji masoga, valatengemekhwa, kete venaa kela ipeke lenaa lekhalekholela viligi visoga lekhodomolwa no khojutelwa mo moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Onene nkhovabatija kho meje kholageela mwagalokhaga no kholekha mabe genyu, ila muntu yunaa ijilee panaa onene amba nakelaga, atite olaala khokela onene, yunaa nkhalomwa ninga khotungula ngosa ja ntajee jakwe. Kho nguno omwene alavabatija khwa Moye wa Matuunda no khwa moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Omwene avambagaa losela mo mekhono jakwe, ili apepemole ogosi, ne mpuumba ja ogosi jepepemolwe. Alaokongan'ya ogosi mo kienge, ne mpuumba ejoo alajetima mo moto gonaa gokhalimaga.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khobatijwaa no Yohana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Papenee Yesu aleijaa khopuma Galilaya mpakha Yolodani, ili abatijwe no Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ila Yohana aleagemaa khomositela, akamoweela, “Onene amwenee nkhopogiwa khobatijwaa nagwe, gechoo, kho kee ogwegwe okhwija khwaane?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Ila Yesu akamoweela, “Ogwegwe nibatijee seji, kho nguno khokhopogiwa khonoje gensi ganaa Matuunda khopogaa.” Apenee Yohana akagoomba khomobatija.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yesu panaa aleamalyaa khobatijwa no khopuma mo meje, timpu, khochanya khwa Matuunda khwadigokha, nanoyo aleamowonaa Moye wa Matuunda khotelemokhaa pachanya yakwe kete njewa. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Apenee lolii lwategelekha khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda lonaa lokhopaala, “Oyo amwene mwanaane aleemwi yunaa nkhotojwaa nanoyo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhogemwa no Khatawe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Maluko 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Apenee Moye wa Matuunda akamonoja Yesu apete kho itenengwa, ili agemwe no Khatawe. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Nanoyo Yesu panaa aleamalya khotuunga kholya kho ituungo la nsiko makomi ganee, otikho ne lyonse, aleitegelaa njala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Apenee Khatawe iija khomogema, no khomoweela, “Mbe ogwegwe a Mwana wa Matuunda, gapogee mabwee ega gagaloke gawee mikate.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Ila Yesu akamoweela, “Yandekhagwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda kete, ‘Muntu khotopo ikhale khwa endya topo, ila khwa kela mpola yenaa ekhopuma khwa Matuunda.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Papenee Khatawe aleamokenkhaa Yesu mpakha khwi ihala la Matuunda la Yelusalemu, no khomonoja imelele pachanya ya kensuunda cha Nyoomba ya Matuunda, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />akamoweela kete, “Mbe ogwegwe ole Mwana wa Matuunda, wisombe panse, kho nguno yandekhagwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Matuunda alamolagelelya motomami wakwe wa khochanya khwakwe kho nguno yakhoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">nanevo valakhokepola momekhono jawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ili megolo jakhoo jekiije jikumpe kho mabwee.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Ila Yesu akamoweela kete, “Khanke yandekhagwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda, ‘Okhamogeme Mwene Matuunda wakhoo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Apenee Khatawe akamosola Yesu no khomokenkha khochanya pa ketonda ketale no khomolageela owami wensi wa paliwelelo ne nsawo jakwe jensi jenaa nsoga. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Khanke akamoweela, “Ndakhopela eve vyensi mbe olantungamela no khonkumbekha.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Apenee Yesu akamoweela, “Pumaa paolongolo waane Khatawe, kho nguno yandekagwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda kete, ‘Mokumbekee Mwene Matuunda wakhoo no khomotomamela omwene aleemwi.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Papenee Khatawe akamolekha Yesu, ne vatomami va pachanya pa Matuunda viija khomotomamela.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhwandya molemo gwakwe Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Maluko 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu panaa aleategelaa kete Yohana atungagwaa mo khandulunge, aleapetaa ihala la Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Yesu akapuma Nazaleti, akapeta khwi ihala la Kapelanaumu, Genesaleti lenaa alenee ilambo Galilaya, lenaa lepwale kho udugo wa nse ya Zebuluni ne ya Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Yaleyapumela gechoo, ili idugame mpola yenaa Matuunda aleapalaa khokelela Isaya molooti wa Matuunda, kete,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Tegeleleli onywee vantu vanaa mokhwikhala kho nse ya Zebuluni ne ya Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">tegeleli onywee vantu va nse jenaa jepwale kho mpelo ya njela ja khopeta kho ilambo Galilaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">ne nkelo ya lweje Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">tegeleli onywee vantu va Galilaya, kho nse ya vantu vanaa nkha Vayahudi.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Vantu vanaa vakhwikhala kho kitii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">vawonaga welo mokolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">ne evoo vanaa vakhwikhala mo molule gwa ncha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">vamolekelagwa no welo wa melaawo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Mpuma ituungo eloo, Yesu aleandya khovatengela vantu, akipaala, “Mogelokelagi Matuunda no khogalekha mabe genyu, kho nguno owami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda watelelaga.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovaeta valuwi vanee vamolonde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu panaa angile khogendaa pampelo ya ilambo la Galilaya, akavawona valuwi vawele, Simoni yunaa angile akhwetwa Petulo, palomwi no Andelea modogwakwe. Valevakholuwa nshe khwa megonyo jawe mo ilambo. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu akavaweela kete, “Mwiije mondonde, nane ndavanoja movalete vantu khwaane kete venaa mokholuwa nshe no khojekenkha khokhaye.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Apaponye valevalekha megonyo jawe, vakamoloonda Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Yesu panaa aleapetaa paulongolo kedo, aleavawonaa vadogo vaange vawele, Yakobo no Yohana, vanaa angile vana va Zebedayo. Evoo angile vapwale mwipogo palomwi no isewe, vakhonogelelya megonyo jawe. Apenee Yesu avetaa <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />apaponye valevalekha ipogo palomwi no isewe, vakamoloonda Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovaliga vantu no khovapon'ya valwile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu angile akhopilima kho mahala gensi ga Galilaya kho nyoomba ja khwitangela Vayahudi no khovaliga vantu omoo, khovantegela vantu Mpola Nsoga khougela owami wa Matuunda, no khovapon'ya malwile gawe gensi. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Mpola jakwe jalejasambaala kho nse yensi ya Silia. Vantu valevapeta ne valwile va malwile gensi, movamoonga vawe, valevapwale vanaa valevalwalile modugo, ne vanaa valevawambagwa ne mademi, ne vanaa angile vatite khafunta, ne vanaa valevapolajaa mowele, nanoyo Yesu aleavapon'yaa vensi. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Apenee vantu vinki angile vakhomoloonda khopuma kho Galilaya no kho Dekapoli, emaana yakwe nse ya mahala ikomi, Yelusalemu, ne Yudea, ne nkelo ya lweje Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovaliga vantu kho ketonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu panaa aleagawonaa madale ga vantu, aleatantaa pachanya ya ketonda ikhalaa panse, nanevo vahemba vakwe vakamopetela, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />apenee andyaa khovaliga, khwa khopaala.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otogwi wa khapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Vatite otogwi vanaa vapeena va moye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">kho nguno owami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda a wakhowawe.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Vatite otogwi vanaa vakhosaaya, kho nguno valapepeselwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Vatite otogwi vanaa vanyenyekeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">kho nguno evoo avenee valaesala nse.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Vatite otogwi vanaa vatite njala ne nyoota ya khonoja ganaa gakhogombekha no Matuunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">kho nguno Matuunda alavikotya.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Vatite otogwi vanaa vatite losongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">kho nguno evoo valasayelwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Vatite otogwi vanaa vatokhola mabe mo meoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">kho nguno valamowona Matuunda.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Vatite otogwi vanaa vakholeeta wikhalo mosoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">kho nguno valeetwa vana va Matuunda.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Vatite otogwi vanaa vakhogayanjwaa kho nguno ya khonoja ganaa Matuunda khopogaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">kho nguno owami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda a wakhowawe.”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Onywenywe motite otogwi mbe vantu vakhovatokha no khovagayanjaa no khovapalela vibe kho nguno onywenywe a vahemba vaane. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Togagwi no khokowa ngiligili, kho nguno mfinga jenyu amba nkolo khochanya khwa Matuunda. Gechoo avyenee venaa angile vakhovagayanjaa valooti vanaa angile vakhwikhala pamyakha.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela moleenge no welo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luka 14:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Onywenywe mole kete moleenge khwa vantu va liwelelo lensi. Ila mbe moleenge opwelyee ononu wakwe, olatola chanuu ili etuvyee ononu wakwe khanke? Ekhalomwa khanke khotomelwa, elajutwa panji no khosaambwa ne vantu. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Onywenywe, mole kete welo wa vantu va paliwelelo. Ihala lenaa lajengagwa pachanya ya ketonda vantu vensi valagowona. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Ninga vantu akhavakhomolekha etala nokhoikundekela khwi idebe, ila vakhotoola pachanya ya kensuunda chakwe, ili ivamolekele vensi vanaa vale monyomba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Avivyoo nanyu, welo wenyu gokhopogiwaa gomoleke paolongolo wa vantu, ili vakhowole khowona manoji genyu masoga, vamokolye Matuunda yunaa apwale khochanya.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela njaanga ja Matuunda jenaa aleamopela Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Mokhahewe kete nijaga khowochaa njaanga ja Musa ne maligi ga valooti va Matuunda. Alenkhiija khowochaa, ila khodugamya. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, mpakha panaa khochanya khwa Matuunda ne liwelelo jelawokha, khotopo ninga nukuta yemwii ya njaanga yenaa elawochwaa mpakha gensi gadugame. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khositaa khojeloonda ninga njaanga yemwii yenaa ndo khokela jiinge jensi, ne khovaliga vaange vanojee kete omwene, oyoo alawaa modo modugo kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. Ila oyoo yunaa alajivamba ne khovaliga vaange, oyoo alaawa mokolo kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Avyenee nkhovaweela, mbe akhamokhonoja ganaa gakhomotoja Matuunda, khotopo mwiije mwingele kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda ninga nsiko yemwii.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi ga khogilya kesila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mwategelaga kete vantu va myakha valevapelwaa njaanga kete, ‘Okhawolage, ne mbe muntu yeyensi yunaa alamowolaga muntu yoonge, khopogiwa atengemekwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ila onene nkhovaweela, muntu yeyensi yunaa alamosimbela modogwakwe khapogiwa khotengemekwa. Yeyensi yunaa khomobyedaa modogwakwe, alakenkhwa kho ivanza, khanke yeyensi yunaa alamweta modogwakwe, ‘Moleele’ alapogiwa khwingela kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Gechoo, mbe okeenke sadakha yakhoo kho kechanja cha khopumelyaa sadakha kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda, apaponye wakombola kete mwitakhajaa no moyakhoo, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />elekhagee sadakha eyoo paulongolo ya kechanja cha khopumelyaa sadakha kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda, petaa taali mwigombye nanoyo. Apenee otuuwe khanke khopumyaa sadakha yakhoo.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Mwigombye nyango gasile no mwitachi wakhoo, ituungo lenaa mokhale mopike khwi ivanza, ili mwitachi wakhoo akhakhopiche khwa motengemeki, nanoyo motengemeki akhopiche khwa masinjala, nagwe otuungwe mokhandulunge. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, khotopo opume omoo mpakha panaa olalepa kechele cha odugo.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaangi khougela osencha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mwategelaga kete vantu valevaweelwa, ‘Okhasenche.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ila onene nkhovaweela kete, mogwisha yeyensi yunaa khomokuuna mokhiima yoonge khwa khotamanela, oyoo khaawa anogaja osencha no mokhiima oyoo, momooyo gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Mbe liso lakhoo la molyelo lelakenkela onojee mabe, lekumpolee no kholesutya patale. Kho nguno amba visoga khopwelya kewongelo kemwii khokela mowele wakhoo gwensi khosutwa kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Khanke mbe mokhono gwakhoo gwa molyelo golakhokenkela onojee mabe, owodomole no khowosutya patale. Kho nguno amba visoga khopwelya kewongelo kemwii khokela mowele gwakhoo gwensi khosutwa kho moto gonaa gakhalimaga nsiko jensi.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaangi khougela kholekhaana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Maluko 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Khanke mwategelaga njaanga yenaa kepalaa, ‘Muntu yeyensi yunaa akhomolekha molijakwe, akhopogiwa amopele etalatasi ya khomolekha.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ila onene nkhovaweela, muntu yeyensi yunaa akhomolekha molijakwe, kho nguno yenaa nkha ya osencha, akhomonoja molijakwe awee mosencha. No mogwisha yeyensi yunaa alamotola mokhiima yunaa alekhagwaa, oyoo khaawa khonojaa osencha.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaangi khougela kholapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Khanke mwategelaga njaanga yenaa vantu va myakha alevaweelwa kete, ‘Okhaune kelapo chakhoo, ila dugamya kelapo chakhoo paulongolo wa Mwene.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ila onene nkhovaweela, okhalape khwa kelapo, khanke okhalape khwa khotomela lina la khochanya khwa Matuunda, kho nguno a kegoda cha kewami cha Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Ninga mokhalape khwa nse, kho nguno Matuunda apenee khotulaa megolo jakwe, ninga mokhalape khwa ihala la Yelusalemu, kho nguno a ihala la Mwami molaala. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ninga mokhalape khwa mitwe jenyu, kho nguno khotopo mokhowole khogalolya ninga nyele yemwi ewee nyilu ao nyelo. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Mbe mokhopaala avyenee, ‘Gombagi’, ao mbe mokhosiita, ‘Sitagi’, kho nguno mpola jensi jenaa jelaongelekha kho egoo, amba gakhopuma khwa Khatawe.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaangi khougela kholepekelya obe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29">Luka 6:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mwategelaga njaanga yenaa kepalaa, ‘Muntu mbe alamolekha yoonge liso nanoyo alemekwe liso, ne muntu mbe alamokumpola lino moyakwe nanoyo akumpolwe lino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ila onene nkhovaweela, okhalepekelye obe khwa muntu yunaa akhonojelaga obe. Mbe muntu alakhopatola nkhofi pi itama la molyelo, mogalolye ne itama la mokege. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Khanke mbe muntu alakhositacha kho ivanza ili asole ngwanda yakhoo, molekele ne nkhoti yakhoo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Mbe muntu alakong'ang'anelya omokepolele moligo gwakwe kelometa yemwii, ogwegwe kepolaa ninga kelometa jewele. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Mbe muntu alakholomba kento, mopelee. No muntu mbe alapoga omwalumye kento, okhamwime.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela khovatogwa vanyambuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27">Luka 6:27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mwategelaga khanke njaanga yenaa kepalaa, ‘Motogagwee moyakho, ila mosimbele nyambuda wakhoo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ila onene nkhovaweela, mowee mokhovatogwa vanyambuda venyu, ne khovalombela evoo vanaa vakhovagayanjaa, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ili mopate khowa vana va Matuunda, yunaa Daada yenyu khwikala khochanya. Kho nguno omwene amwenee khovamolekela lyonse lakwe vantu vasoga ne vabe, khanke khovatonyelaa mbula vantu vasoga ne vabe. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Mbi molapata mfinga kee khwa khovatogwa topo evoo vanaa vakhovatogwa onywenywe? Ninga vakungany'a khodi nanevo vakhonojaa avivyoo. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Mbe mokhovalamochaa vadogo venyu topo, mokhonoja manoji kee khokela vaange? Ninga vantu vanaa vakhamogomba Matuunda, avivyoo nanevo vakhonoja. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Gechoo movaage vasoga khwa kela kento, kete Daada yenyu yunaa apwale khochanya venaa a mosoga khwa kela kento.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela khovaalya vapeena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mwiyangalele mokhanoje manoji masoga paulongolo pa vantu ili vantu vavawone. Mbe mokhonoja gechoo, khotopo mopokeele mfinga yeyensi khopuma kwa Daada yenyu yunaa apwale khochanya.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Panaa mokhovaalya vapeena, mokhavapalele vantu kenaa mokhonoja, kho nguno van'yaa onojaa gechoo kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi no kho njela, ili vantu vawakholye. Nkhovaweela khapanga, evenee vapataga mfinga jawe. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ila ogwegwe panaa okhovaalya vapeena, onojee inoji eloo khwa osweeki, ninga molaasi wakhoo wa khapanga akhamanye. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Vaalye vantu khwa osweeki, no Daada yakhoo yunaa agawine ganaa giswekile, alakhokolya.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovaliga vantu kholoomba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Ila panaa mokhomoloomba Matuunda, mokhawe kete muntu yunaa akwinoja mosoga ila nkha mosoga, kho nguno evenee vakhotogwa kholoomba vimelile kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi no khompelo ya njela, ili vantu vavawone. Nkhovaweela khapanga, evoo vapataga mfinga jawe. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ila ogwegwe panaa okholoomba, wingelage mokhate ya chumba chakhoo, dindaa molyango, apenee omolombe Daada yakhoo yunaa akhakhwigela. No Daada yakhoo yunaa agawine ganaa giswekile, alakhokolya.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Panaa mokholoomba mokhawe ne mpola nyinki jenaa jetokhola emaana kete vantu vanaa vakhamomanya Matuunda. Evenee vakhoheewa kete Matuunda alavategela khopumana ne mpola jawe nyinki. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mokhawe kete evenee, kho nguno Daada yenyu amanyile echoo kenaa mokhopooga ninga mbe mokhale momolombe. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Gechoo, onywenywe lombagi khwa Matuunda mkipaala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Daada yisu yunaa opwale khochanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Lina lakhoo likoliwee,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Owami wakhoo wiije,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">ganaa ogatogilwe agenee ganojeke paliwelelo, kete venaa gakhonojekha khochanya pa Matuunda.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Okhopele leelo endya yisu ya kela nsiko.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Okholekolele mabe gisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">kete venaa nasu khokhovalekolela vanaa vatonejelaga mabe.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Okhatutule mo magemo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">ila okhoponye no oyoo Mobe. Kho nguno wami, ne ngulu, ne olaala a vyakhoo nsiko jensi patokhola odugo. Avyeene gechoo.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Yesu endelelaa khopaala, Mbe mokhovalekolela vantu mabe gawe, Daada yenyu wa khochanya, nanoyo alavalekolela nanyu mabe genyu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ila mbe akhamokhovalekolela vaange vanaa vakhovanojela mabe, avivyoo no Daada yenyu yunaa apwale khochanya khotopo avalekolele nanyu mabe genyu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela khotuunga kholya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Panaa mokhotuunga kholya, osho jenyu jekhalagele khosiimba kete venaa vakhonojaa vany'aa. Venee vakhosiimba kho osho jawe ili vigele khwa vantu kete vatungaga kholya. Nkhovaweela khapanga, evoo vapokelaga mfinga jawe. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ila ogwegwe panaa okhotuunga kholya, okhopogiwa okhawale osho wakhoo no khosaakha nyele jakhoo, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ili muntu yeyensi akhamanye kete watungaga kholya, ila Daada yenyu yunaa akhakhwigela, amwenee yunaa akhopogiwa amanye topo. Apenee Daada yakhoo yunaa agawine ganaa okhonojaa kho osweeki, alakhokolya.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwitolelaji vento vyenyu khochanya khwa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33">Luka 12:33</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:34">34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Mokhitolele nsawo jenyu paliwelelo panaa moswa ne kutu panaa vekhonoona, ne viwi vakhowuna no khwiwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ila mwitolelage witoleli khochanya khwa Matuunda khonaa moswampi ne kutu vakhakhowola khojinonaanga, ninga viwi khotopo vingele khwiwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kho nguno khonaa mokhotoola vento venyu, apenee ne meoyo jenyu jelaawa.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welo gwa mowele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Liso a kete etala kho mowele gwakhoo. Mbe liso lakhoo ipanga, mowele gwakhoo gwensi gokhowa no welo. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ila mbe liso lakhoo lanonekhaga, mowele gwakhoo gwensi gokhowa ne wilo pii. Mbe welo gonaa gopwale mokhate mwakhoo yawaga kiiti, gechoo eyoo kiiti amba ituntumu modugo.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matuunda ne nsawo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Khotopo muntu yunaa nokhowolaa khovatomamela vamwene vawele, kho nguno alamosimbela yomwi no khomotogwa yoonge, ao alaawa palomwi no yomwi no khomobyeeda yoonge. Gechoo, khotopo mokhowole khomotomamela Matuunda ne nsawo khwi ituungo lemwii.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Gechoo nkhovaweela, mokhawe no wowa khougela wome wenyu kete molalya chanuu ao molang'wela chanuu, ninga mokhawe no wowa khougela mewele jenyu kete molalyala chanuu. Mbi, endya a nsoga khokela wome? Avivyoo, myenda a mesoga khokela mowele? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Jekunagi nyonyi, ejenee akhajekhovyala mbeyu ninga akhajekhokongola ninga jetokhola keheenge cha khotolela makongola. Ila Daada yenyu yunaa apwale khochanya khojepelaa endya. Mbi, onywenywee nkha vasoga khokela nyonyi ejoo? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Gechoo, ananuu movamoonga venyu nokhowolaa khwiyongelelya ituungo la wome wakwe kho nguno ya wowa?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Kho kee mokwigayanjaa kho nguno ya myenda? Kunagi maluwa ga mwipolu venaa gakhovelekha, akhagakhonoja molemo ninga akhagakhwisunela myenda. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Ila nkhovaweela, ninga Mwami Solomoni kho olaala wakwe wensi, aleakhalyala visoga kete maluwa egoo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Mbe Matuunda khogalyekha geeke matiti ga mwipolu ganaa leelo gapwale ne igolo gakhojuutwa mo moto, mbi, Matuunda khotopo avyalyeke onywenywe visoga, onywenywe vanaa mokhomogoomba Matuunda kedo?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Gechoo, mokhawe no wowa khwiwolya kete, ‘Kholaalya chanuu? Ao kholang'wela chanuu? Ao kholalyala chanuu?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kho nguno vento evyoo vensi vikhogayelwa ne vantu vanaa vakhamomanya Matuunda. Ila Daada yenyu yunaa apwale khochanya pa Matuunda amanyile kete mokhopooga vento evyoo vyensi. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ila onywenywe pogagi taali Wami wa Matuunda no khonojaa masoga ganaa agatogilwe mwenee, nanoyo alavaongelelya vento evyoo vensi. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Gechoo, mokhatungumale khougela igolo, kho nguno magayo ga igolo amba ga igolo, kela nsiko itite magayo gakwe minki.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Mokhavatengemeke vaange</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luka 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Mokhavatengeke vaange, ili nanyu Matuunda akhiije khovatengemekha. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Kho nguno molatengemekhwa kete venaa mokhovatengemekha vaange, ne njaanga yenaa mokhovapimela vaange, ayeyoo Matuunda alatengemekela. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Kho kee owine kesanje kedo kenaa kepwale mo liso la moyakhoo, ila okhakhokuuna kepata kenaa kepwale mo liso lakhoo? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Khanke nokhowola mbi khomowela moyakhoo kete, ‘Wochaa kesanje kedo kenaa kepwale mo liso lakhoo,’ okho ogwegwe mwenee otite kepata mo liso lakhoo? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Mon'yaa ogwegwe, wochaa kepata kenaa mo liso lakhoo, apenee olakowola khowona visoga no kholewoocha kesanje kedo kenaa kepwale kho moyakhoo.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mokhajipele embwa vento venaa vya Matuunda, ili vakhiije vageloke no khovalemeekha onywenywe. Ninga mokhajijutele ngolowe vento va mpia nkolo, mbe molanoja gechoo, valajesambanga.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela khomoloomba Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Molombagi Matuunda nanoyo alavapela, pogagi nanyu molapata, khowagi odi nanyu moladigolelwa molyango. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kho nguno kela muntu yunaa kholombaa, khopelwaa, no yunaa khopogaa, khopataa, no yunaa khokowa odi, khodigolelwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Mbi, khole yeyensi movamoonga venyu yunaa a daada, yunaa mwanaakwe alamolomba mokate, alamopela ibwee? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ao mbe alamolomba nshe, alamopela njokha? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Mbe onywenywe vanaa molevanoja mabe, momanyile khovapeela vana venyu vento visoga. Mbi, Daada yenyu yunaa apwale khochanya khotopo avapele masoga vensi vanaa vakhomoloomba.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Gechoo chechensi kenaa mokhopooga monojelwee ne vantu, avivyoo nanyu moganogaje khwawe, geeke avyenee venaa ekhopaala njaanga ya Musa ne maligi ga valooti va Matuunda.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Molyango mopinye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Ingelagi khwa khokelela molyango gonaa mopinye. Kho nguno njela yenaa ipetile kho magayo a ngaji, no molyango wa khwingelela omoo a mogaji, khanke vantu vanaa vakhokela kho njela eyoo a vinki. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ila njela yenaa kekhokenkha mo opanga a mpinye, ne molyango wa khwingelela omoo a mopinye, ne vantu vanaa vaemanyile njela eyoo a vatiiti.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipeke ne viligi vyakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luka 6:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mwikhalage miso ne valooti va opepi. Kho nguno ituungo lenaa vakhwija khwenyu, vakhwinoja vapolo kete nkholo, ila momeoyo jawe a vakhakha kete mapoge. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Molavatembola khwa manoji gawe. Vantu akhavakhoyawa mbwewee kho mapeke ga miyaa ao khoyawa viligi vya ntondwa kho mbegele. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Ipeke isoga olela viligi visoga, ne ipeke ibe olela viligi vibe. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Ipeke isoga khotopo lelele viligi vibe, ne ipeke ibe khotopo lelele viligi visoga. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Kela ipeke lenaa lekhalela viligi visoga, odumolwa no khosumbwa mo moto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Gechoo, molavatembola valooti va opepi, kho nguno ya manoji gawe.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkhavamanya onywenywe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Nkha kela muntu yunaa khombwelaa, ‘Mwene, Mwene,’ alaingela kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. Ila muntu yunaa khonojaa egoo ganaa Daada yaane yunaa apwale khochanya agatogilwe, oyoo amwenee alaingela omoo. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Vinki valanembwela nsiko eyoo ya tengemeki, ‘Mwene, Mwene. Khwa lina lakhoo alekhwawopala okhombe wa Matuunda, ne khwa lina lakhoo alekhwapumya mademi no khonoja matuntumu minki.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Epoo apenee ndavawela, ‘Alenkhavamanya onywenywe, wokhagi paulongolo waane onywenywe vanoja mabe.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vajeengi vawele va nyoomba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Gechoo, kela muntu yunaa khotegelelya mpola jaane no khojeloonda, khwipyanaa no muntu wa masala, yunaa ajengagaa nyoomba yakwe kho ipampaa. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Nsiko yemwii, mbula nkolo yaleyandya khotoonya, lweje jijola meje pelema, ne ipuuta ikhakha alelapuuta no khoesunkha nyoomba yakwe. Ila nyoomba yakwe aleikhagwa, kho nguno mosingi gwakwe alegojengilwe pachanya ya mogaamba.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa khotegelaa maligi gaane ne akhakhogalondaa, oyoo khwipyana no muntu moleele yunaa ajengagaa nyoomba yakwe pachanya ya oloongo. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mbula panaa aleyandyaa khotoonya, lweje jalejijola meje pelema, ipuuta ikhakha lapuuta no khoesunkha nyoomba yakwe, apaponye nyoomba yakwe aleyagwaa, no khounenkhana.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olaala wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala mpola ejoo, madale ga vantu galegakumya modugo maligi gakwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Kho nguno angile akhakholigaa kete valaangi vawe va njaanga ja Musa kete venaa vakholiga, ila angile akholiga kete muntu yunaa atite olaala.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomopon'yaa muntu wa malimwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu panaa aleatelemokhaa khopuma kho ketonda, madale minki ga vantu galegamoloonda. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Apaponye, muntu yomwii wa malimwa aleijaa, amotungamelaa Yesu no khomoweela, “Mwene, mbe otogwee, nokhowola khonenoja ngombwee khomokumbekha Matuunda.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu agololaa mokhono gwakwe amopalyaa no khomoweela, “Nkhopooga opone” Apaponye, olwile wakwe wensi, alewamosila. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Apenee Yesu akamoweela, “Kunaa, okhamowele muntu yeyensi mpola eye, ila petaa wilagele khwa mopumya matambekho venaa seji opwale, khanke petaa opumye sadakha kholageela kete waponaga, kete venaa njaanga ya Musa kelagelelya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomopon'ya motomami wa mwimeleli wa masinjala wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu panaa alekhwingela kho ihala la Kapelanaumu, mwimeleli yomwii wa masinjala wa Loma ijaa khwakwe no khomoloomba amwalye, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Akamoweela Yesu, “Mwene, khokhayaane khole motomami waane yomwii apolajaa mowele, akhwitegeela osaati mokhakha modugo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu akamoweela, “Aniija khomopon'ya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Molaala wa masinjala avawelaa, “Mwene, onene nkhalomwa khokhopokeela mokhate ya nyoomba yaane. Ila palaa mpola yemwii topo, ne motomami waane alapona. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kho nguno, ninga onene nipwale panse ya vimeleli vaange, khanke nipwale ne masinjala vanaa vapwale panse yaane. Panaa ndamowela yomwii, ‘Petaa,’ apaponye akhopeta. Ne panaa ndamowela yoonge kete, ‘Wiije,’ apaponye khwiija. Ne panaa ndamowela motomami waane, ‘Nogajaa geeke,’ avyeene khonojaa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu panaa aleategelaa mpola ejoo, aleakumya modugo no khovaweela vantu vanaa alevakhomoloonda, “Nkhovaweela khapanga, kho nse ya Izilaeli nkhawona muntu yunaa khomogombaa Matuunda kete oyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Avyenee nkhovaweela, vantu vinki valaija khopuma lwande ja keeya ne ja meli khwingela mo owami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda. Nanevo valaija kho wenga kholya no khong'weela palomwi no Abulaamu no Isaka no Yakobo kho wa wami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ila evoo vanaa owami wa Matuunda a wakhowawe, valajutwa panji kho kiiti, khonaa valakota no kholoman'ya mino kho nguno ya osaati.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Apenee Yesu akamoweela mwimeleli oyoo wa masinjala geeke, “Tuwaa khokhayakhoo, ne ewaage kete venaa wagombaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Ne ituungo alelonye alenee oyoo motomami wakwe aponaa.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopon'yaa valwile vinki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu panaa aleapikhaa khokhaye khwa Petulo, akamopikha mokhoyakwe Petulo agonagaa pa kegonelo, kho nguno ya angile molwile wa homa nkhakha. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yesu amopalya mokhono maye oyoo, apaponye aponaa homa. Apenee akaimelela no khwandya khomwandalela Yesu endya.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Panaa yaleyapikha mesee, valevamoletela Yesu valwile vinki vanaa angile vatite mademi. Nanoyo aleagapumya mademi egoo khwa khopaala mpola topo no khovapon'ya valwile vensi. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Aleanojaa gechoo ili jidugame mpola jenaa jalejapalagwa no Isaya molooti wa Matuunda kete, “Atopon'yajaa malwile gisu, ne atonogajaa khowee vapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanaa vakhopogiwaa khomoloonda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu panaa aleawonaa kete vantu vinki vamopilimaga, aleavalagelelya vahemba vakwe vapete kho nkelo ya ilambo. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Molaangi yomwii wa njaanga ja Musa, aleamopetela Yesu no khomoweela, “Molaangi, onene ndakholonda kwekwensi khonaa olaawa opetile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu akamoweela, “Mpunja vatite mpinga ne nyonyi vatite vityoo, ila Mwana wa Muntu, atokhola ninga lwande lwa khogona no khosuupa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Apenee mohemba yoonge wa Yesu akamoweela, “Meyaa, nkholoomba ongombele taali nipete nemozyeke daada yaane.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ila Yesu akamoweela, “Ndondee, valeke vachi vavazyeke vachi vawe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhogilya kewalawumbe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Apenee Yesu akaingela mo ipogo, nanevo vahemba vakwe alevamoloonda. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Panaa valevapikha pakhate ya ilambo, timpu, alechapumeela kewalawumbe ne magelekha makolo ga momeje no khwandya khoekuumba ipogo. Ila Yesu angile agonagaa ndoolo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Vahemba vakwe vamolawelya no khomoweela, “Mwene, okhopon'ye.” “Khokhofwa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu akavaweela, “Onywee vantu vanaa mokhogoomba kedo, kho kee mokhotungumala?” Apenee Yesu akaimelela no kholekhakela lekewalawumbe, ne ikhwa yapola, khwawa visoga.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Vahemba vakwe valevakumya no khopaala, “Mbi oyo a muntu wa mbi? Yunaa ninga kewalawumbe ne ikhwa vekhomotegelelya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovapon'ya vantu vawele vanaa vatite mademi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu panaa alealowokha ilambo, apikha kho nse ya Vagadala, no okhoo aleitanga ne vantu vawele vanaa vatite mademi, vantu evoo angile vapumile kho malalo, vantu evoo angile vatite mademi makhakha, ninga khotopo muntu yunaa aleagemaa khokela kho njela eyoo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Apenee mademi egoo galegandya khololoma khwa khopaala, “Mbi, ogwegwe Mwana wa Matuunda, otite kee nasu? Mbi, wijaga khotogaya panaa ituungo lekhale lepike?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Pepi ne epoo, alelepwale idale ikolo la ngolowe jekhwipogela endya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Apenee mademi egoo alegamoloomba Yesu, gapaala, “Mbe okhotupumya khogombelee khopete khwingele kho ngolowe ejoo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yesu akagaweela, “Petagi,” apenee mademi egoo, galegapuma mokhate ya vantu evoo no khopeta khwingela mo ngolowe. Idale lensi la ngolowe lalelasulumokha kho mosulumokho no khwingela mo ilambo, ne ngolowe jensi jafweela omoo.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Vasoongi va ngolowe evoo, valevakembela vapeta kho ihala, no okhoo valevavapalela vantu mpola jensi jenaa jalejapumeela khwa vantu evoo vawele vanaa angile vatite mademi. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Apenee vantu vensi va ihala eloo, valevapuma no khopeta khwitaanga no Yesu, nanevo panaa valevamowona, vamoloomba apume kho nse yawe.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomopon'ya muntu yunaa apolile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Apenee Yesu aleatantaa ipogo, alowokhaa ilambo no khotuuwa kho ihala lakwe la Kapelanaumu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Panaa aleapikha okhoo, vantu vamoonga vamoletela muntu yunaa angile apolile oko agonilee kho mokekha. Yesu akamoweela oyoo yunaa angile apolilee, “Mwanaane ipele mooyo, wawokelajwaa mabe gakhoo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Apenee vamoonga va valaangi va njaanga ja Matuunda jenaa aleapelwaa Musa vanaa angile vapwale epoo, vipalela momeoyo jawe, “Muntu oyo akhomotokha Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ila Yesu aleamanya gensi ganaa alevakhoheewa, avawolya, “Kho kee mokhoheewa mabe momeoyo jenyu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />A kento kee kenaa kepelu khwenyu, ‘Khomoweela wawokelajwaa mabe gakhoo,’ ao khomoweela imelelaa opete. <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ila nkhopooga momanye kete Mwana wa Muntu atite olaala kholekolela mabe ga vantu.” Apenee Yesu akamoweela muntu oyoo yunaa angile apolajaa mowele, “Imelelaa osole mokekha gwakhoo, opete khokhayakhoo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Apaponye muntu oyoo akaimelela no khopeta khokhayakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Vantu vensi kho idale eloo panaa valevawona mpola eyoo, vakatungumala no khomokolya Matuunda, yunaa avapelaga vantu olaala wa gechoo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomweta Mateo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu panaa aleawokhaa epoo, ne panaa angile apetile, akamowonaa muntu yomwii yunaa khwetwaa Mateo, ikhalagaa kho nyoomba ya khokunganelya kodi. Yesu amoweela, “Ndonde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Nanoyo Mateo imelela no khomoloonda.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Apenee, Yesu panaa ikhalaga kholya endya khokhaye khwa Mateo, vakungan'ya khodi vinki ne vanoja mabe, valeviija kholya endya palomwi nanoyo ne vahemba vakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Mafalisayo panaa valevawona kento echoo, vawaweela vahemba va Yesu, “Kho kee molaangi wenyu akholya endya palomwi ne vakungan'ya khodi ne vanoja mabe?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu panaa aleategela mpola ejoo, avaweela, “Vantu vanaa nkha valwile vakhamoloma mogaanga ila valwile avenee vamolomile. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Petagi, mwilige emaana ya Maandekho ga Matuunda ganaa gakhopaala, ‘Nkhopooga mowee losongo khokela khopumya sadakha.’ Alenkhiija khovaeta vantu vanaa vasoga, ila vanoja mabe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwelyo khougela khotuunga kholya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Nsiko yemwii vahemba va Yohana Mobatiji viija khwa Yesu, vamowolya, “Kho kee osweswe ne Mafalisayo khokhotuunga kholya, ila vahemba vakhoo akhavakutuunga kholya?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu akavaweela, “Vahenja va mwenga wa kegwisha, khotopo vakhowole khombolelya, panaa vapwale palomwi no mwenga wa kegwisha? Ila nsiko iliija panaa mwenga wa kegwisha alawochwa khwawe, ituungo aleloo alenee valatunga kholya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Khotopo muntu yunaa khosolaa kelakha kepya no khoketoola kho mwenda mosakhalu, kho nguno kelakha kepya kelagonoja mwenda mosakhalu khongeleke khodemokha. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ninga vantu vakhavakhotuula divai mpyaa momefukho jenaa janogelelajwa khwa ntila jenaa nsakhalu. Mbe valanoja gechoo, mefukho ejoo jelademokha ne divai eliitekha ne mefukho yensi jelademokha. Ila a visoga khotuula divai mpyaa mo mefukho mepyaa ja ntila, nanevyo vensi vekhotulwa visoga.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomopon'ya mokhiima no khomofufola mwalele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu panaa angile akhale khopalaa mpola ejoo, Mwimeleli yomwii wa Keyahudi aleapikhaa, atungumaa paulongolo wakwe, akamoweela, “Mwalele waane afwagaa ituungo aleele, ila nkhokholoomba khopete omotolele mokhono gwakhoo nanoyo alaawa mopanga khanke.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Apenee Yesu awokhaa, palomwi ne vahemba vakwe vamoloonda mwimeleli oyoo.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ituungo aleloo mokhiima yomwii yunaa angile molwile wa mosongelo kho ituungo la myakha ikomi je jewele, akamolonda Yesu khonyuma no khopalya ipeembo la mwenda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Mokhiima oyoo alekhwipalelaa momooyo gwakwe kete, “Mbe nemopalye topo mwenda gwakwe, ndapona.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Apaponye panaa aleamopalya, Yesu akagalokha. Apenee akamowona no khomoweela, “Mokhiima ipelage mooyo, waponaga kho nguno wangombaga.” Apaponye mwalele oyoo, aponaa.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Apenee Yesu panaa aleapikha kho nyoomba ya mwimeleli oyoo wa Keyahudi, aleavapikha vakowa mbuuto, vakhwemba nyeembo ja kelelo, ne vantu vinki vakonganaga pa kelelo echoo, oko vakhokoota modugo. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mopume epa. Mwalele oyo akhafwa, ila agonaga ndoolo topo.” Vantu evoo panaa valevategeela gechoo, vamosekha Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ne vantu evoo panaa valevadagwa mokhate, Yesu ingelaa khombele no khomowaamba mwalele oyoo mokhono, nanoyo akalawela. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Mpola ejoo jasambaala kho nse eyoo yensi.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovapon'ya vatulu vawele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu panaa alekhowokhaa epoo, vatulu vawele vamoloonda, oko vakojoma no khopaala, “Wee, Mwana wa Daudi, khowonelee losongo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu panaa aleingela mokhate ya nyoomba, vatulu evoo vamopetela. Nanoyo avawolya, “Mbi, mokhogombaa kete ankhowola khovapon'yaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Nanevo vamoweela, “Avyenee Meyaa tokhogoomba.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Papenee Yesu akavapalya miso gawe no khopaala, “Inojeke gechoo kete venaa mokhogoomba.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Apaponye miso gawe gadigokha no khwandya khokuuna. Yesu akavagilya khwa okhakha kete, “Mokhamowele muntu yeyensi mpola eje.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ninga gechoo vapeta no khwandya khosambalya mpola ja Yesu kho nse eyoo yensi.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomopon'ya kameme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Vantu panaa angile vakhowookha, vamoonga va vantu valevamoletela Yesu muntu yomwii yunaa angile kameme, kho nguno angile asalenkhanagwa ne idemi. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yesu panaa alealedaga idemi eloo, apaponye muntu oyoo andyaa khopaala khanke, vantu vensi vanaa angile vapwale epoo valevakumyaa modugo no khopaala, “Khokhale khowonage mpola kete eye kho, nse yensi ya Izilaeli.” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ila Mafalisayo vaawa vakhopaala, “Khogadagaa mademi khwa ngulu ja molaala wa mademi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovawonela losongo vantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu angile khopilimaa kho mahala ne vikhaye vyensi, alekhovaliga vantu kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi, akhovatengela vantu Mpola Nsoga ya owami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda ne angile akhopon'ya malwile gensi. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Yesu panaa aleawona idale la vantu, avawonela losongo, kho nguno angile vakhogaya ne angile khotopo muntu wa khovaalya. Angile vapwale kete nkholo jenaa jetokhola mosoongi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Apenee akavaweela vahemba vakwe, “Makongola a minki, ila vatomami vatiiti. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Gechoo, molombagi owa mogoonda, ili atome vatomami vakongole makongola gakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Vakhombe ikomi ne vawele va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu aleavetaa vakhombe vakwe ikomi ne vawele, avapelaa olaala wa khodaga mademi no khopon'ya malwile gensi. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Ega agenee mina ga evoo vakhombe vakwe ikomi ne vawele, wa mwandyo, Simoni yunaa khwetwaa Petulo, no Andelea modogwakwe, no Yakobo mwana wa Zebedayo, no Yohana molunakwe no Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo no Batolomayo, no Tomasi, no Mateo yunaa angile mokungan'ya khodi no Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo no Tadeo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni Mokananayo no Yuda Isikalioti yunaa aleamogalokha Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovatoma vakhombe ikomi ne vawele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu aleavatomaa vakhombe evoo ikomi ne vawele no khovapeela malagelelyo ega, Mokhapete kho vantu vanaa nkha Vayahudi, khanke mokhingele kho mahala ga Samalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ila petagi khwa vantu va Izilaeli, kho nguno vapwale kete nkholo jenaa japwelaga. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Panaa amba mopetile khwawe, tengagi khwa khopaala, ‘Owami wa pachanya khwa Matuunda watelelaga.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Pon'yaji valwile, mofufole vachi, pon'yaji ewa malimwa vagombwe khokumbekha Matuunda no khopumya mademi. Mwapokelaga olaala owo patokola kholepa kento, nanyu vaalaji patokhola khovaweela valepe kento. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mokhakepole momefukho jenyu zahabu, ninga mpia, ninga kechele yeyensi momefukho yenyu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Khanke mokhakepole miligo ao myenda jewele, ao velato, ao nkhome. Kho nguno kela motomami akhopogiwa khopeelwa vento venaa akhovepoga, khwa vantu vanaa akhovapetela.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Panaa molaingela kho ihala lelensi ao khaye, pogagi mbe apwale muntu yeyensi yunaa akhovapokeela onywenywe, nanyu mwikhalage khwakwe mpakha panaa molawokha okhoo. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Panaa mokhwingela kho nyoomba, ‘Movalamoche khwa khovaweela wikhalo mosoga owee nanyu.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Mbe vantu va khaye eyoo, valavagomba, wikhalo wenyu mosoga oliikhala palomwi nanevo. Ila mbe valasita khovagomba, wikhalo wenyu, olavatuwela onywenywe. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Mbe muntu yeyensi alasita khovapokeela ao khovategelelya, apenee panaa amba mokhowookha kho khaye eyoo ao ihala eloo, mwiije mokung'untage lonkoonde momegolo jenyu kete lomekho ya malaangi khwawe. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, kho nsiko ya itengemekho, vantu va ihala eloo valapata magayo makolo khokela ganaa valevapata vantu va ihala la Sodoma ne Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magayo ganaa giijile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maluko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Tegeleli, nkhovatoma kete nkholo pakhate ya mapoge. Gechoo movaage vasogu kete njokha, ne movaage vapolo kete njewa. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mwiyangalelage ne vantu, kho nguno valavagweela no khovakenkha kho mavanza, khanke valafwemba ne nkhome ja ntila kho nyoomba ja khwitangela Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Kho nguno mwangombaga, gechoo molakenkhwa paulongolo ya valaala va nse ne vami, ili mokhowole khovaweela Mpola Nsoga, vantu vanaa nkha Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ila panaa valavagweela no khovakeenkha khwi ivanza, mokhatungumale molapala chanuu ao molapala mbi. Matuunda alavapela mpola ja khopaala kho ituungo eloo. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kho nguno amba nkha onywenywe vanaa molapala, ila a Moye wa Matuunda yunaa a Isenyu, amwenee yunaa alapala khokelela khwenyu.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Kho ituungo eloo ilapumela kete, modogo alamogalokha modogwakwe ili awolagwe, no daada alamogalokha mwanaakwe, nanevo vana valavakhokholanga valeli vawe no khovawolaga. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Vantu vensi valavasimbela onywenywe kho nguno mwangombaga onene. Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa alikhamelelya mpakha kho odugo, oyoo amwenee alaponiwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Mbe valavanojela vibe kho ihala lemwii, kembelelagi kho ihala leenge. Nkhovaweela khapanga, khotopo momale molemo gwenyu kho mahala gensi ga Izilaeli panaa Mwana wa Muntu alaawa akhale apikhe.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mohemba nkha molaala khokela molaangi wakwe, no motomami nkha molaala khokela mwene wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ila mohemba atogwee khowa kete molaangi wakwe, avivyonye no motomami atogwee khowa kete meyaa wakwe. Mbe molaala wa khaye etagwaa Belizebuli. Mbi, onywenywe, khotopo vaveete vantu vanaa vapwale kho nyoomba yakwe mina mabe?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yunaa akhopogiwa khotungumalwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Gechoo, mokhavatungumale vantu evoo. Kela kento kenaa kekundekilwe, kelakundokolwa, ne kela kenaa keswekilwe, kelamanyekha. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Gensi ganaa nkhovaweela onywenywe kho kiiti, gapalagi pa welo. Khanke gensi ganaa nkhovaweela khwa khopwepweta, gapalagi pa welo. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mokhavatungumale vanaa vakhowolaga mowele, ila vakhakhowola khowolaga moye. Ila onywenywe momotungumalagi Matuunda aleemwi topo, kho nguno omwene amwenee nokhowolaa khonoona mowele palomwi no moye kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi patokhola odugo. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />“Wilombe vawele vakhogolwa khwa mpia nndo. Ila khotopo ninga yomwiwawe yunaa alaagwa panse patokola Daada yenyu khomanya. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ila onywenywe ninga nyele ja metwe jenyu jensi, javalajwaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Gechoo mokhatungumale, kho nguno onywenywe a vasoga khokela idale la wilombe evoo.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khomogoomba ao khomosiita Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Muntu yeyensi yunaa alapala paulongolo ya vantu kete onene nde wakhowakwe, nane ndapala paulongolo ya Daada yaane yunaa apwale khochanya kete a wakhowane. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa khonsitaa paulongolo ya vantu, nane ndamosita paulongolo wa Daada yaane yunaa apwale khochanya.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alenkhaleta wologo ila wikhalo mosoga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mokhahewe kete nijaga kho liwelelo ele kho nguno ya kholeeta wikhalo mosoga. Onene nkhiija kholeeta wikhalo mosoga, ila kholeeta wologo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kho nguno nijaga kholeeta wologo kate ya molomyana no isewe, mwalele no nyinya, kate ya mokhoi no mokhoyakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Ne vanyambuda va muntu, a vantu va khokhayakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Yeyensi yunaa amotogilwe onyinya ao ise khokela onene, akhapogiwa awee mohemba waane, khanke yeyensi yunaa amotogilwe molomyana wakwe ao mwalele wakwe khokela onene, avivyoo nanoyo akhapogiwa awee mohemba waane. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khositaa khokepola mosalaba gwakwe no khondoonda, oyoo akhapogiwa awee mohemba waane. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Kho nguno yeyensi yunaa awotogwile opanga wakwe, alawopwelya, ila yeyensi yunaa alawopwelya opanga wakwe kho nguno yaane, oyoo amwenee alawopon'ya opanga wakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanaa valapokela mfinga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maluko 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Muntu yeyensi yunaa akhovapokela onywenywe, akhonipokela onene, avivyonye, ne yeyensi yunaa khonipokela onene, khomopokela yunaa andagelelaja. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Yeyensi yunaa akhomopokela molooti wa Matuunda, kho nguno a molooti. Matuunda alamopela mfinga kete yenaa alapelwa molooti. Yunaa okhomopokela muntu mosoga kho nguno a muntu mosoga, Matuunda alamopela mfinga kete yenaa alapelwa yunaa a mosoga. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Yeyensi yunaa alamopela yomwii wa vantu ewa kekhombe cha meje majijimu kho nguno a moloondi waane, nkhovaweela khapanga, Matuunda khotopo aleke khomopeela mfinga.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Vakhombe vanaa valevatomwa khopuma khwa Yohana Mobatiji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khovapeela malagelelyo vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele, akawokhaa epoo, akapeta kho mahala gaange ga Galilaya kholiga ne khovatengela vantu.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohana Mobatiji, panaa angile atungagwa mo khandulunge, aleategelaa egoo ganaa Kilisto angile akhonoja. Apenee akavatoma vahemba vakwe vapete khwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Vakamowolye, “Mbi ogwegwe amwenee Kilisto oyoo yunaa oliija, ao tomolinde yoonge?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu akavaweela, “Tuwagi mokamoweele Yohana mpola jensi jenaa mokhotegeela no khogawona. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Mokamoweele geeke, vatulu vakhokuuna, ne vatewe vakhogeenda, ne ewa malimwa vakhoponaga, ne vankiwa vakhotegeela, ne vachi vakhofufokha, ne vapeena vakhotengelwa Mpola Nsoga ya Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Atite otogwi muntu yunaa akhakhonsita onene.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Vahemba va Yohana panaa angile vawokhaga, Yesu andya khogaweela madale ga vantu mpola ja Yohana. Akavaweela kete, “Alemwapeta pipalangwa khokuuna chanuu? Mbi, alemwapeta khokuuna isanje lenaa lekhoyunganywa ne ipuuta? Khotopo, alemokhapeta khokuuna egoo, <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Gechoo, alemwapeta khokuuna chanuu? Mbi, alemwapeta khomokuuna muntu yunaa angile alyalilee mwenda mosoga ja bei nkolo? Khotopo, vantu vanaa vakholyaala myenda ja bei nkolo, vakhwikhala kho nyoomba ja kewami. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Gechoo, alemwapeta khokuuna chanuu? Mbi alemwapeta khomokuuna molooti? Avyenee, ila nkhovaweela kete, Yohana angile molaala khokela molooti. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />No oyoo amwenee yunaa Maandekho ga Matuunda, Matuunda aleapalaa, ‘Ndamotoma mokhombe waane akholongole ili akhonogelelye njela.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, vantu vensi vanaa valelagwa paliwelelo, khotopo muntu molaala ninga yomwi yunaa khomokelaa Yohana Mobatiji. Ninga gechoo, muntu yunaa a modo modugo kho owami wa pachanya khwa Matuunda, amwenee molaala khokela Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Mpuma nsiko jenaa Yohana Mobatiji angile khotengaa mpakha leelo eye, owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda okhokholangwa khwa ngulu, ne vantu vanaa vatite ngulu vakhogema khowosukha khwa ngulu. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kho nguno vetabu vyensi vya valooti ne njaanga ja Matuunda jenaa aleapelwaa Musa, mpakha ituungo la Yohana Mobatiji, alejapalela mpola jenaa jelapumela nsiko eje. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Gechoo, mbe mokhowogoomba okhombe wa valooti ne njaanga ja Matuunda jenaa aleapelwaa Musa, gombagi kete Yohana amwenee Elia, oyoo yunaa valooti angile vakhopaala kete aliija. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Owa matwi ga khotegeela, ategeele.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Ila negopyanekelye ne chanuu, vantu va keleli eke? Vipyanile ne vana vanaa vakhwikhala kho lwande yenaa vantu vakhogola no khogolya vento, vakhovetaa vayawe ne khovaweela, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Alekhwavakowela ntuntu, ila alemokhigeya. Alekhweemba nyeembo ja kelelo, ila alemokhakota.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kho nguno Yohana Mobatiji aleiija, akatuunga kholya ninga khon'gweela divai, nanevo vakapaala, ‘Oyo atite idemi.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana wa Muntu aleiija, akholya no khon'gweela divai, nanevo vakapalaa, ‘Kunagi, oyoo a modobo no mokholwee, a molaasi wa vakungan'ya khodi ne vanojaa mabe.’ Ila masala ga Matuunda yaleyalageelwa kete a nsoga khopumana ne manoji gakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahala ga vantu vanaa vakhavakhomogoomba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Papenee Yesu aleandya khovakhakela vantu va mahala ganaa galegakhonoja matuntumu minki, kho nguno vantu va okho valevakhagelokha no khogalekha mabe gawe. Akapalaa, <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Molakewona onywee vantu va Kolazini ne va Betisaida. Kete matuntumu ganaa galeganojekha khwenyu angaganojeke kho mahala ga Tilo ne Sidoni, vantu va mahala egoo anga amba vagalokhaga no kholekha mabe gawe khwa kholyaala myenda ja magunela no khwipakha mawu, kholageela kete vakhosaaya khwa mabe gawe. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ninga gechoo nkhovaweela, nsiko ya itengemekho onywenywe molapelwa itengekho ikolo khokela itengemekho yenaa valapelwa vantu va Tilo ne Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />No onywenywe vantu va Kapelanaumu, mokhoheewa kete Matuunda alavatantya mpakha khochanya khwakwe? Khotopo, Matuunda alavatelemola mpakha momoto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi patokhola odugo. Kho nguno matuntumu ganaa alenaganoja khwenyu angaganojeke kho ihala la Sodoma, ihala eloo angaamba lepwale mpakha leelo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Gechoo nkhovaweela, kho nsiko ya itengemekho, onywenywe molatengemekhwa vikhamu khokela vantu va Sodoma.<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiije khwaane mosuupe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21">Luka 10:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Kho ituungo eloo Yesu aleapalaa, Nkhokhosongela Daada, yunaa okhwimelela khochanya ne pa liwelelo, kho nguno wavaswekhaga mpola eje vantu va vamasala ne vamanyi, ila wavalagelaga ega vantu vanaa vatokhola masala ne vanaa nkha vamanyi. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Avyenee Daada, egoo gensi gapumelaga kete venaa otogilwe.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Papenee Yesu akavaweela vantu kete, “Daada yaane anipelaga vento vyensi. Khotopo muntu yunaa amomanyile Mwana, ila Daada mwenee aleemwi. Khanke khotopo muntu yunaa amomanyile Daada, ila Mwana mwenee aleemwi, no muntu yeyensi yunaa Mwana atogilwe khomolageela Daada khwakwe.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Mwiije khwaane vensi vanaa mokhogaya no khokhatala khwa khokepola meligo metembu, nane ndavasupya. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Nogaji egoo ganaa nkhovaliga khonoja. Tegelelaji okhombe waane, no khwiliga khopuma khwaane ganaa ga khapanga, onene a mosoga, ninga nkhankhwinoja khowa molaala, apenee molaawa no wikhalo mosoga. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Khotopo niije nevawele monoje mpola jenaa nkhamu, ninga khotopo niije nevawele mokepole meligo metembu ja khovakonya.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela Nsiko ya Khosuupa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Nsiko yemwii ya Khosuupa, Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe angile vakhokela kho megoonda ja ogosi. Vahemba vakwe valevategeela njala, vandya khoyawa mansale ga ngano no kwandya kholya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Mafalisayo panaa valegawona egoo, vakamoweela Yesu, “Kunaa, vahemba vakhoo vakhonoja mpola jenaa jekhalomwa khonojwa Nsiko ya Khosuupa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu akavawolya, “Mbi, mokhasoma kho Maandekho ga Matuunda, venaa Daudi aleanoja ituungo lenaa omwene ne vayakwe angile vakhotegeela njala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Daudi aleingela kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda, papenee omwene ne vayakwe valyaa mekate yenaa yaleyapumajwa khwa Matuunda. Valevalyaa mekate yenaa njaanga ja Matuunda jenaa aleapelwaa Musa jalejekhawagombela valyee, ila topo vapumya matambekho. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Khanke mokhasoma kho ketabu cha njaanga ja Musa, kete vapumya matambekho va mo Nyoomba ya Matuunda angile vakhonoona njaanga kho Nsiko ya Khosuupa, ninga gechoo, Matuunda akhavavalya kete vanogaja mabe? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Gechoo nkhovaweela kete, epa apwale yomwii yunaa molaala khokela Nyoomba ya Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Mbe angamomanye emaana ya Maandekho ga Matuunda, ganaa gakhopaala, ‘Nkhopooga molageele losongo khokela khopumyaa sadakha.’ Anga khotopo movatengemeke vantu vanaa vatokhola obe wewensi. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kho nguno Mwana wa Muntu amwenee Mwene wa Nsiko ya Khosuupa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomopon'ya muntu yunaa apolile mokhono</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu akawookha epoo, akapeta kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mokhate omoo angile khole muntu yunaa angile apolile mokhono. Vantu vamoonga vanaa angile vapwale omoo, angile vakhopooga nguno ya khomositachaa Yesu, gechoo vakamowolya Yesu, “Mbi, njaanga ja Musa, jekhogoomba khomopon'ya muntu Nsiko ya Khosuupa?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu akavaweela, “A nanuu movamoonga venyu, yunaa kete nkholo wakwe, agwelaga mwilende kho Nsiko ya Khosuupa, akhakhowola khomogweela no khomopumya omoo. <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Ila muntu a mosoga khokela nkholo. Gechoo njaanga ja Musa jekhogombela khonoja masoga Nsiko ya Khosuupa.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Papenee Yesu akamoweela oyoo muntu, “Goloola mokhono gwakhoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Nanoyo awogolola, ne apaponye waawa mopanga kete owoo woonge. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Papenee Mafalisayo vapuma panji, no khopalana venaa valamowolaga Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Motomami yunaa asagolagwa no Matuunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu panaa aleamanya kete Mafalisayo vakhopalana venaa valamowolaga, akawookha epoo. Vantu vinki vakamoloonda, nanoyo akavapon'ya vensi vanaa angile valwile. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Ila akavagilya kete, vakhavaweele vantu mpola jakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Yesu aleanoja gechoo, ili gadugame egoo khwa khokelela Isaya molooti wa Matuunda kete,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Kunaa, oyo amwenee motomami waane yunaa namosagolaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">oyo amwenee motogwi waane yunaa agotogajaa mooyo gwaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Ndatola Moye waane pachanya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">nanoyo alavawela vantu va nse jensi khwa mpola ya itengemekho laane.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Khotopo akindane khwa mpola ne vantu, ninga khokowa madoolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">ninga khotopo yunaa alategela lolii lwakwe mo njela.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Khotopo avalemeke vantu vapeena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">alaawa mosoga khwa vantu vanaa vatokhola ngulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mpakha panaa alanoja matengemekho ganaa gakhogombwaa nanoyo gakhowole khokiinda,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />vantu va nse jensi valamosowelela kete alavapon'ya.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu no Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maluko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Apenee vantu vamoonga vamoletela Yesu muntu yomwi yunaa angile asalenkhanagaa ne idemi. Muntu oyoo angile mutulu, avivyoo angile khameme. Yesu amopon'yaa ne apaponye andya no khopaala no khowona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Vantu vensi vanaa angile vapwale epoo, valevakumyaa modugo no khopaala, “Mbi, oyo amwenee Mwana wa Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ila Mafalisayo panaa valevategeela mpola ejoo, vakapaala, “Muntu oyo akhodaga mademi khwa ngulu ja Belizebuli, yunaa a molaala wa mademi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu angile amanyile kenaa angile vakhoheewa, gechoo akavaweela, “Mbe vantu va owami womwii valibegola madale, madale, owami owoo olaagwa, khanke mbe vantu va khaye yemwi valibegola madale, gechoo, owami owoo olasambala. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Mbe, Khatawe khomobidinjaa Khatawe, khwimalya mwenee, gechoo, owami wakwe olaagwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Mbe mokhopala onene nkhopumya mademi khwa olaala wa Belizebuli, mbi vahemba venyu vakhopumya mademi khwa olaala wa a nanuu? Kho nguno eyoo, evoo avenee vanaa valavatengemekha onywenywe. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ila mbe onene nkhopumya mademi khwa olaala wa Moye wa Matuunda, manyagi kete owami wa Matuunda wijaga khwenyu.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Khotopo muntu yunaa nokhowolaa khwingela kho nyoomba ya muntu yunaa atite ngulu no khomosukha vento vyakwe, ila mbe amotunge oyoo muntu yunaa atite ngulu. Epoo apenee alakhowola khomosukha vento vyakwe vyensi.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Muntu yeyensi atapoya palomwi nane, akhonsiita, ne yeyensi yunaa akhakhokungan'ya palomwi nane, alavasambalya. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Kho nguno eyoo nkhovaweela, Matuunda nokhowola khovalekolela vantu mabe gawe gensi ne matoki gawe, ila akhakhowola khovalekolela vantu mabe gawe mbe vakhomotokha Moye wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Khanke Matuunda nokhowola khovalekolela vantu vanaa vakomotokha Mwana wa Muntu, ila akhakhowola khovalekolela evoo vanaa vakhomotokha Moye wa Matuunda iwee mwituungo ele ao lenaa liijile.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipeke ne viligi vyakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Nogaji ipeke lewee isoga ne viligi vyakwe velaawa visoga, ao nogaji ipeke lewee ibe ne viligi vyakwe velaawa vibe. Kho nguno ipeke lekhomanyekha khopumana ne viligi vyakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Onywenywe vanaa mopwale kete olelo wa njokha. Mokhokhowola mbi khopaala mpola nsoga, oko onywenywe a vanoja mabe? Kho nguno muntu khopaala ganaa gijwile mo mooyo gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Muntu mosoga akhopaala vento vesoga khopuma mo maheewo gakwe masoga. No muntu mobe akhoheewa maheewo mabe khopuma mo maheewo gakwe mabe.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Gechoo nkhovaweela, nsiko ya itengemekho vantu valapogiwa khopalela kela mpola yenaa nkha nsoga yenaa alemwapaala. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kho nguno Matuunda alatomela mpola jakhoo khokhotengemekha.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lomekho khopuma khwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Maluko 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 8:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Papenee vamoonga va valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo vakamoweela Yesu, “Molaangi,” vapaala, “tokopooga onojee lomekho kholageela kete wapumaga khwa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu akavaweela, “Onywenywee keleli cha vantu vabe ne vanaa nkha vakhapanga khwa Matuunda, mbi, mokhopooga lomekho? Khotopo mopelwee lomekho yeyensi, ila topo eyoo lomekho ya Yona molooti wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kete venaa Yona aleikhalaa mo ndaa ya nshe mokolo khwi ituungo la nsiko jetato, otiko ne lyonse, avyenee avivyoo Mwana wa Muntu aliikhala nsiko jetato mo oloongo, otiko ne lyonse. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Kho nsiko yenaa Matuunda alatengemekha, vantu va ihala la Ninawi valaimelela palomwi ne vantu va keleli eke no khoketengemekha, kho nguno evenee valevagalokha no khogalekha mabe gawe, panaa valevategeela mateengi ga Yona. Ila nkhovaweela onywenywe, epa apwale yunaa molaala khokela Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Khanke kho nsiko eyoo ya matengemekho, mwami wa kekhiima wa nse ya Sheba, aliimelela no khovatengemekha vantu va keleli eke kete vanoja mabe. Kho nguno omwenee aleapuma kho nse ya khotale ili iije ategelelye maligi ega masala ga mwami Solomoni. Ila nkhovaweela onywenywe kete, epa apwale molaala khokela Solomoni.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khotuuwa khwa idemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Idemi panaa lekhomopuma muntu, lekhopeta pitenengwa, ili khopooga lwande ya khosuupa. Mbe alalekha khoepata, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />apenee khwipalela, ‘Ndatuuwa khokhayaane khonaa napumaga.’ Nanoyo panaa atuwile no khoyepikha itokhola kento, naneyo ipyagilwe no kholeembwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Gechoo, apetile khosola mademi gaange saba ganaa mabe khokela elenee, gensi gakhwingela khwa muntu oyoo, gakhwikhala omoo. Apenee wome wa muntu oyoo, okhogelokhaa khowa mobe khokela wome wa mwandyo. Gechoo avyenee elaawa kho vantu va keleli eke kebe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maye wa Yesu ne vadogwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu panaa angile akhale akhopaala ne idale la vantu evoo, onyinya ne vadogwakwe viija, vimelela panji vakapooga khopaala nanoyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Apenee muntu yomwii akamoweela Yesu, “Kunaa, onyokho ne vadogwakhoo vapwale panji, vakhopooga khopaala nagwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu akamoweela, “Maye waane ne vadogwaane a vananuu?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Apenee avagololela vahemba vakwe mokhono, akavaweela, “Ewa epaa avenee a nyinya ne vadogwaane. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Gechoo, muntu yeyensi yunaa akhonoja ganaa agatogilwe Daada yaane wa khochanya, oyoo amwenee mokolwane, khaloombo yaane no maye waane.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mofwano wa muntu yunaa aleapeta khominja mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Nsiko ayeyoo, Yesu aleapuma mokhate ya nyoomba apeta khwikhala kho mpelo ya ilambo no khwandya kholiga. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Madale ga vantu galegikhongan'ya no khomopilima, apenee atanta kho ipogo ikhala omoo, ne vantu vensi angile vimelela kho mpelo ya ilambo. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Nanoyo Yesu akavaliga mpola nyinki vantu vensi khwa mefwano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Tegeleli, muntu yomwii aleapeta khominja mbeyu momogoonda. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Panaa angile khominja mbeyu momogoonda gwakwe, mbeyu jiinge jalejagweela monjela ne nyonyi jiija jalyaa. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Mbeyu jiinge jalejagweela kho oloongo wonaa angile nkha mwinki. Mbeyu ejoo jalejaleemba nyango kho nguno oloongo angile kedo. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Ila panaa lyonse lalelajema, memelo eyoo yaleyanyaala no khokhala, kho nguno milii jakwe angile ikhatwina panse. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbeyu jiinge jalejagweela kho oloongo wonaa angile otite miyaa, miyaa eyoo jalejakhola no khwibananga memelo ejoo. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Jiinge jalejagweela mo oloongo mosoga, jaleemba, jalela, yeenge yalela nsanka igana ne yeenge yalela nsanka makomi sita ne yeenge yalela nsanka makomi gatato. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Owa matwi, ategeele.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguno ya Yesu khotomela mefwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Vahemba va Yesu vakamopetela no khomowolya, “Kho kee okhopaala ne vantu khwa khotomela mefwano?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu akavaweela, Matuunda avapelaga onywenywe omanyi no khogamanya ganaa giswekile khougela owami wakwe, ila vantu vaange akhavapela omanyi owo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Khanke akavaweela, “Muntu yunaa atite kento alaongelelwa ne keenge, nanoyo alaawa atite vento vinki. Ila yeyensi yunaa atokhola kento, alasukhwa ninga kenaa amba atite. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Eye eyenee nguno nkhopaala nanevo khwa mefwano, kho nguno, vakukuuna ganaa nkhonoja, ila akhavagawine. Avivyoo, vakhotegeela ganaa nkhopaala, ila vakhamanya emaana yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ega gakhonojekha gechoo, ili jidugame mpola jenaa aleapalaa Isaya molooti wa Matuunda kete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Khotegeela molategeela, ila molalekha khomanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Khokuuna molakuuna, ila molalekha khowona.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kho nguno meoyo ja vantu ewa javaaga mekhaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">matwi gawe galimbaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">miso gawe galimbaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Ili miso gawe gakhawone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ne matwi gawe gakhategeele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ne meoyo jawe jikhamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">vakiije vangalokele, ili nane nevapon'ye.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Ila onywenywe togagwi, kho nguno miso genyu gakhowona ne matwi genyu gakhotegeela. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, valooti va Matuunda ne vantu vinki vasoga valevatamanela vagawone egoo ganaa mokhogawona onywenywe, ila valevakhagawona, ne khotegeela ganaa mokhogategeela onywenywe ila valevakhategeela.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovaweela vantu emaana ya mofwano gwa mominji wa mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Gechoo, onywenywe tegelelaji emaana ya mofwano wa mominji gwa mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khotegela mpola khougela owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda, ila akhakhomanya, muntu oyoo khwipyana ne mbeyu yenaa yaleyagwela mo njela. Papenee Khatawe akhwija ne khosola eloo lenaa Matuuunda atulagaa mokhate mwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Mbeyu ejoo jenaa jalejaminjwa kho oloongo wonaa nkha mwinki, a muntu yunaa akhotegeela Mpola ya Matuunda, ne apaponye akhopokeela khwa otogwi. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ila olewamba mpola eyoo kho ituungo ikupe topo, kho nguno akhaikhotwiina modugo mokhate yawe. Epo magayo ne magayanjo panaa gakhovijela kho nguno ya mpola eyoo, apaponye vakholekhaa khoyegoomba. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Mbeyu jenaa jalegweela kho miyaa, jekhopyanekelwa no muntu yunaa khotegeela Mpola ya Matuunda. Ila kho nguno ya khotungumala khougela opanga, no khopepelwa ne matamanelo ja nsawo. Olebananga mpola ne vakhakhowola kholela viligi. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ila mbeyu jenaa jalejagweela mo oloongo mosoga, a mofwano wa vantu vanaa vakhotegeela Mpola ya Matuunda ne kholemanya. Nanevo vakholela viligi, yomwii kholela igana no yoonge kholela makomi sita no yoonge kholela makomi gatato.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa ndagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu akavaweela mofwano woonge, “Owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda okhwipyana ne muntu yunaa aminjaga mbeyu nsoga kho mogoonda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ila ituungo lenaa vantu vagonile, nyambuda wakwe iija no khovyala ndagu pakhate ya ogosi, papenee akapeta. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Panaa ogosi owoo walewalemba no khwandya khovelekha, apenee ndagu nanejo jiigela. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Vatomami va oyoo wa mogoonda vamopetela no khomowolya, ‘Meyaa khomanyile kete angawaminjaga mbeyu nsoga kho mogoonda gwakhoo, seji ndagu japumaga khwenii?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Nanoyo akavaweela, ‘Nyambuda amwenee anogaja gechoo.’ Apenee vatomami vakamowolya, ‘Mbi opogile khopete khogalimbule?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nanoyo akamoweela, ‘Khotopo, mokhagalimbule, kho nguno mbe molimbule ndagu, molakhowola kholimbula ne ogosi. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Moleke vyensi vekole palomwi mpakha ituungo la khokungula. Ituungo eloo ndavaweela vakunguli kete, vakungan'ye taali ndagu ne khogatuunga ne khogatuula kho maloondo ili vagatime. Ila vakungule ogosi, vaituule mo keyenge.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa mbeyu yenaa ekhwetwa Haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luka 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu akavaweela mofwano goonge, “Owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda okhwipyana ne mbeyu wa ipeke lenaa lekhwetwa mohaladali, muntu yomwii aleayesola ne khoyevyala kho mogoonda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Mbeyu eye a nndo khokela mbeyu jensi, ila panaa ikholemba no khokola, ikhowa nkolo khokela mapeke gensi, ninga nyonyi jiijile ne khonogelelya vityoo vyawe kho matambe gakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa amila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20">Luka 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu akavaweela mofwano goonge, “Owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda okhwipyana ne amila yenaa mokhiima aleayesola, ayesalenkhan'ya kho madebe gatato ga otuu, ne otuu wensi watuta.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguno ya Yesu ya khotomela mofwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33">Maluko 4:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 4:34">34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu aleavawelaa vantu egoo gensi khwa mefwano. Omwenee aleakhavaliga chechensi patokhola khotomela mofwano. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Egoo aleganojekha gechoo, ili mpola yenaa aleyapalwa no molooti wa Matuunda idugame, kete</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ndapala nanevo khwa mefwano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Ndavaweela mpola jenaa vantu valevakhajemanya mpuma khowombwa khwa liwelelo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhodadamola mofwano gwa ndagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Apenee Yesu aleavadaya evoo vantu, engela kho nyoomba. Vahemba vakwe vakamopetela, vakamoweela, “Khodadamolele emaana ya mofwano gwa ndagu jenaa jalejepwale momogoonda.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu akavaweela, “Muntu yunaa aleavyala mbeyu nsoga, a Mwana wa Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Mogoonda a liwelelo. Ne mbeyu nsoga a vantu va owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. Ne ndagu a vantu va oyoo mobe. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Nyambuda yunaa aleiija khovyala ndagu a Khatawe. Makongola a odugo wa liwelelo, nanevo vakunguli a vatomami va khochanya pa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Kete ndagu venaa jekhokunganywa no khotimwa momoto, avyenee elaawa kho odugo wa liwelelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana wa Muntu alavalagelelya vatomami va pachanya pa Matuunda, ili vavakungan'ya khopuma kho owami wakwe vantu vensi vanaa vakhovapwelya vaange ili vanoje mabe, ne vensi vanaa vakhonoja mabe, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />ne vatomami evoo va khochanya pa Matuunda valavajuuta kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi patokhola modugo, ne okhoo valakota no kholoman'ya mino kho nguno ya osaati. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Vantu vanaa valevamotegelelya Matuunda, evoo avenee valang'alala kete lyonse kho owami wa Isewe. Owa matwi ategeele.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano wa kento cha mpia nkolo kenaa keswekilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda, opyanilwe ne kento cha mpia nkolo kenaa alechaswekhaga momogoonda. Muntu yomwii aleakewona ne akakeswekhaa khanke. Aleasekelela modugo, apenee aloma khopeta khogolya vento vyakwe vyensi venaa angile atite, ili agole mogoonda ogoo.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano wa kento cha mpia nkolo kenaa kekhwetwa lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Khanke, owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda, gwipyanile no mogolya vento yomwii yunaa angile khopogaa kento kenaa kekhwetwa lulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Panaa aleapata kento cha mpia nkolo kenaa kekhwetwa lulu, akapeta khogolya vento vyakwe vyensi, ne khogola lulu.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa mogonyo va kholuwela nshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda okhwipyanekelwa ne mogonyo gonaa valuwi valevagojotela kho ilambo. Mogonyo ogoo alewakungan'ya nshe mosalinkhano. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Mogonyo owo panaa alewijola, valuwi valevawokhwesa kho mpelo ya yiilambo. Apenee vikhala pansi, vakungan'ya nshe vasoga, vawatuula mo vekhapu. Ila nshe jenaa nkha nsoga valevajijuta. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Gechoo, avyenee ilaawa kho odugo wa liwelelo. Vatomami va pachanya pa Matuunda, valiija ne khovabegola vantu vabe ne vasoga. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Apenee valavajuta vanoja mabe kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi patokhola odugo, no omoo valakota no kholoman'ya mino khwa osaati.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi mapyaa ne ga myakha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />“Yesu akavawolya, Mbi, mwajemanyaga mpola eji jensi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Nanevo vakamoweela, “Avyenee, khwamanyaga.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Papenee akavaweela, “Gechoo, kela molaangi wa njaanga ja Musa yunaa khowaa mohemba kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda, khwipyana no yunaa atite nyoomba yunaa khopumya kho nsawo yakwe vento vepyaa ne vya myakha.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu va Nazaleti vakhomosiita Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala mefwano eyoo, akawokha epoo, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akatuuwa khokayawe khonaa alealwa Nazaleti. Panaa aleapikha okhoo, andya khovaliga vantu kho nyoomba yakhwitangela Vayahudi, nanevo valevakumya no khowolya, “Muntu oyo apataga khwenii masala ega?” “Ne olaala wa khonoja matuntumu ega? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Mbi, oyo nkha mwana oyoo wa moponji? Mbi, Onyinya nkha Malia, ne vadogwakwe nkha, a Yakobo no Yusufu no Simoni palomwi no Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Mbi ne velombo vakwe vensi nkha vanaa khokhwikhala nanevo epa? Gechoo muntu oyoo apataga khwenii mpola jensi eji?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Vantu evoo vamosimbela, vasiita khomogoomba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yesu akavaweela, “Vantu vakhomokolya molooti wa Matuunda pepensi epoo, ila vantu va nse yakwe ao khokhayakwe, akhavakhomokolya.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Gechoo, Yesu aleakhanoja matuntumu minki okhoo, kho nguno vantu evoo valevakhamogomba.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ncha ya Yohana Mobatiji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Kho ituungo eloo, Helode mwami wa Galilaya, aleategela mpola jenaa jekhomopalela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Apenee akavaweela vatomami vakwe, “Muntu oyo a Yohana Mobatiji, yunaa afufokhaga.” Avyenee atite olaala wa khonoja matuntumu.<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helode aleapala gechoo, kho nguno omwenee amwenee alealagelelya Yohana agwelwe no khotuungwa mokhandulunge. Aleanoja gechoo kho nguno ya Helodia angile moliji wa Filipo mokolwakwe Helode. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kho nguno Yohana angile khomowelaga Helode kete, “Nkha visoga ogwegwe khomotoola moliji wa modogwakhoo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helode aleapogile khomowolaga Yohana, ila angile akhovogopa vantu, kho nguno valevagoomba kete Yohana angile molooti wa Matuunda.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ila panaa yaleyapikha nsiko ya mbina ya khokombola kholelwa khwa Helode, mwalele wa Helodia iija, igeya paulongolo ya vahenja. Helode aleasekelela modugo, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />gechoo, “Akamolapela kete alamopela mwalele oyoo kento chechensi kenaa alapoga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Mwalele oyoo aleawelwa no nyinya kento cha kholoomba. Mwalele oyoo akamowela Helode, “Nkhopooga onepele itwe la Yohana Mobatiji mwi sinela.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mwami Helode aleasaya modugo, ila kho nguno angile alapaga paulongolo ya vahenja, gechoo akalagelelya vamopele mwalele oyoo itwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Gechoo, alealageleya muntu yomwii apete mokhandulunge khomodumula itwe Yohana Mobatiji. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Apenee muntu oyoo aleatuuwa ne itwe la Yohana molosela, amopela mwalele oyoo, nanoyo akikenkha khwa nyinya. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Vahemba va Yohana Mobatiji panaa valevategeela mpola eyoo, valevapeta khosola movimba yakwe, vapeta khowozyeekha, apenee vapete khomoweela Yesu mpola jensi jenaa alejapumeela.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovapela endya vantu elufu jetaano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu panaa aleategela egoo gensi, aleawokha palwande epoo ne ipogo, apetaa kho lwande yenaa vantu vatapoya. Ila vantu panaa valevategela khonaa Yesu angile apetaa, valevapuma kho mahala gawe no khomoloonda Yesu kho megolo. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu panaa aleatelemokha mwipogo, akawona idale ikolo la vantu, akavawonela losongo no khovapon'ya evoo vanaa angile valwile.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Panaa yaleyapikha mesee, vahemba vakwe vamopetela no khomoweela, “Epa khopwale pipalangwa ne otikho watelelaga, gechoo vadaye vantu ewa vapete kho mahala vigolele endya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Ila Yesu akavaweela, “Khotopo nguno ya evenee khowookha, gechoo onywenywe movapele endya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ila evenee vakamoweela, “Khotite mekate jetaano ne nshe jewele topo,” Avaweela.<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu akavaweela, “Moleete khwaane mekate ne nshe ejoo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Apenee akavaweela vantu vikhale kho masanje, akasola mekate eyoo metaano ne nshe ejoo jewele, akunaa khochanya pa Matuunda, amosongela Matuunda. Papenee amegan'ya mekate eyoo, akavapela vahemba vakwe, nanevo vavagawela vantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Vantu vensi valevalya, vikota. Papenee vahemba vakwe vakungan'ya masigelo, vijolya vekhapu ikomi ne vewele. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Vantu vanaa angile valya endya eyoo angile vagwisha elufu jetaano, patokhola khovalya vakhiima ne vana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhogenda pachanya ya meje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Apaponye, Yesu akavalagelelya vahemba vakwe vatante mwipogo, valongole kho nkelo ya ilambo, ituungo lenaa omwene khodaya idale la vantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khodaya idale eloo la vantu, aleatanta kho ketonda aleemwi kholoomba. Ne mesee panaa yaleyapikha, omwene angile akhale apwale okhoo kho ketonda aleemwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Ne ituungo eloo ipogo angile yapikhaga pakhate ya ilambo, ila kewalawumbe angile okhoisunkha ipogo, kho nguno ipuuta ikhaka angile lekhovagilya.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Makingilima, Yesu aleapikha khonaa vahemba vakwe angile vapwale, okho akhogenda pachanya ya meje. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Panaa vahemba vakwe valevamowona akhogenda pachanya ya meje, valevatungumala modugo, no khwandya khojoma, “Owo a mogawo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Apaponye, Yesu akavaweela, “Mowee vagimba a nene, mokhanyogope.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petulo akamoweela, “Mwene, mbe khapanga a ogwegwe, onewele ngeende pachanya ya meje niije khwakhoo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu akamoweela, “Wiije.” Apenee Petulo apuma mwipogo, andya khogenda pachanya ya meje no khomopetela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ila panaa aleawona ipuuta ikhaka, aleatungumala, andya khotwiina mo meje, akota khwa lolii, akapala, “Mwene nyalye.”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Apaponye Yesu, agolola mokhono, amowamba no khomoweela, “Ogwegwe yunaa omogombile Matuunda kedo, kho kee okhotongumala?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Yesu no Petulo panaa valevatanta mwipogo, ipuuta alelapola. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Apenee vahemba vanaa angile vapwale mwipogo, vamotungamela no khomoweela Yesu, vakapaala, “Khapanga ogwegwe a Mwana wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopon'ya valwile okhoo Genezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maluko 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe, panaa valevalowokha ilambo, vakapikha kho nse ya Genezaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Vantu va okhoo panaa valevatembola kete a Yesu, valevasambalya mpola lwande jensi ja pepi. Apenee vamoletela Yesu valwile vensi. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Nanevo vakamoloomba Yesu, avagombele vapalye topo ipeembo la mwenda gwakwe. Ne vensi vanaa valevapalya, valevapona.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Maligi ganaa galegapokelwa ne makoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maluko 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Papenee vamoonga va Mafalisayo ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa valevapuma Yelusalemu, vamwijela Yesu no khomowolya, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Kho kee vahemba vakhoo akhavakholoonda maligi ganaa galegapokelwa khopuma khwa makoko visu? Panaa vakholya endya, akhavakhokhalawa mekhono jawe venaa ikhopogiwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu akavaweela, “Kho kee onywenywe akhamokholoonda njaanga ja Matuunda, ila mokholoonda maligi genyu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kho nguno Matuunda aleapalaa, ‘Mokolyee iso no nyokho,’ khanke akapaala, ‘Yeyensi yunaa akhomotokha ise ao nyinya, akhopogiwaa, awolagwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ila onywenywe mokhopaala kete muntu mbe awee ne kento kenaa nokhowolaa khomopeela ise ao nyinya, akhopogiwa khovaweela, ‘Khotopo nevalye, kho nguno kento eke namopumelya Matuunda,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />gechoo akhapogiwa khanke khomokolya ise ao nyinya. Khwa khonoja gechoo, avyenee venaa mokhobyeeda mpola ya Matuunda no kholoonda maligi genyu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Onywee van'yaa, Isaya molooti wa Matuunda aleapalaa khapanga khovaugela onywenywe, panaa aleapalaa kete,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Matuunda akhopaala, vantu ewa vakhonkholya khwa melomo topo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">ila meoyo jawe jele khotale nane.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Khonkumbekha khwawe nkha kento,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">kho nguno maligi gawe gakhopuma khwa vantu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpola jenaa jekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe paolongolo wa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maluko 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Apenee Yesu alyetaa idale la vantu lenaa angile lepwale epoo, avawelaa, “Tegelelaji visoga no khomanya. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Nkha kento kenaa kekhwingela momolomo gwa muntu, kenaa kekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe paolongolo wa Matuunda, ila kenaa kekhopuma momolomo gwakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Apenee vahemba va Yesu vapeta khwa Yesu no khomoweelya, “Mbi, omanyile kete Mafalisayo valevakilwa modugo panaa valevategeela mpola jenaa angile okhopaala?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu akavaweela, “Kela momelo gonaa alegokhavyalwa no Daada yaane yunaa apwale khochanya, golalimbolwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Mokhavategelelye, evene a valaala vatulu vanaa vakhovalongolya vatulu. Kete motulu akhomolongolya motulu moya, vensi vawele valagwela mwileende.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Apenee Petulo akamoweela Yesu, “Khowelee, okhopalela chanuu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu avawelaa, “Ninga nanyu mokhale momanye? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Mbi, mokhamanya kete chechensi kenaa kekhwingela momolomo, kekhwingela mondaa ya muntu, papenee paudugo kekhopuma khwa khopeta kholoowa? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ila vento venaa vekhopuma momolomo gwa muntu, vekhopuma momooyo gwakwe, ne evyoo avyenee vekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe paolongolo wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kho nguno mokhate mwa mooyo wa muntu, gakhopuma maheewo mabe, owolagi no osencha no wiketu no wiwi no owoni wa opepi ne ntoki. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Mpola ejoo ajenee jekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe paolongolo wa Matuunda. Ila kholya patokhola khokhawala mekhono, khotopo emonoje akhagombwe no Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khogoomba khwa mokhiima wa khopuma kho Kanani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maluko 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu aleawokhaa epoo, akapeta kho mahala ga Tilo ne Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Apenee itangaa no mokhiima yomwii khopuma kho Kanani, yunaa angile khwikhala kho nse eyoo, amwijela, oko akhokoota kho lolii, “Mwene, Mwana wa Daudi, ombonele losongo. Mwalele waane akhogayanjwa modugo ne idemi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ila Yesu aleapombolaa. Apenee vahemba vakwe vamopetela vamowelaa, “Mowelee apete jakwe, kho nguno khotogayanjaa ne madoolo gakwe.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu akavaweela, “Matuunda aleantoma kho nguno ya Vaizilaeli topo, kho nguno vale kete nkholo jenaa jipwelile.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Ila mokhiima oyoo aleatelelaa panaa Yesu aleapwale, akamotungamela no khopaala, “Mwene, nkholoomba onyalye.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu akamoweela khwa khotomela mofwano, “Nkha visoga khosola endya ja vana vakhoo no khojejutela embwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Mokhiima oyoo akapaala, “Avyenee, Mwene, ila ninga embwa gakholya masigilo ganaa gakhogwa panse ya meja ja vameyaa vawe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yesu amowelaa, “Ogwee, mokhiima khogoomba khwakhoo a mokolo, ne elaawa gechoo kete venaa opogile.” Apaponye mwalelee wa mokhiima oyoo aponaa.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovapon'ya vantu vinki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu aleawokhaa epoo akapeta kho mpelo ya ilambo la Galilaya. Papenee atantaa kho ketonda, no khwikhalaa panse. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Vantu vinki vamopetela, vamokenkela, valema, vatulu, vatewe, vameme, ne valwile vaange vinki, vawatuula paulongolo wakwe, nanoyo avapon'yaa. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Vantu evoo valevakumya modugo panaa valevavawona vakameme vakhopaala, valema vaponaga, vatewe vakhogeenda, ne vatulu vakhokuuna, nanevo valevamokolya Matuunda wa Vaizilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovapeela endya vantu elufu jinee</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maluko 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Apenee Yesu avetaa vahemba vakwe no khovaweela, “Nkhovawonela losongo vantu ewa, kho nguno vawaaga nane kho ituungo la nsiko jetato, ninga vatokhola endya, nane khotopo nevadaye patokhola kholya endya kho nguno valaagwa wesa monjela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Vahemba vakwe vakamowolya, “Kholapata khwenii mekate ya khovakweela vantu vensi ewa, nasu khole pipalangwa?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu avawolyaa, “Motite mekate jiinga?” Vakamoweela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">“Khotite mekate saba ne nshe nndo ntiiti.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Apenee Yesu alagelelya kete vantu vensi vikhale panse. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Papenee ajesola ejoo mekate saba ne ejoo nshe, akamosongela Matuunda, amegan'yaa no khovapeela vahemba vakwe, nanevo vahemba vakavagawela vantu evoo. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Vantu vensi valyaa, vikota. Apenee vahemba vakwe, vakungan'yaa masigelo, vijolya vekhapu saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Vantu vanaa angile valya endya, vagwisha angile elufu jinee, ne patokhola khovalya vakhiima ne vana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Apenee Yesu akavadaaya vantu evoo, atantaa mwipogo, akapeta ihala la Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Vantu vakhopooga lomekho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maluko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Apenee Mafalisayo ne Masadukayo, vamwijela Yesu no khomogema, vamoloomba avalageele lomekho khopuma khochanya pa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yesu akavaweela, “Panaa ekhopikha mesee, onywenywe mokhopaala, igolo kholaawa visoga, kho nguno khwilunde khokhasuku. <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Ne makingilima mokhopaala, ‘Leelo mbula ya ipuuta elatonya, kho nguno khwilunde khokhasuku, khanke malunde a matembu.’ Onywenywe momanyile visoga matuungo khwa khokuuna malunde, ila mokhakhowola khotembola lomekho ja matuungo ega. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Onywee a keleli cha vantu vabe ne vanaa nkha vakhapanga paolongolo wa Matuunda, ne seji mokhopooga lomekho? Khotopo nevanojele lomekho yeyensi, ila lomekho yemwii yenaa molaewona a kete eyoo ya Yona molooti wa Matuunda topo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Apenee Yesu akavalekha akapeta.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amila ya Mafalisayo ne Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maluko 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Panaa vahemba va Yesu valevalowokha ilambo, valevewagwa khokepola mekate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mwiyangalelage no khwikhala patale ne amila ya Mafalisayo ne Masadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Vahemba vakwe vandyaa khwipalela, “Akhopaala geeke kho nguno khotokhola mekate.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu aleamanyaa maheewo gawe, akavaweela, “Onywenywe vantu vanaa mokhogoomba kedo, kho kee mokhwipalela kete motokhola mekate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Mbi, mokhale mokhamanya mpakha seji? Mbi, mokhale mokombole venaa nalenamegan'ya mekate ejoo jetaano kho nguno ya vantu elufu jetaano? Mbi, mwalemwijolya vekhapu viinga vya masigelo? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ao akhamokhokombola mekate eyoo saba yenaa valevalya vantu elufu jinee. Mbi, mwalemwijolya vekhapu viinga vya masigelo? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Mbi mokhamanya kete angile nkhavawela khwa mpola ja mekate? Gechoo, kenaa nkhopaala mwiyangalelage ne amila ya Mafalisayo ne Masadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Apenee vahemba vakwe vamanya kete angile akhakhopalela khougela amila ya khonogelelya mekate, ila angile akhopalela maligi ga Mafalisayo ne Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo akhopaala patokhola osweeki kete Yesu a Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maluko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu panaa aleapikha kho ihala la Kaisalia Filipi, akavawolya vahemba vakwe, “Vantu vakhopaala kete onene Mwana wa Muntu, ananuu?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Vakamoweela, “Vaange vakhopaala ogwegwe a Yohana Mobatiji, vaange vakhopaala ogwegwe a Eliya molooti wa Matuunda, ne vaange vakhopaala ogwegwe a Yelemia ao a yomwii wa valooti va Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu akavawolya, “Nanyu mokhopaala kete onene ananuu?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petulo akamoweela, “Ogwegwe a Kilisto, Mwana wa Matuunda, Matuunda yunaa akhwikhala nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu akamoweela, “Wafunyilagwa ogwee Simoni mwana wa Yona, kho nguno khotopo muntu yunaa akholagelagaa mpola eye, ila a Daada yaane yunaa apwale khochanya. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Nane nkhokhoweela, ogwegwe amwenee Petulo, ne pachanya ya ipampa ele, ndajenga ikhanisa laane, ninga ngulu ja ncha, khotopo jekhowole kholekiinda. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Onene ndakhopela nfungolo ya owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. Chechensi kenaa olakegilya paliwelelo, avivyoo kelasitwa no khochanya pa Matuunda, ne chechensi kenaa olakegombela paliwelo, avivyoo kelagombelwa khochanya pa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Apenee Yesu akavagilya vahemba vakwe kete, vakhamowele muntu yeyensi kete omwenee amwene Kilisto.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopalela mpola ya magayo ne ncha yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maluko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Mpuma ituungo eloo, Yesu andya khovaweela vahemba vakwe patokhola khosweekha, kete “Omwene akhopogiwa apete Yelusalemu. No okhoo alapata magayo minki khopuma khwa valaala va Vayahudi ne vapumya matembekho valaala ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa, ne kete alawolagwa ne nsiko ya otato alafufokha.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Apenee Petulo amwetaa Yesu khompelo no khwandya khomokhakela, “Okhapale gechoo, khotopo ipumeele gechoo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ila Yesu akagalokha no khomoweela, “Pumaa paolongolo waane Khatawe. Okhageme khongilya khonoja egoo ganaa agatogilwe Matuunda, kho nguno ogwegwe okhakhoheewa ganaa ga Matuunda, ila okhoheewa ganaa ga kewuntu topo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Apenee Yesu akavaweela vahemba vakwe, “Muntu yeyensi yunaa apogile khondoonda onene, akhopogiwa asiite khonoja ganaa agapogile mwenee, apenee akepole mosalaba gwakwe, andonde. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Mokhopogiwaa khonoja gechoo, kho nguno muntu yunaa apogile khopon'ya wome wakwe mwenee, alawopwelya, ila muntu yunaa alapwelya wome wakwe kho nguno yaane, alaopata. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Muntu alapata kee, mbe alapata nsawo jensi ja liwelelo ele, ila apwelajaa opanga wakwe? Mbi, muntu alapumya kento kee ili atuvyee khanke opanga wakwe? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kho nguno, Mwana wa Muntu aliija kho olaala wa Ise palomwi ne vatomami vakwe va khochanya khwa Matuunda, epoo apenee Matuunda alamolepa kela muntu khopumana ne manoji gakwe. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, movamoonga venyu vanaa mopwale epa, vapwale vanaa khotopo vafwee patokhola khomowona Mwana wa Muntu, panaa alaawa ijile kho owami wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhogalokha osho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maluko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Nsiko sita panaa jalejakela, Yesu aleavasolaa Petulo no Yakobo no Yohana moluna wa Yakobo, akapeta nanevo kho ketonda ketale khonaa valevikhala okhoo valeemwi. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Ne panaa angile vapwale okhoo, Yesu aleagalokhaa osho paolongolo yawe. Osho wakwe walewang'ang'ala kete lyonse, ne myenda jakwe jawa myelo pee, kete welo wa lyonse. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Timpu, vavawona Musa no Elia vakhopaala no Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Apenee Petulo akamoweela Yesu, “Mwene, mbe olatogwa a visoga osweswe khwikhale epa, ndajenga vedindiga vetato, kemwii amba chakhoo, ne keenge amba cha Musa, ne keenge amba cha Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Petulo panaa angile akhale akhopaala, timpu, iluunde lenaa lekhong'alala pee alelavakundekela, no lolii lwategelekha khopuma mo iluunde eloo, yenaa kepalaa, “Oyo amwenee mwanaane yunaa nemotogilwe, yunaa nkhotojwaa nanoyo, gechoo momotegelelaje mwenee.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Vahemba vanaa angile vapwale no Yesu, panaa valevategeela lolii oloo, valevatungumala modugo, vagwaa panse khwa khogubama. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yesu akavatelela, akavapaalya no khovaweela, “Imeleli, mokhatungumale.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Panaa valevanyenyola miso gawe, vakamowona Yesu asigagaa aleemwi.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Yesu ne vahemba evoo, panaa alevakhosulomokha kho ketonda, Yesu akavalagelelya, “Mokhamowele muntu yeyensi ganaa mwagawonaga mpakha panaa Mwana wa Muntu alafufokha.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Apenee vahemba evoo vamowolya, Kho kee valaangi va njaanga ja Musa vakhopaala, “Ekhopogiwaa Elia amolongole Kilisto khwija?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu akavaweela, “Avyenee epwale, Elia amwenee alalongola khwija, nanoyo alanogelelya mpola jensi. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ila nkhovaweela, Elia teali ijagaa, nenevo valevakhamomanya, valevamonojela kela kento kenaa angile vakhopooga. Avivyoo valamonojela vibe Mwana wa Muntu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Apenee vahemba vakwe vamanya kete Yesu angile akhovaweela khougela mpola ja Yohana Mobatiji.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhomopon'ya molomyana yunaa atite idemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maluko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe panaa alevatuuwa kho idale eloo la vantu, muntu yomwii akamwijela Yesu no khotungama paulongolo wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Amowelaa Yesu, “Mwene, nkholoomba omowonele losongo mwanaane. Atite olwile wa khafunta, ne olwile owoo okhomogayanja modugo, omwene khagwelaga mo moto ne mo meje. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Alenamoleeta khwa vahemba vakhoo vamopon'ye ila valevakonya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu apalaa, “Onywee keleli cha vantu vanaa mokhamogomba Matuunda, ne vabe. Ndikhala nanyu mpakha nale? Ndavakhamelelya mpakha nale? Mondetele molomyana oyoo epa.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Panaa valevapeta nanoyo, Yesu akaleweela idemi la khwa molomyana oyoo, lepume. Apaponye molomyana oyoo aponaa.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Apenee vahemba vakwe vakamopetela Yesu ituungo lenaa vantu angile vatapoya no khomowolya, “Kho kee osweswe alekhwakonya khopumyaa idemi eloo?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu akavaweela, “Alemwakonya, kho nguno khogoomba khwenyu a khodo. Nkhovaweela khapanga, mbe anga mowee mokhogoomba kedo topo, kete venaa epwale mbeyu ya haladali, angamolakhowola khokeweela ketonda eke, ‘Pumaa epa opete okhoo,’ nanogo angagolapeta. Gechoo, nanyu molakhowola khonoja mpola yeyensi.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />“Ila idemi kete ele, khotopo lepume, ila topo khwa njela ya khomoloomba Matuunda no khotuunga kholya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopaala khanke khougela ncha yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe panaa angile vapwale kho ihala la Galilaya, Yesu aleavawelaa, “Mwana wa Muntu alagalokhwa no khomokenkha ili agwelwee ne vantu vabe. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Nanevo valamowolaga, ila nsiko ya otato alafufokha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Vahemba vakwe panaa valevategeela gechoo, valevasaaya modugo.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akholepa khodi ya Nyoomba ya Matuunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe panaa valevapikha Kapelanaumu, vantu vanaa angile vakukungan'ya khodi kho nguno ya Nyoomba ya Matuunda, vapeta khwa Petulo, no khomowolya, “Mbi, molaangi wenyu akholepa khodi ya Nyoomba ya Matuunda?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petulo akavaweela, “Avyenee, akholepa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petulo panaa aleingela mokhate ya nyoomba, ne panaa angile akhale khopaala ninga mpola yeyensi, Yesu akamowolya, “Simoni, ogwee okhowona mbi? Vami va liwelelo ele vakukungan'ya khodi khopuma khwa vananuu? Mbi, khopuma khwa vantu va nse jawe, ao khopuma khwa vantu va nse jiinge?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petulo akamoweela, “Vakukungan'ya khopuma kho vantu va nse jiinge.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu akamoweela, “Kho gechoo, vahenja vakhavakholepa khodi. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Ila khokhavakilye vantu ewa. Petaa kho ilambo, no ojutele ndowano mo meje. Ne nshe wa mwandyo yunaa olapata, omotungule molomo, nagwe olawona omoo mpia. Osole mpia eyoo opete olepe khodi yaane ne yakhoo.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">A nanuu yunaa molaala?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ituungo aleloo, vahemba vakwe vamwijela Yesu no khomowolya, “A nanuu yunaa molaala khokela vensi kho owami wa pachanya khwa Matuunda?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Apenee Yesu amwetaa mwana modo, amwimelekha pakhate yawe, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />no khopaala, “Nkhovaweela khapanga, mbe molalekha khogalokha mowee kete vana vado khotopo mwingele mo owami wa khochanya pa Mwatuunda ninga nsiko yemwii. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Gechoo, muntu yeyensi yunaa akhakhopogaa olaala kete mwana modo oyo, oyoo amwenee alaawa molaala kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Khanke muntu yeyensi yunaa khwinyenyekelya kete mwana modo oyo, kho nguno ya lina laane, oyoo amwenee amba anepokelagaa onene.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khogilya vantu vanaa vakhovanoja vaange vanojee mabe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maluko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luka 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Mbe muntu yeyensi yunaa akhomokenkelya yomwii movamoonga mwa vana vado ewa vanaa vakhongoomba vanojee mabe, anga amba visoga mbe muntu oyoo alatungelwa isheelo monkingo yakwe no khotwiinwa pakhate ya ikhwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Molalakewona onywnywe vantu va liwelelo ele, kho nguno ya khonoja mpola jenaa jekhokenkela vantu vanojee mabe, magemo gakhopogiwa gawee, ila alakewona muntu yunaa khokenkelelya magemo egoo.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Mbe mokhono gwakhoo ao mogolo gwakhoo golakhokenkela onojee mabe, owodomole no khowosutya khotale. A visoga khopwelya kewongelo kemwii cha mowele gwakhoo no khopata opanga wa nsiko jensi khokela khowa ne mekhono jewele ao megolo jewele ne khosombwa kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Khanke, mbe liso lakhoo, lekhokenkela onojee mabe, lekhompole ne kholesutya khotale. A visoga khwakhoo khowa ne liso lemwii topo ne khopata opanga wa nsiko jensi khokela khowa ne miso gawele ne khosombwa kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa nkholo yunaa apwelagaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Yesu endelelaa khovaweela, Mwiyangalelage, mokhamobyeede ninga yomwii wa vado ewa. Nkhovaweela gechoo, kho nguno vatomami vawe va khochanya pa Matuunda, ituungo lensi vapwale paulongolo wa Daada yaane wa khochanya. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Gechoo, Mwana wa Muntu aleijaa khovapon'ya vantu vanaa angile vapwelaga.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mokhowona mbi? Mbe muntu atite nkholo igana, no yomwii mbe apweele, alanoja kee? Mbi, alavalekha evoo makomi kenda ne kenda kho ketonda, no khopeta khomopooga oyoo yunaa apwelagaa. <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, mbe alamopata oyoo nkholo, alatogwa modugo kho nguno ya nkholo oyoo yomwii, khokela nkholo ejoo makomi kenda ne kenda vanaa vakhapwela. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Avivyoo, Isenyu yunaa apwale khochanya pa Matuunda, akhatogwa ninga yomwii wa vana ewa vado vapweele.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Modogwakhoo mbe akhononele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Mbe modogwakhoo akhonojelaga ibe, petaa omolange panaa amba moleemwi topo. Ne mbe alakhotegela, olaawa wamopataga khanke modogwakhoo. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ila mbe muntu oyoo alasita khokhotegelelya, petaa omosole muntu yoonge yomwii ao vawele ili kela mpola elageelwe no owoni wa vantu vawele ao vatato. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Mbe alasita khovategelelya ne evoo, petaa opaale kho idale la vantu vanaa vakhomogoomba Kilisto. Khanke, mbe alasita khovategelelya ne evoo, epoo mwiije momonogelaje muntu oyoo kete venaa angamolavanojela vantu vanaa akhavakhomogoomba Matuunda ne vakhongan'ya khodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khogoomba no khosiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Nkhovaweela khapanga, “Lelensi lenaa molalesita paliwelelo, Matuunda nanoyo alalesita khochanya khwakwe. Avivyoo, lelensi lenaa molalegomba paliwelelo, Matuunda nanoyo alalegomba khochanya khwakwe.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Khanke nkhovaweela, mbe vawele movamoonga venyu valigombya paliwelelo kho lelensi lenaa valalomba, Daada yaane wa pachanya alavapela kento echoo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kho nguno pepensi epoo panaa amba vakonganaga vantu vawele ao vatato khwa lina laane, nane amba nepwale epoo palomwi nanevo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa motomami yunaa akhakholekolela mabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Apenee Petulo akamopetela Yesu no khomowolya, “Mwene, mbe modogwaane anojelagaa mabe, nkhopogiwaa nemolekolele mala jiinga? Mbi, mala saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu akamoweela, “Khotopo, nkhankhopaala omolekolele mala saba topo,” “ila okhopogiwaa omolekolele modogwakhoo ninga saba mala makomi saba. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Nkhovaweela gechoo, kho nguno owami wa pachanya khwa Matuunda, okhwipyaana no mwami yomwii yunaa aleapogaa khomanya mpia jakwe jensi venaa angile jepetile. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Panaa aleandya khokongan'yaa, alealetelwaa motomami yomwii yunaa angile atite ideni ikolo la mamilioni minki ga mpia khwa mwami. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Motomami oyoo aleakonyaa kholepa ideni lenaa angile atite. Apenee mwami akalagelelya vamogolye muntu oyoo kete mwasi, ili alepele ideni lakwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Ila motomami oyoo, akamotungamela mwami oyoo no khomoloomba khwa khopaala, ‘Nkholoomba ondindelelye, nane ndalepa ideni laane lensi!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Mwami akamowonela losongo, apenee amolekolelaa motomami wakwe eloo ideni lakwe lensi no khomolekolela apete. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ila motomami oyoo panaa angile akhopuma panji, vitaanga no motomami moyaakwe, yunaa angile amwalumyajaa mpia ntiiti dinali igana. Apaponye motomami oyoo wa mwandyo, amogwelaa no khomoniga nkingo oyoo motomami yoonge, no khwandyaa khomoweela, ‘Ondepe kenaa nkhokhodai.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Oyoo motomami moyaakwe amotungamelaa no khomoloomba khwa khopaala, ‘Nkholoomba ondindelelye, nane ndalepa ideni lensi.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ila motomami wa mwandyo asitaa, amokenkhaa moyaakwe khomotuunga mokhandulunge mpakha panaa alalepa ideni eloo lensi. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Vatomami vayaakwe panaa valevawona egoo, meoyo jawe jalejavasaata modugo. Vakapeta khwa mwami wawe no khomoweela gensi ganaa gapumelaga. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Apenee mwami amwetaa motomami oyoo no khomoweela, ‘Ogwee motomami mobe modugo. Onene alenakholekolela ideni lakhoo lensi panaa alewandoomba. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Mbi, nagwe okhapogiwa khomowonela losongo motomami mwiyo, kete venaa onene alenakhowonela losongo?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Mwami akakilwa modugo, akavaeta masinjala vakwe no khovaweela vamogwele no khomokenkha mokhandulunge apelwee magayo minki omoo mpakha panaa alalepa ideni lakwe lensi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Apenee Yesu amalelya khwa khopaala, “Geeke avyenee Daada yaane wa pachanya alavanogelya nanyu avivyoo mbe kela yomwii wenyu alalekha khomolekolela modogwakwe khwa mooyo gwakwe gwensi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akholiga khougela khwitoola no khwilekha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maluko 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala empola ejoo, aleawokhaa kho nse ya Galilaya, apetaa kho nse ya Yudea, nkelo ya lweje Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Vantu vinki valevamoloonda okhoo, nanoyo akavapon'ya valwile vinki okhoo.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Apenee vamoonga va Mafalisayo vakamwijela ili vamogeme, vamowolya, “Mbi, njaanga jisu jekhogoomba mogwisha khomolekha molijakwe kho nguno yeyensi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mbi, mokhasoma kho Maandekho ga Matuunda, khopuma mwandyo kete Matuunda aleawombaa mogwisha no mokhiima? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Ne aleapaala, ‘Kho nguno eye, mogwisha alamolekha ise no nyinya, no khwiungan'yaa no molijakwe. Nanevo vawele ewa valaawa mowele gomwii.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Gechoo, khotopo vawee vawele khanke, ila vawaaga mowele gomwii. Kho gechoo, kenaa aunganajaa Matuunda, muntu akhelekhan'ye.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Mafalisayo vamowolya khanke, “Mbe ega a ga khapanga, kho kee Musa alealagelelya mogwisha amopele molijakwe talatasi ya wileki?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu akavaweela, “Musa aleavagombelaa onywenywe khovalekha valiji jenyu kho nguno ya khopokeela malaangi ga Matuunda. Ila khopuma mwandyo Matuunda aleakhaloma ewee gechoo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Gechoo nkhovaweela, kela muntu yunaa akhomolekha molijakwe kho nguno yeenge yeyensi, ila nkha ya osencha, no khopeta khotoola mokhiima yoonge, oyoo alaawa khonojaa osencha.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Apenee vahemba vakwe wakamoweela, “Mbe mpola ja mogwisha no molijakwe jele gechoo, amba visoga kholekha khotoola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu akavaweela, “Nkha vantu vensi navakhowola khopokeela ilaangi ele. Ila topo evoo vanaa Matuunda avaalajaa khopokeela. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Nkhopaala gechoo, kho nguno vagwisha vamoonga khotopo vatoole, kho nguno valelilwee gechoo, vaange vanogajwaa gechoo ne vantu, ne vaange valamolaga kholekha khotoola kho nguno ya owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. Kho gechoo, muntu yeyensi yunaa nokhowolaa khopokeela maligi ega, agapokele.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovafunyela vana vado</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Apenee vantu vamoletela Yesu vana modo, avatolele mekhono jakwe kho metwe jawe ili avafunyele. Ila vahemba vakwe alevawakhakela evoo vanaa alevawaletaga vana vado. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Apenee Yesu akavaweela vahemba vakwe, “Movaleke evoo vana vado viije khwaane, ninga mokhavagilye kho nguno owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda awa vantu vanaa vapwale kete vana ewa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khovafunyela vana evoo, akawookha epoo.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Molomyana mosawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Apenee molomyana yomwii iijaa khwa Yesu, akamowolya, “Molaangi, nojee kento kee ili nepate opanga wa nsiko jensi patokhola odugo?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu akavaweela, “Kho kee okhombolya a mpola kee yenaa nsoga? Matuunda aleemwi amwenee mosoga. Ila mbe okhopooga khwingela kho opanga wa nsiko jensi patokhola odugo, otegelelye njaanga ja Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Molomyana oyoo akamowolya Yesu, “Njaanga kee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu akamoweela, “Okhawolage, okhasenche, okhiiwe, okhapale owoni wa opepi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />vakolyee iso no onyokho, motogwee mwiyo kete venaa witogwile ogwegwe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Molomyana oyoo akapaala, “Njaanga jensi ejoo najewambaga. Kento kee keenge kenaa nkhopogiwaa nojee?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mbe opogile okhapongokelwe ne kento, petaa ogolyee vento vyensi venaa otite, ne mpia ejoo ovagawele vapeena. Mbe olanoja gechoo, amba witolelaga nsawo jakhoo khochanya pa Matuunda. Apenee wiije ondonde.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ila molomyana oyoo panaa aleategelaa mpola ejoo, awokhaa ne masaayo kho nguno angile atite nsawo nyinki.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Apenee Yesu akavaweela vahemba vakwe, “Nkhokhoweela khapanga, amba vikhamu modugo mosawi khwingela kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Nkhovaweela khanke, a vepelu khwa ndimwana yunaa akhwetwa ngamia khokela kho idoli la losiinge, khokela mosawi khwingela kho owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Vahemba vakwe panaa valevategeela gechoo, valevakumya modugo no khomowolya, “Mbe gechoo, ananuu yunaa nokhowolaa alaponiwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu akavakuuna no khovaweela, “Kewuntu mpola eye ekhakhowolekha, ila khwa Matuunda mpola jensi jekokhowolekhaa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Apenee Petulo akamoweela, “Kunaa, osweswe khwalekhaga vyensi, khwakholondaga ogwegwe, seji nasu kholapata chanuu?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu akavaweela, “Nkhovaweela khapanga, Mwana wa Muntu panaa aliikhala pa kegoda chakwe cha olaala kho liwelelo ipyaa. Onywenywe vanaa mondondile moliikhala kho vegoda ikomi ne vewele, oko mokhotengemekha vantu va melombelo ikomi ne jewele ja Vaizilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Kela muntu yunaa aelekhagaa nyoomba yakwe ao valunakwe ao viloombo vakwe ao ise no nyinya ao vanakwe ao megoonda jakwe kho nguno yaane, alapokela mala igana khokela evyoo, ne alapata opanga wa nsiko jensi wonaa otokhola udugo. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ila vantu vinki vanaa valongwile, valaawa va odugo, ne vanaa va odugo valaawa va mwandyo.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Vatomami kho mogoonda gwa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Yesu endelelaa khopaala, Owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda okhwipyana no muntu yunaa atite mogoonda gwa mizabibu, yunaa aleapuma makingilima kho nguno ya khopooga vantu va khomotomamela molemo kho mogoonda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Panaa aleavapikha, igombya nanevo khovalepa malepo ga nsiko. Apenee akavakenkha kho mogoonda gwakwe gwa mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Panaa yaleyapikha saa jetato ya melaawo, apumaa panji akavawona vantu vaange vimelelaga kho lwande ya magolelyo, vatokhola molemo. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Akavaweela, ‘Mopete nanyu khotomama molemo kho mogoonda gwaane, nane ndavalepa kete venaa ipogilwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Apenee vapeta. Panaa yaleyapikha saa sita ja lyonse ne saa kenda mesee, aleapuma panji khanke, akavapeela vantu melemo ja khotomama momogoonda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Panaa yaleyapikha ituungo la saa ikomi ne yemwii mesee, akapuma khanke panji apeta kho lwande ya magolelyo, akavapikha vantu vaange vimelelaga vatokhola molemo. Avawolya, ‘Kho kee mwimelelaga epa nsiko yensi ne akhamokhotomama molemo?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Vamoweela, ‘Kho nguno khotopo muntu yunaa atopelagaa molemo.’ Omwene avawelaa, ‘Nanyu petagi motomami molemo kho mogoonda gwaane gwa mizabibu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Panaa yaleyapikha mesee, oyoo owa mogoonda akamoweela mwimeleli wakwe, ‘Oveete vatomami vensi ne ovalepe malepo gawe, ovalepe taali vanaa angile viijaga paodugo no khomalelya ne evoo va mwandyo.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Apenee vatomami vanaa angile vandya molemo mesee, viija ili valepwe echoo kenaa muntu akhopokela kete malepo gensi ga nsiko. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Apenee vatomami vanaa valevandya melaawo viija, angile vakhoheewa kete valalepwa malepo makolo khokela vayawe vanaa angile vandya pa odugo. Ila vensi valevalepwa malepo agagoo ga nsiko yemwii. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Vantu evoo panaa alevapokeela malepo egoo, khomololomela owa mogoonda. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Vapaala, ‘Vantu evoo vatomamaga molemo khwa saa lemwi topo, ila watolepaga avivyoo nanevo. Nasu khwanojaga molemo mokhamu nsiko yensi kho lyonse ikakha.’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Ila owa mogoonda akamoweela yomwii wawe ‘Molaasi,’ ‘Nkhakhopepela, nakholepaga kete venaa angile khwigombya, alewagoomba khotomama molemo gwa malepo ga nsiko yemwii. <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Gechoo, solaa malepo gakhoo, opete khokhaye. Onene nalomaga khomolepa muntu oyoo wa odugo kete venaa nakhopelaga ogwegwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Mbi, nkhapogiwa khotomela mpia jaane kete venaa nkhopooga? Ao otite wiilu kho nguno onene nde mosoga?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu amalelya khwa khopaala, “Gechoo, vantu vanaa angile va odugo valaawa va mwandyo, ne vanaa valaawa va mwandyo, valaawa va odugo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopaala mala ya otato khougela khofwa kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Ituungo lenaa Yesu angile apwale monjela akhotaanta khopeta kho ihala la Yelusalemu, aleavasolaa vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele pampelo no khovaweela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Kunaa, khopetile Yelusalemu, no okhoo Mwana wa Muntu alagwelwa no khokenkhwa mo mekhono ya vapumya matambekho valaala ne valaangi va njaanga. Nanevo valamotengemekha awolagwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Nanevo valamokenkha khwa vantu vanaa nkha Vayahudi, evenee valamobyeda, valamofweemba ne nkhome ja ntila no khomonanamola pamosalaba, ila nsiko ya otato alafufolwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maloombi ga maye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maluko 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Apenee moliji wa Zebedayo palomwi ne vana vakwe vawele, aleamwijela Yesu akatungama paulongolo wakwe no khomoloomba amwalye kento kemwii.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu akamowolya, “Okhopooga nkhonojele kee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Nanoyo akamoweela, “Nkholoomba ovagombele vanaane ewa vawele, yomwii ikhale kho lwande lwakhoo lwa molyelo no yoonge kho lwande lwakhoo lwa mokege, panaa olaawa opwale kho owami wakhoo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mokhamanya kento kenaa mokholoomba. Mbi molakhowola khong'weela kekhombe cha magayo, kenaa ndang'wela?” Vamoweela, “Avyenee, tokhowile.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu akavaweela, “Khapanga molang'wela kho kekhombe chaane cha magayo, ila khwikhala kho lwande lwaane lwa molyelo ao mokege, nkha molemo gwaane khovapeela, lwande ejoo a ja evoo vanaa Daada yaane avandalelaga.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Vahemba evoo vaange ikomi panaa valevategeela mpola ejoo, valevawasimbela evoo vadogo vawele. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Apenee Yesu avetaa vensi palomwi no khovaweela, “Momanyile kete vimeleli va vantu vanaa nkha Vayahudi, vakhovatomekelya kengulu, ne vimeleli vakholageela olaala wawe khwa vantu vawe. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ekhawe gechoo khwenyu, ila muntu yeyensi yunaa apogile awee molaala movamoonga venyu, akhopogiwa awee motomami wenyu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Yunaa apogile awee wa mwandyo movamoonga venyu, akhopogiwa awee motomami wenyu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Kete venaa Mwana wa Muntu aleakhiija ili khotomekelwa, ila aleiijaa khovatomekela vantu no khopumya opanga wakwe ili khovayawola vantu vinki.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovapon'ya vatulu vawele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe panaa valevakhopuma kho ihala la Yeliko, idale ikolo la vantu lalelamoloonda khonyuma. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Mompelo mwa njela monaa Yesu angile khokelaa, angile vapwale vatulu vawele. Apenee panaa valevategeela kete Yesu khokelaa epoo, alevajoma vapaala, “Meyaa, Mwana wa Daudi, khowonelee losongo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Vantu evoo vinki, valevavakhakela vapombole, ila evenee vendelela khojoma, “Meyaa, Mwana wa Daudi, khowonelee losongo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Apenee, Yesu akaimelela no khoveeta, avawolyaa, “Mokhopooga nevanojele chanuu?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Vakamoweela “Meyaa, tokhopooga miso gisu gawone!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Apenee Yesu avawonela losongo, avapalya miso gawe, ne apaponye vandya khowona, nanevo vamoloonda.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Vantu vakhomokowela ngilingili Yesu panaa akhwingela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe panaa valevatelela Yelusalemu, valevapikha kho khahala la Betifage, kho ketonda cha Mizeituni. Aleavatoma vahemba vakwe vawele, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />akavaweela, “Mopete kho khahala lenaa lepwale paulongolo wenyu. Panaa molaingela omoo, molamowona ndogowe atungagwaa palomwi no mwana ndogowe. Movatungule ne khovaleeta khwaane. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Mbe muntu yeyensi alavawolya, momowele, ‘Mwene, akhovapooga,’ nanoyo alavagombela movalete khwaane.” <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Mpola eji jensi jalejanojekha ili gadugame egoo ganaa galegapaalwa no molooti kete,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Movawele vantu va ihala la Yelusalemu kete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Mwami wenyu ijilee khwenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Omwene a mopolo, ne ijilee oko atantagaa pachanya ya ndogowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">ne amotantagaa mwanandogowe, mwanike wa ndogowe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Gechoo, vahemba evoo valevapeta khonojaa kete Yesu venaa aleavalagelelaja. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Valeeta ndogowe no mwanandogowe, vaala myenda jawe pachanya ya ejoo ndogowe, no Yesu ikhalaa pachanya yawe.<verse eid="MAT 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Vantu vinki valevaala myenda jawe monjela, ne vaange valevadomola vetambe vya mapeke no khovetoola monjela kho nguno ya khomokolya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Vaange angile vamolongola Yesu ne vaange angile vale kho nyuma yakwe, vensi alevajomaa lolii vapalaa, “Akoliwee Mwana wa Daudi. Afunyelagwaa yunaa iijile kho lina la Mwene. Akoliwee Matuunda yunaa apwale khochanya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ituungo lenaa Yesu akhwingela Yelusalemu, vantu vensi va ihala valevatempokha, vandya khwiwolya, “Oyo a nanuu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Vantu va idale lenaa angile lepwale no Yesu vavaweela, “Oyo a Yesu, wa khopuma kho ihala la Nazaleti wa nse ya Galilaya yunaa a molooti wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apetile kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Apenee Yesu ingelaa kho ibololo la Nyoomba ya Matuunda, akavadaga vantu vanaa angile vakhogola no khogolya vento vyawe omoo. Ajependola meja jawe ja evoo vanaa angile vakhogalolya mpia no khovependola vegoda ja vanaa angile vakhogolya njewa. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Akavaweela, “Yandekhagwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda, ‘Nyoomba yaane ilaawa ya kholombela.’ Ila onywenywe mwainogaja khowa ipinga la vasuki.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Yesu panaa angile apwale okhoo kho ibololo la Nyoomba ya Matuunda, vatulu ne valema, valevamopetela Yesu, nanoyo avapon'ya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ila vapumya matambekho valaala palomwi ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa, panaa valevawona matuntumu ganaa aleakhonoja Yesu, no khotegeela vana vakhojoma lolii kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda, vakhopalaa, “Akoliwee Mwana wa Daudi.” Valevakilwaa modugo. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Gechoo vamowolya Yesu, “Mbi okhotegeela venaa vana ewa vakhopaala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu akavaweela, “Avyenee nkhotegela. Panaa amba opwale kho owami wakhoo. Mbi mokhasoma Maandekho ga Matuunda ganaa gakhopaala, ‘Vana vado ne vakeke, valakhokolya.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Apenee Yesu akavalekha epoo, akapeta khogona kho khahala kha Betania.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akholigita ipeke la motini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maluko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Igolo lakwe melawo, Yesu panaa alekhotuwaa Yelusalemu, itegelaa njala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Apenee alewona ipeke la motini mompelo ya njela, awotelela pepi, ila awopikha otokhola viligi, ila angile otite matiti topo. Papenee agowela, “Okhalele khanke viligi khwandelya leelo mpakha nsiko jensi patokhola odugo.” Apaponye ipeke eloo lanyaala.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Vahemba panaa valevawona mpola eyoo, vakumyaa modugo. Vamowolya, “Kho kee ipeke ele lanyalaga timpu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu akavaweela, “Nkhovaweela khapanga, mbe mokhomogoomba Matuunda patokhola matungumalo, nanyu molakhowola khonoja kete venaa yaleyanojekha kho motini ogo, ninga mbe molakewela ketonda eke, ‘Okumpoke, wijutele mo ikhwa,’ ne ilanojekha gechoo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Ne mbe mokhogomba, chechensi kenaa molalomba Matuunda alavapela.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhowolwa khougela olaala wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu ingelaa khanke kho ibololo la Nyoomba ya Matuunda, ne panaa angile akholiga, molaala wa vanaa vakhopumya matambekho ne vakoombi va Vayahudi, viija khomowolya, “Okhonojaa mpola eje kho olaala kee? Ananuu yunaa akhopelagaa olaala owo?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu akavaweela, “Nane ndavawolya mpola yemwii topo. Mbe molanipalela, nane ndavapalela nkhonojaa mpola eje kho olaala wa ananuu. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Mbi, olaala wa Yohana wa khobatija alewapuma kwenii? Mbi alewapuma khochanya pa Matuunda ao khwa vantu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Apenee vandya khopalana venee kho venee, “Mbe, khomopalele kete alewapuma ‘Khochanya khwa Matuunda,’ alatowolya, ‘Kho kee alemokhamogomba Yohana Mobatiji?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Khanke, mbe khomopalele, kete alewapuma ‘Khwa vantu,’ khokhovogopa vantu kete, vantu valatokhokholanga, kho nguno vensi vakhogoomba kete Yohana angile molooti wa Matuunda.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Gechoo vakamoweela, “Khokhamanya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Apenee Yesu nanoyo akavaweela, “Nane khotopo nevapalele kete nkhonoja mpola eje kho olaala wa ananuu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa valomyana vawele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yesu endelelaa khopaala, “Mokhoheewa kee khougela mofwano ogo? Aleapwale muntu yomwii yunaa angile atite valomyana vawele. Akamoweela molomyana wa mwandyo, ‘Mwanane, leelo petaa onojee molemo kho mogoonda gwa mizabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Molomyana akamoweela, ‘Nsitile.’ Ila paulongolo agalolya maheewo gakwe, apeta khonoja molemo. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Apenee ise apeta khomoweela molomyana wakwe modo, avivyoo kete venaa aleamowela molomyana wakwe mokolo, nanoyo amowelaa, ‘Ndapeta daada,’ ila angile akhapeta. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Mbi, ananuu pakhate ya ewa vawele yunaa anojile kete venaa isewe alekhopogaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">“Valaala va Vayahudi vamoweela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">“A molomyana wa mwandyo.” Apenee Yesu akavaweela, Khapanga nkhovaweela, vakungan'ya khodi palomwi ne viketu, valavalongola khwingela kho owami wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kho nguno Yohana aleiija khwenyu ili avalagele njela ya khapanga, nanyu alemokhamogomba. Ila vakungan'ya khodi palomwi ne viketu alevamogoomba. Ninga panaa alemwagawona egoo gensi, alemokhagelokha no khogalekha mabe genyu no khomogomba Yohana.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa valemi kho mogoonda gwa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu akapaala, “Tegeleli mofwano goonge. Aleapwale muntu yomwii wa mogoonda, yunaa alealemaa mogoonda no khovyaala mizabibu, nanoyo aleajengaa lukiinga khopilima mogoonda, asembaa ileende la khominyela viligi vya mizabibu no khojeenga kedindiga kho nguno ya valindeleli va mogoonda. Apenee akhodishaa mogoonda ogoo khwa valemi, nanoyo andya mosiingi gwa khopeta kho nse ya khotale. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Ituungo la makongola panaa alelapikha, aleavalagelelya vatomami vakwe khwa valemi evoo, ili vapete vamosolele lwande ya makongola gakwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Ila valemi evoo valevavagweela vatomami evoo, yomwii vamokowa, no yoonge valevamowolaga, no yoonge valevamokowa ne mabwee. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Owa mogoonda aleavamotoma khanke vatomami vaange vinki khokela evoo va mwandyo. Ila valemi evoo valevavanojela vibe kete venaa valevavanojela evoo va mwandyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Paudugo amotoma mwanakwe khwa valemi evoo, okho khwipalela, Oyo a mwanane, valamokholya. <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Ila valemi evoo panaa alevamowona mwanakwe, viweela, ‘Oyo amwenee mosaali wa mogoonda ogo, seji khomolage ne mogoonda owo olaawa osaali wisu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Gechoo, vamogweela, vamokenkha panji ya mogoonda, no khomowolaga.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu avawolya, “Gechoo owa mogoonda gwa mizabibu panaa aliija, alavanoja mbi evoo valemi?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Vakamoweela, “Alavawolaga vibe patopo khovawonela losongo, khanke alavapela mogoonda ogoo vantu vaange vanaa amba vakhomopeela lwande ya makongola khwi ituungo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Apenee Yesu akavaweela, “Mbi, mokhasoma kho Maandekho ga Matuunda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Ibwee lenaa valesitaga vajeengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">seji lawaaga ibwee ilaala la mosingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Mwene amwene anogaja mpola eye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nanelo a mpola ya khotokumya.’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Gechoo nkhovaweela, owami wa khochanya pa Matuunda, olawochwa khwenyu no khopeelwa vantu vanaa nkha Vayahudi vanaa vakhokhowola khonoja mpola jenaa Matuunda akhopooga. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Gechoo, muntu yeyensi mbe alagwela kho ibwee ele, alawunekha, mbe lelamogwela lelamotulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Valaala va vapumya matambekho ne Mafalisayo, panaa valevategeela mefwano ja Yesu, valevatembola kete angile akhovapaala venee. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Gechoo, angile vakhopooga njela ya khomogweela, ila vavatungumula vantu kho nguno evenee valevakhomotembola a molooti wa Matuunda.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa endya ya wenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu akapaala nanevo khanke khwa mefwano, khwa khovaweela, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Owami wa Matuunda wipyanile no mwami yomwii yunaa aleamwandalelaa molomyana wakwe endya ya wenga. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Mwami oyoo avalagelelya vatomami vakwe vapete khoveeta vanaa valevalalekhagwa viije kho endya ya wenga, ila vensi vanaa valevalalekhagwa valevasiita khwija. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Apenee mwami oyoo avalagelelya khanke vatomami vaange no khovaweela, ‘Mopete movawele vanaa valalekhagwa kete, Endya ya wenga ele teali, kho nguno vento vyensi nandalelaga. Nasenjaga ng'oombe jenaa jenonile, palomwi ne nkholo jenaa jenonile. Gechoo, ijagi kho endya ya wenga!’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ila vantu vanaa angile valalekhagwa, alevakhasosopa. Vapeta kho melemo jawe, yomwii apetaa kho mogoonda gwakwe, no yoonge apetaa khogolya idookha lakwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />ne vaange vavagweela vatomami va mwami, vawakowa modugo no khovawolaga. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mwami oyoo panaa aleategelaa gensi ganaa gapumelaga kho vatomami vakwe, akilwaa modugo. Apenee avalagelelya masinjala vakwe vapete khovawolaga vaolagi evoo no khotima ihala lawe. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Khanke, mwami oyoo akavaweela vatomami vakwe, ‘Vento vyensi vya endya ya wenga vyandalelagwa, ila evenee valevabyeeda kholalekhwa khwawe. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Gechoo, petagi kho njela, no khomolalekha muntu yeyensi yunaa moliitanga nanoyo mowelagi iije kho endya ya wenga.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Vatomami evoo vawookha no khopeta monjela, vavakongan'ya vantu vensi vanaa valevitaanga nanevo, vanaa angile vasoga ao vabe. Apenee nyoomba ya endya ya wenga yijola vahenja.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Mwami panaa aleingelaa mokhate ili avalamoche vahenja, aleamowonaa muntu yomwii yunaa angile akhalyala mwenda gwa wenga. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mwami amowolya, ‘Molaasi waane, kho kee wingelaga epa patokhola kholyala mwenda gwa wenga?’ Ila muntu oyoo aleakhapala chechensi. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Apenee mwami akavaweela vatomami vakwe, ‘Momotuunge muntu oyo mekhono ne megolo mopete momojutele panji kho kiiti. Okhoo alakota no kholoman'ya mino khwa osaati.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Apenee Yesu amalelya khwa khopaala, “Vantu vanaa vakhwetwa a vinki, ila vanaa vakhosagolwa a vatiiti.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela kholepa khodi khwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Mafalisayo vakapuma panji khopalana venaa valamogwela Yesu khwa mpola jakwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Apenee vavalagelelya vahemba vawe khwa Yesu palomwi ne valaasi va Helode khomowolya empola eje, “Molaangi, khomanyile kete ogwegwe ole muntu wa khapanga, avivyoo okholiga maligi ga Matuunda khwa khapanga. Ninga gechoo khomanyile kete ogwegwe okhakhomotungumala muntu yeyensi ninga mbe awee atite olaala wa khochanya. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Gechoo, okhowele ogwegwe okhoheewa chanuu? Mbi a visoga osweswe kholepa khodi khwa Kaisali mwami wa Loma, ao khotopo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ila Yesu aleamanyaa kete vantu ewa angile vakhomogema. Gechoo akavaweela, “Onywenywe van'ya, kho kee mokhongema? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Mondagele mpia eyoo, yenaa mokhotomela kholepa khodi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Nanevo vakamopeela kechele kemwii. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Apenee Yesu avawolya, “Osho ne lina ele, a ga nanuu?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Vakamoweela, “A ga Kaisali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Apenee, Yesu akavaweela, “Mopeli Kaisali ganaa gakwe, ne venaa vya Matuunda mopeli Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Panaa valevategeela gechoo, valevakumya modugo, vamolekha ne vakawookha epoo.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maligi khougela ofufolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Nsiko ayeyoo, vamoonga va Masadukayo vanaa angile vakhopaala khotopo ofufolo valevamopetela Yesu no khomowolya, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Molaangi, Musa aleatwandekela kete, “Mbe muntu achee, no khomolekha molijakwe atokhola mwana, modogwakwe amosole mosimbe oyoo, ili khomolelela modogwakwe mwana yunaa afwilee. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Apenee valevapwale vadogo saba. Wa mwandyo aleatolaa, afwaa patokhola kholekha mwana, apenee modogwakwe wa owele amosolaa mosimbe oyoo. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Yawaa avivyoo khwa modogwakwe wa owele no wa otato mpakha no oyoo wa saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Vadogo evoo vensi saba panaa valevafwaa, no mosimbe oyoo nanoyo afwaa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Gechoo, khowelee, nsiko yenaa vachi valafufokha, mokhiima oyoo alaawa moliji wa ananuu? Kho nguno vensi saba angile molijawe.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mokhopweela, kho nguno mokhamanya Maandekho ga Matuunda ninga olaala wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kho nguno vachi panaa valafufokha palaawa khotopo khotoola ninga khotoolwa, ila valaawa kete vatomami va khochanya khwa Matuunda vanaa vakhavakhotoola ni khotoolwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ila khougela khofufokha khwa vachi, mbi mokhale mosome Maandekho ga Matuunda venaa aleavawelaa? Aleavawelaa kete, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Onene a Matuunda wa Abulahamu no Matuunda wa Isaka no Matuunda wa Yakobo.’ Gechoo, Matuunda Omwene nkha Matuunda wa vachi, ila a Matuunda wa vapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Madale ga vantu panaa valevategeela gechoo, valevakumya modugo kho maligi gakwe.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njaanga nkolo khokela jensi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maluko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Mafalisayo panaa valevategeela kete Yesu angile avanojaga Masadukayo vakhapale chechensi, vikungan'ya palomwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Apenee yomwii wawe, yunaa angile molaangi wa njaanga ja Musa, amowolya Yesu khwa khomogema. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Molaangi, kho njaanga jensi ja Matuunda, a njaanga kee yenaa nkolo khokela jensi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu akamoweela, “ ‘Motogwe Mwene Matuunda wakhoo khwa mooyo gwakhoo gwensi, khwa maheewo gakhoo gensi, ne khwa masala gakhoo gensi.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Njaanga eye ayenee yenaa nkolo khokela jensi, khanke ayenee ya mwandyo. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ne njaanga ya owele yenaa nkolo kete eyoo, ‘Motogwe mwiyo kete venaa witogwile gwegwee.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Njaanga jensi ja Musa ne malaangi ga valooti va Matuunda vekhwisowelela njaanga ejoo jewele.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisto a nanuu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Mafalisayo panaa valevikungan'ya palomwi, Yesu akavawolya. <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Mokhoheewa kee khougela Kilisto?” Mbi a mwana wa nanuu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Nanevo vakamoweela a mwana wa Daudi.<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu akavawolya, “Gechoo, nekhowolekhaa mbi, Daudi panaa kholongolwaa no Moye wa Matuunda, akhomweta Kilisto kete a Mwene? Kho nguno Daudi aleapalaa, <verse eid="MAT 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Mwene Matuunda aleamowelaa Mwene waane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Wikhale kho lwande yaane ya molyelo lwande lonaa lotite ngulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mpakha panaa ndavakinda vanyambuda vakhoo.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Mbe Daudi akhomweta Kilisto, ‘Mwene,’ nokhowola mbi Kilisto awee mwanakwe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Khotopo muntu yeyensi yunaa aleakhowola khomoweela lelensi Yesu, khanke khwandelya ituungo eloo, khotopo muntu yunaa aleagema khomowolya.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovalanga vahemba vakwe viyangalele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maluko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Apenee Yesu alewelaa eloo idale la vantu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo vapelagwa olaala wa khodadamola njaanga ja Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Gechoo mokhopogiwa khovategeela no khovaamba mpola jensi jenaa vakhovaweela, ila mokhalonde manoji gawe, kho nguno mpola jenaa vakhopaala nkha ajenee vakhonoja. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Valaala ewa vakhonogelelya njaanga ntembu no khovakepolya onywenywe mo mavega genyu, ila evenee vakhosiita khogoloola ninga lojala vapate khovaalya onywenywe. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Evenee vakhonoja manoji gawe gensi ili khwilageela khwa vantu. Vakholyala kento kenaa chanogelelagwa khwa ntila, ne mokhate yakhwe epwale talatasi yenaa yandekhwaga njaanga ja Musa, kho osho jawe no kho mekhono jawe. Khanke vakholyaala nkanju ja vegundo vetale khokela nkanju ja vaange no khongelelya vegundo kho myenda jawe. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Nsiko ja wenga vakhotogwa khwikhala kho vegoda vya vantu valaala. Ninga kho nyoomba ja khwitangela Vayahudi vatogilwe khwikhala kho vegoda vya olongolo khwa valaala. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Khanke vatogilwe modugo vantu vavalamoche khwa khokoliwaa, ne vakhotogwa vantu vavaete ‘Valaangi kho lwande ja magolyo.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ila onywenywe mokhagombe khwetwa, ‘Molaangi’, kho nguno motite Molaangi yomwii topo, nanyu vensi mole vadogo. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Khanke, mokhamwete muntu yeyensi ‘Daada epa paliwelelo’, kho nguno motite Daada yomwii topo yunaa apwale khochanya. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Khanke, mokhagombe khwetwa, ‘Molaala’, kho nguno motite Molaala yomwii topo, nanoyo a Kilisto. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa akhopogwa awee molaala movamoonga venyu, akhopogiwa awee motomami wenyu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khwitantya pachanya khokela vaange, Matuunda alamotelemola panse. Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa khwitelemola panse, Matuunda alamotantya pachanya.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akholegeta on'ya wawe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maluko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Molakewona onywenywe valaangi va njaanga ja Musa nanyu Mafalisayo, vanaa mole van'ya, kho nguno mokhogilya vantu vaange khwingela kho wami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda khwa malaangi genyu. Onywenywe venee akhamokhwingela omoo, khanke mokhovagilya ne vaange vanaa vakhopooga khwingela. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Khanke, molekewona onywenywe valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo vanaa mokhovasukha vasimbe vento vyawe vyensi, oko mokhwinoja mole vantu vasoga khwa kholoomba maloombi matale khwa vantu. Kho nguno eye Matuunda alavatengemekha vikhamu.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Molakewona onywenywe valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo. Onywee van'ya, kho nguno mokhopilima kho nse yensi ne kholowokha ikhwa, ili khomopooga muntu yomwii yunaa alalonda njela jenyu. Ila panaa mokhomopata mokhomonoja awee mobe mala jewele khokela onywenywe, no khomonoja apete kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga mala jewele khokela onywenywe.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Molakewona onywenywe valaala vatulu, kho nguno mokholiga, ‘Mbe muntu akholapa khwa Nyoomba ya Matuunda, kelapo echoo nkha kento. Ila mbe alalapa khwa zahabu yenaa ipwale khwa Nyoomba ya Matuunda, muntu oyoo akhopogiwa anojee kete venaa alealapa.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Oywenywe vatulu valeele. A kento kee kenaa kekolo, zahabu ao Nyoomba ya Matuunda, yenaa ekhoenoja zahabu igombwee? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Khanke mokhovaliga vantu kete, ‘Mbe muntu akholapa kho lwande ja khopumelyaa itambekho nkha kento, ila mbe muntu alalapa khwa itambekho lenaa letolilwe pachanya ya meja ya khopumelya matambekho, muntu oyoo akhopogiwa anojee kete venaa alealapaa.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Onywee vatulu, a kento kee kenaa kekolo, eloo itambekho ao pa meja ya khopumelya matambekho, yenaa ekhonoja itambekho eloo egoombwe no Matuunda? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Gechoo, mbe muntu akholapa kho meja ya khopumelya matambekho, muntu oyoo khowaa alapagaa pa meja ejoo ja khopumelya itambekho ne khwa vento vyensi venaa vepwale pachanya yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Khanke, mbe muntu akholapa khwa Nyoomba ya Matuunda, khowaa alapagaa kho eyoo Nyoomba ya Matuunda, no khwa Matuunda yunaa khwikhalaa omoo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Nanoyo yunaa akholapa khwa khochanya pa Matuunda, khowaa alapaga khwa kegoda cha kewami cha Matuunda, no khwa Matuunda mwenee yunaa khwikhalaa kho kegoda echoo.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Molakewona onywenywe valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo, onywee van'ya. Kho nguno mokhopumyaa lwande ya ikomi khwa Matuunda, vento vya mpia nndo, kete ntetele, matiti ganaa gakhotukelela, veloongo no onsambya. Ila mokhosiita mpola nkolo khokela njaanga ja Musa, kete mpola jenaa jekhogombekha khwa Matuunda, losongo no khogoomba, egoo agenee mokhopogiwa moganojele gensi makolo ne mado palomwi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Onywee valaala vatulu, mokhopumyaa ngingii mo keng'weela, ila mokhomela mbogo.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Molakewona onywenywe valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo, vanaa mole van'ya. Mopwale kete vantu vanaa vakhosiinga vekhombe ne ibakuli panji topo, ila mokhate vijolajaa vento venaa mwavipatile khwa njela ja wiwi no wimi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Onywenywe Mafalisayo vatulu, singagi taali kekhombe panji, apenee kelaawa chelopaga panji.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Molakewona onywenywe valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo, vanaa mokhwinoja vasoga. Kho nguno mopwale kete makhabuli ganaa gapakilwe echokaa. Panji gakhowa ganogelaga, ila mokhate gijolaga makupa ga vachi ne ochafu mwinki. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Gechoo, ninga nanyu mokhwigela khwa vantu khwa panji kete a vasoga, ila mokhate mwijolaga kete vanaa vakhwinoja vasoga no obe.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopalela itengemekho lawe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Molakewona onywenywe valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne Mafalisayo, vanaa mokhwinoja vasoga. Kho nguno mokhojeenga visoga makhabuli ga valooti va Matuunda no khonogelelya visoga makhabuli ga vantu vasoga. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Nanyu mokhopaala, ‘Mbe angakhowee khopwale khwi ituungo lenaa vakoko visu angile vapanga, anga khotopo khokhowole khwiyalya nanevo khovawolaga valooti va Matuunda.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Khanke, khwa khopaala gechoo, mokholageela kete nanyu mole valelwa va makoko jenyu vanaa valevawolaga valooti va Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Gechoo, petagi modugamye molemo gonaa makoko jenyu valevagwandya. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Onywee vanaa mopwale kete njokha ne vana va njokha, molakhowola mbi khobegokha itengemekho la khosombelwa kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi patokhola odugo? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Kho nguno eyoo, onene nkhovatoma khwenyu valooti va Matuunda ne vantu va masala ne valaangi. Ila vamoonga vawe, molavawolaga no khovapagekha pachanya pamosalaba, ne vaange molavakowa ne menyepo ja ntila kho nyoomba jenyu ja khwitangela Vayahudi, ne vaange molavapoga ihala khwa ihala ili khovagayanja. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Gechoo, Matuunda alavatengemekha onywenywe, kho nguno ya khovawolaga vensi vanaa vakhogoombwa nanoyo. Khopuma khowolagwa khwa Abeli yunaa angile atokhola ibe lelensi, ninga khopikela ncha ya Zakalia mwana wa Balakia, yunaa vakoko venyu valevamowolaga pakhate ya Nyoomba ya Matuunda ne meja ya khopumelya matambekho. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, vantu va olelwa owo, valatengemekhwa no Matuunda kho nguno ya mabe ega gensi.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avatogilwe vantu va Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34">Luka 13:34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Apenee Yesu apalaa, “Onywee vantu va Yelusalemu, Onywee vantu va Yelusalemu, vanaa mokhovawolaga valooti va Matuunda no khovakowa mabwee vantu vanaa Matuunda angile valagelelajwaa khwenyu. Ituungo lensi nkhogema khovakungan'ya onywenywe kete venaa nkoko khotokongan'ya tupiiya twakwe kho mapapa gakwe, ila onywenywe alemokhapoga. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Avivyoo, no Matuunda alalekha Nyoomba yenyu yenaa mokhomokumbekela ipagala no opeena. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Gechoo, nkhovaweela, khotopo mombone khanke mpakha ituungo lenaa molapala kete, ‘Afunyelwee yunaa ijilee khwa olaala wa Mwene.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopalela khonoonwa khwa Nyoomba ya Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Maluko 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luka 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu aleapuma kho ibololo la Nyoomba ya Matuunda ili awooke, vahemba vakwe vakamopetela ili vamolagele majeengo ga Nyoomba ga Matuunda venaa gakhonogela. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Apenee Yesu akavaweela, “Avyenee, seji mokhogawona ega gensi majeengo ga Nyoomba ya Matuunda venaa manogu. Ila nkhovaweela khapanga, khotopo ninga ibwee lemwii lenaa lelasiga pachanya ya leenge, gensi galabomolwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magayo no ogayi ganaa giijile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Apenee Yesu akapuma akapeta kho ketonda cha Mizeituni no khwikhala okhoo, vahemba vakwe vamopetela valeemwi no khomowolya, “Khowelee mpola ejoo, jelapumela nale? Khanke, a kento kee kenaa kelalagela wijelo wakhoo no odugo wa liwelelo?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mwiyangalelage visoga, muntu yeyensi akhiije avapepele. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kho nguno vantu vinki valiija no khotomela lina laane, no khopaala, ‘Onene amwenee Kilisto.’ Vantu ewa valavapepela vantu vinki. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Kho ituungo eloo molategeela mpola ja wologo palomwi ne mepwepweto ja wologo, ila mokhatungumale kho nguno ega gensi gakhopogiwa khopumeela, ila odugo olaawa okhale okhapikha. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Nse yemwii elikowa ne nse yeenge, ne vantu va owami womwii olikowa no owami woonge. Palaawa ne njala lofufu palomwi ne malindimya galapumela kho lwande jensi. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ega gensi galaawa kete mwandyo wa osaati wa mokhiima yunaa akhopooga khwitungola.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Khwi ituungo eloo, vantu vensi va paliwelelo valavasimbela onywenywe, valaawa vakhovagweela, no khovagayanjaa no khovawolaga kho nguno mokhongoomba onene. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Apenee vantu vinki valalekha khongoomba. Nanevo valaawa vakhwigalokha no khwisimbela venee khwa venee. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Avivyoo khwi ituungo eloo, valapumela valooti vinki va opepi, nanevo valavapepela vantu vinki. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Khanke, vantu vinki valalekha khwitogwa kho nguno mabe galaawa gongelekhaga. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ila yeyensi yunaa alikhamelelya mpakha kho odugo, amwenee yunaa Matuunda alamopon'ya. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Apenee, Mpola Nsoga ya owami wa Matuunda elatengwa kho liwelelo lensi, ili vantu va nse jensi vategeele okhombe wa khapanga wa Matuunda. Ne ituungo lenaa vantu vensi valaawa vategelaga mpola yakwe, apenee panaa odugo oliija.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsiko ja magayo makolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maluko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Epoo pamyakha, Danieli molooti wa Matuunda, aleapalaa geeke, Ituungo eloo panaa molawona kento cha khosimbya ne kenaa kekholeeta onooni kepwale mokhate ya Nyoomba ya Matuunda, no oyoo yunaa akhosoma, amanye. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Epoo, vantu vensi vanaa valaawa kho Yudea, viije vakembelelage kho vetonda. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Yeyensi yunaa alaawa pachanya ya nyoomba yakwe, akhatelemoke khosola chechensi mokhate mwakwe, ila akembele. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Avivyoo, no muntu yunaa alaawa kho mogoonda, akhatuwe khosola ikhoti lakwe, ila akembele. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Kholavawonela losongo vakhiima vanaa valaawa vatite ndaa ne vanaa valaawa vakhoncha vana kho nsiko ejoo. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Molombagi Matuunda ili khokembela khwenyu khokhawe ituungo la mpepo nkhakha ao Nsiko ya Khosuupa. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kho nsiko ejoo, vantu valapata magayo makolo modugo, ganaa gakhale gapumelage khopuma khowombwaa khwa liwelelo mpakha seji, ninga gechoo, khotopo giije gapumeele khanke magayo kete egoo. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ne mbe Matuunda angaaleke khopongolya nsiko ja magayo, khotopo ninga muntu yomwii yunaa angaalapona khofwa. Ila Matuunda alapongolya nsiko ejoo kho nguno ya vantu vanaa aleavasagolaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Kho nsiko ejoo, muntu mbe alavawela, ‘Kunagi, Kilisto apwale epa,’ ao ‘Apwale okhoo’ mokhiije momogombe. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kho nguno valiija valooti va opepi ne vantu vanaa valaawa vakhwiyeeta evenee a Kilisto. Nanevo valanoja lomekho nkolo ne matuntumu ganaa galakhowola khovapepela ninga vantu vanaa valevasagolwa no Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Tegelelaji, navawelaga ega gensi panaa gakhale gapumeele.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Ninga mbe vantu valavawela, ‘Kilisto apwale kho itenengwa,’ mokhiije mogemage khopeta okhoo, ao ninga mbe valavawela ‘Kilisto iswekhagaa mokhate,’ mokhiije mogombage. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Manyagi kete khwija khwa Mwana wa Muntu, kholaawa khwa khotimpokelya. Kholaawa kete lopwiito venaa lokhomweenkha khwa khotimpokelya khopuma keeya ne apaponye ekhwigela kho meli.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Kho nguno pepensi panaa palaawa ne vechi, epoo apenee ne mbesi jelaawa jakonganaga.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khwija khwa Mwana wa Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Magayo gensi panaa galakela, lyonse lelaketelwa kiiti, no mweli golalekha khopumyaa welo khanke, ne njota nanejo jelaagwa panse, no Matuunda aladegandeja kela kento cha khochanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Epoo apenee lomekho ya Mwana wa Muntu eligela khochanya khwa Matuunda. Ne vantu vensi va liwelelo valakota modugo, ne valamowona Mwana wa Muntu ijilee mo maluunde khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda oko atite ngulu akilageela olaala wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Nanoyo alavatoma vatomami vakwe va pachanya, nanevo valakowa mbuuto yenaa ekhokoota vikhamu, ne valavakongan'ya vantu vakwe vanaa aleavasagolaa khopuma kho lwande jensi ja liwelelo.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kento cha khwiliga khopuma kho ipeke la motini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Iligagi mofwano ogo khopuma khwi ipeke la motini. Ituungo lenaa molawona matiti gakwe madagadu no olowa wakwe okhowelekha, manyagi kete ituungo la mbula ja mwandyo, watelelaga. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Avivyoo, nanyu panaa molawona egoo gakhopumeela, manyagi kete, ituungo la khwija khwa Mwana wa Muntu latelelaga. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, vantu va keleli eke khotopo vasile panaa mpola ejoo jensi jekhale jepumeele. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Khochanya khwa Matuunda ne liwelelo velakela, ila mpola jaane khotopo jiije jikele ninga nsiko yemwii.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khotopo yunaa amanyile nsiko ninga ituungo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maluko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Ila khougela nsiko ya khwija khwa Mwana wa Muntu, khotopo yunaa amanyile, ninga vatomami va khochanya khwa Matuunda, ninga Mwana, vensi vakhamanya, ila Daada topo aleemwi amwenee amanyile. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kete venaa angile epwale kho ituungo la Nuhu, avyenee venaa elaawa ituungo la Mwana wa Muntu panaa alaawa ijilee. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kho nsiko ejoo, panaa mbula nkolo angile ekhale etoonye no khokenkelelya meje minki, vantu angile vakholya no khong'weela, vakhotoola no khotoolwa, mpakha panaa yaleyapikha nsiko yenaa Nuhu aleingelaa mokhate ya ipogo ikolo yenaa ekhwetwa safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Vantu evoo valevakhamanya chanuu kenaa kelapumela, mpakha panaa mbula nkolo modugo yaletoonya, ne meje minki gavawolaga vantu vensi. Gechoo avyenee venaa elaawa ituungo lenaa Mwana wa Muntu alaawa ijilee. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Khwi ituungo eloo, vantu vawele valaawa khomogoonda. Yomwii alasolwa no yoonge alalekhwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Vakhiima vawele valaawa vakhosha palomwi, yomwii alasolwa no yoonge alalekhwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Gechoo, keyolagi patopo khokhatala, kho nguno mokhamanya nsiko ninga ituungo lenaa Mwene wenyu alatuwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Momanyile visoga kete mokhalakhaye angakhamanya ituungo lenaa mwiwi alaija khwiwa, angakhakeyola ili mwiwi akhabomole nyoomba yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Avivyoo, ninga nanyu keyolagi, kho nguno Mwana wa Muntu aliija ituungo lenaa mokhalemanya.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Motomami mkhapanga no motomami yunaa nkha mkhapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Yesu akavawolya vahemba vakwe, akipaala, Ananuu yunaa a motomami mkhapanga no owa masala? A oyoo yunaa mwene wakwe amotolagaa avimelele vatomami vayakwe khokhayakwe, ili awee akhovapeela endya khwi ituungo la khapanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Afunyelagwaa motomami oyoo, kete meyaa wakwe panaa alatuwa, alamopikha akhotomama gechoo. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, meyaa wakwe alamotola awee mwimeleli wa nsao jakwe jensi. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ila motomami mobe, alipalela mwenee kete, meyaa wakwe alatin'ya khotuuwa, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />nanoyo andya khovakowa vatomami vayakwe, nanayo andya kholya modugo no khong'weela modugo palomwi ne vakholwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Apenee meyaa wakwe alatuwa nsiko yenaa motomami akhayewela ne ituungo lenaa akhalemanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Meyaa wakwe alamokowa vikhamu no khomosoomba khonaa vapwale vanaa vakhwinoja vasoga. Okhoo valakota no kholoman'ya mino khwa osaati.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa valelee ikomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Yesu akavaweela vahemba mofwano goonge kete, “Khwi ituungo eloo, owami wa pachanya khwa Matuunda olapyanekelwa no mofwano gwa valelee ikomi vanaa valevasola kholoboi jawe no khopeta khomopokela mwenga wa kegwisha. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Vataano mwi ikomi evoo angile valeele, ne vataano vaange angile vatite masala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Evoo valeele vataano valevasola kholoboi jawe topo, ila valevakhasola makuta gaange ga khongelelya mo etala ejoo. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Ila evoo vataano vaange vanaa angile vatite masala, valevasola kholoboi jawe no khokepola makuta mo nsopa ga khongelelya mo kholoboi jawe. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Mwenga wa kegwisha aleatin'yaa khwija, evoo valelee vensi vakatindiila no khogona ndoolo.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Pakhate ya otiko panaa walewapikha, vantu vandya khojoma no khopaala, ‘Kunagi, mwenga wa kegwisha ijilee. Petagi momopokele.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Apenee evoo valelee vensi valawela no khojinogelelya kholoboi jawe. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Ila evoo valelee vanaa angile valeele, vavaweela valelee va masala, ‘Tokholoomba motopele makuta genyu kedo, kho nguno kholoboi jisu jekhopooga kholima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Valelee vanaa angile vatite masala vavaweela, ‘Khotopo, kho nguno makuta ganaa khotite, gakhatokwela osweswe vensi. Hamo mopete mogole khonaa vakhogolya makuta ili mwigolele.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Apenee evoo valeele vakapeta khogola makuta. Panaa angile vapetile khogola makuta, mwenga wa kegwisha akapikha. Valelee vanaa angile vatite masala vanaa angile viyandalelaga, vingela palomwi nanoyo mo nyoomba yenaa wenga angile okhonojekha, no molyango gwadeendwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Khatuungo, valelee evoo valeele, vatuuwa no khopikha molyango gwadendagwa. Vandyaa khweta, ‘Meyaa, meyaa.’ Khodigolelee molyango. <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />‘Ila mwenga wa kegwisha akavaweela,’ khapanga, onene nkhavamanya onywenywe.”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Apenee Yesu amalelya khwa khopaala, “Gechoo, keyolagi, kho nguno mokhamanya nsiko ninga ituungo lenaa Mwana wa Muntu aliija.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa vatomami vatato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Khanke, Yesu akapaala, owami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda olapyanekelwa no mofwano gwa muntu yunaa angile atite mosenjo motale. Panaa angile akhale khwandya mosenjo gwakwe, etaa vatomami vakwe, akavapeela nsao yakwe ili vayimelele. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Aleavapelaa kela yomwii khopumana no olaala wakwe. Akamopeela wa mwandyo kechele alufu jetaano ja zahabu, no yoonge kechele alufu jiwele ja zahabu, no yoonge kechele alufu yemwii ya zahabu. Apenee andyaa mosenjo gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Motomami yunaa aleapelwaa kechele alufu jetaano ja zahabu, akapeta nanejo khotomamela molemo gwa khogola no khogolya vento, apataa ne vechele viinge alufu jetaano ja zahabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Avivyoo, no motomami yunaa aleapelwaa vechele alufu jiwele ja zahabu, nanoyo apataa vechele viinge vewele vya zahabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ila motomami oyoo yunaa aleapelwaa kechele alufu yemwii ya zahabu, omwenee apetaa khoseemba ileende ayepuselaa vechele evyoo vya zahabu cha meyaa wakwe.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Ituungo itale panaa lalelakela, meyaa wa vatomami evoo atuwaa, avetaa vatomami vakwe ili vamopalele venaa vatomelaga nsao jakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Motomami yunaa aleapelwaa vechele alufu jetaano ja zahabu, ijaa no khomoletela vechele viinge alufu jetaano ja zahabu, akapaala, ‘Meyaa, alewanipeela vechele alufu jetaano ja zahabu, ili njetomamele molemo.’ ‘Seji kunaa, vyongelekhaga vechele viinge alufu jetaano ja zahabu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />‘Meyaa wakwe amowelaa, wanogajaa visoga.’ ‘Ogwegwe ole motomami mosoga no yunaa okhogombekha, kho nguno ogwegwe wawaaga okhogombekha kho vento vitiiti, gechoo ndakhonoja owee ole mwimeleli wa nsao nyinki. Wiije khotogwee palomwi.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Motomami yunaa aleapelwaa vechele alufu jewele ja zahabu, nanoyo ijaa ne vechele viinge alufu jewele ja zahabu, akamoweela, ‘Meyaa, alewanipeela vechele alufu jewele ja zahabu. Seji kunaa, vyongelekhaga vechele viinge alufu jewele ja zahabu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />‘Meyaa wakwe amowelaa, wanogajaa visoga.’ ‘Ogwegwe ole motomami mosoga no yunaa okhogombekha, kho nguno ogwegwe wawaaga okhogombekha kho vento vitiiti, gechoo ndakhonoja owee ole mwimeleli wa nsao nyinki. Ijoo khosekelele palomwi.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Ila motomami yunaa aleapelwaa vechele alufu yemwii vya zahabu, ijaa no khopaala, ‘Meyaa, onene alenemanyile kete ogwegwe ole muntu moleewi modugo. Opwale kete muntu yunaa akhokongola makongola khonaa aleakhavyala, no khokongola khonaa aleokhavyala mbeyo. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Alenatungumala khoepwelya nsao yakhoo, napeta khoesembela panse. Gechoo, solaa nsao yakhoo.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Meyaa wakwe akamoweela, “ ‘Ogwegwe ole motomami mobe no mokhata.’ ‘Mbe angaomanyile kete onene nkhokongola makongola khonaa nkhavyala no khokongan'ya khonaa nkhaminja mbeyo yeyensi. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Gechoo, angaamba visoga mbe angaotoole vechele vyaane vya zahabu khwa vantu vanaa vakhopumya maongelekho panaa okhotoola mpia jakhoo, ili nsiko ya khotuuwa kwaane, angandavesola vechele vyaane palomwi ne maongelekho. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Apenee meyaa wakwe alagelelya vantu vaange ili vamosuke vechele evyoo, vamopele motomami yunaa angile atite vechele alufu ikomi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kho nguno yunaa atite kento, alapelwa no khongelelwa. Ila muntu yunaa atokhola ninga kento, ninga echoo kenaa atite, alasukhwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Apenee meyaa wawe akapaala, mosombeli panji motomami mobe. No omoo amwenee monaa vantu valaawa vakhokoota no kholoman'ya mino.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itengemekho nsiko ya odugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Ituungo la Mwana wa Muntu panaa aliija kho olaala wakwe oko alepalomwi ne vatomami vensi va khochanya khwa Matuunda. Epoo apenee alikhala pachanya pa kegoda chakwe kelaala cha owami. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Vantu va nse jensi valakongana paolongolo wakwe, nanoyo alavabegola kho maloondo gawele, kete mosoongi venaa khojebegolaa nkholo ne mboli. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Kete venaa mosoongi khojetolaa nkholo kho lwande lwakwe lwa molyelo, ne mboli kho lwande lwakwe lwa mokege. Avivyoo, Mwana wa Muntu nanoyo alavatola vantu vanaa vakhonoja masoga lwande lwakwe lwa molyelo, ne vanoja mabe kho lwande lwakwe lwa mokege.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />“Apenee Mwami alavawela evoo vanaa vapwale kho lwande lwakwe lwa molyelo, ‘Ijagi onywenywe vanaa Daada yaane avafunyelagaa. Ingelagi kho owami wonaa Matuunda aleavandalela mpuma khowombwaa khwa liwelelo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kho nguno panaa angile ntite njala, mwanipelile endya, ne panaa nalenitegeela nyoota, mwanipeela meje, ne panaa angile nde mohenja, mwanipokeela kho nyoomba jenyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Panaa angile ntokhola myenda, mwanipelile myenda, ne panaa angile nde molwile, mwalemwandwalyaa. Ne panaa angile natungagwa mokhandulunge, alemwiija khongendela.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Gechoo, vantu evoo vanaa angile vakhonoja ganaa gakhogoombwa paolongolo wa Matuunda valambwela, ‘Mwene, nale alekhwakhowona otite njala nasu khwakhopeela endya, ao otite nyoota khwakhopeela meje? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Khanke, nale angile ole mohenja, nasu khwakhopokeela kho nyoomba jisu? Ao panaa angile ole otokhola myenda, khwakhopeela myenda? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Khanke nale khwakhowonile ole molwile, nasu khwakholwalyaa? Ao otungilwe mokhandulunge, nasu khwiija khokhogendela?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Nanoyo Mwami alavawela, ‘Nkhovaweela khapanga, kento chechensi kenaa mwamonogelile yeyensi mo vadogo vaane ewa vanaa vado, mwanogelilye onene.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Apenee Mwami alavawela vantu vanaa vapwale kho lwande lwa mokege, ‘Wokhagi epa, onywenywe vanaa Matuunda avaligitagaa. Petagi kho moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi, gonaa gopwale kho nguno ya Khatawe ne vatomami vakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kho nguno panaa angile ntite njala, alemokhanipela endya, ne panaa angile nitegeela nyoota, alemokhanipela meje. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Ne panaa angile nde mohenja, alemokhanipokela kho nyoomba jenyu, ne panaa angile ntokhola myenda, alemokhanipela myenda. Panaa angile nde molwile, alemokhiija khondwalyaa, ne panaa angile ntungilwe mokhandulunge, alemokhiija khombona.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Papene, vantu evoo vanaa vapwale kho mokhono gwaane gwa mokege, valapala, ‘Mwami, nale khwakhowonile otite njala, ao otite nyoota ao angile ole mohenja, ao angile otokhola myenda, ao angile ole molwile, ao angile ole mokhandulunge, nasu khwalekha khokhwalya?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Nanoyo Mwami alapala, ‘Nkhovaweela khapanga, chechensi kenaa alemwasiita khomonogelya ya wa vantu vaane ewa vanaa vado, mwalemwasiita khonogelya onene.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Gechoo, vanoja mabe evoo, valapeta mo itengemekho la nsiko jensi patokhola odugo, ila vanaa angile vakhonoja ganaa gakhogombekha paolongolo wa Matuunda, evoo avenee valiingela mo opanga wa nsiko jensi patokhola odugo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Vantu vakhoopooga njela ya khomogweela no khomowolaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Maluko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala egoo gensi, akavaweela vahemba vakwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Momanyile kete jasigaga nsiko jiwele ili opike mbina ya Pasakha, no Mwana wa Muntu alakenkhwa khwa vantu vabe ili ananamolwe pamosalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ituungo eloo valaala va vapumya matambekho ne valaala va Vayahudi valevitaanga palomwi kho nyoomba ya Kayafa, yunaa a molaala wa vapumya matambekho. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Omoo vakapooga njela ya khomogweela no khomowolaga Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ila valevapooga mpola eyoo ekhanojwe kho mbina ya Pasakha, kho nguno vantu vakhiije vanojee iwo.<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mokhiima akhomwitekelya Yesu makuta okhoo Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu angile Betania khokhaye khwa Simoni, yunaa pamyakha angile molwile wa malimwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Itungo lenaa Yesu angile akholya endya ya mesee, mokhiima yomwii aleijaa ne nsopa yenaa ikhonogelelwa khwa ibwee lya Alabasta. Nsopa eyoo angile etite makuta ga mpia nkolo ne matukeleli. Aedigolaa nsopa eyoo no khomwitekelya Yesu makuta egoo khwi itwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Vahemba vakwe panaa valevawona gechoo, valevakilwa modugo no khopaala, “Kho kee akhononaanga makuta ga mpia nyinki gechoo? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Makuta ega angavalakhowola khogagolya khwa mpia nyinki modugo, ne mpia ejoo vapeelwe vapeena.” <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu aleamanyaa kenaa angile vakhoheewa, akavaweela, “Kho kee mokhomogayanjaa mokhiima oyo? Omwenee aleanojelya mpola nsoga. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Onywenywe molaawa palomwi ne vapeena nsiko jensi, ila onene ndaawa ndekhotopo palomwi nanyu nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Mokhiima oyo anitekelelajaa makuta egoo ili khogwandalela mowele gwaane kho nguno ya nsiko ya khozyeekhwa khwaane panaa ndaawa nafwaaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, kho nse jensi panaa vantu valaawa vakhoteenga Mpola Nsoga, mpola eye nsoga yenaa mokhiima oyo anojelajaa, elatengwa ne vantu valamokombola.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda akhogoomba khomogalokha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Yuda wa kho Kalioti, yunaa angile yomwii wa vahemba ikomi ne vawele va Yesu, aleapetaa khwa valaala va vapumya matambekho, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />no khovawolya, “Molandepa kento kee mbe ndamogalokha Yesu paolongolo wenyu?” Apenee, valaala va vapumya matambekho vamopeela mabaande makomi gatato ga madini ga feza. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Khwandelya ituungo eloo, Yuda andya khopooga njela nsoga ya khomogalokha Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akholya endya ya Pasakha ne vahemba vakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Nsiko ya mwandyo ya mbina ya mikate yenaa ikhatulwa amila, vahemba va Yesu valevamopetela no khomowolya, “Mbi, okhopooga khopete kwenii khonaa kholakhwandalela endya ya mbina ya Pasakha?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu akavaweela, “Mopete khwa muntu yomwii kho ihala la Yelusalemu, momowele geeke, ‘Molaangi khopalaa, ituungo laane latelelaga. Onene palomwi ne vahemba vaane kholaalya endya ya Pasakha pakhaye yakhoo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Gechoo, vahemba vakwe vapeta no khonoja kete venaa Yesu avalagelelajaa, nanevo vandalela endya ya Pasakha.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Panaa yaleyapikha mesee, Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele, valevikhala no kholya endya. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Panaa angile vakholya endya, Yesu aleapalaa, “Nkhovaweela khapanga, yomoonga wenyu alangalokha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Vahemba vakwe panaa valevategeela gechoo, valevasaaya modugo, ne kela yomwii akamowolya, “Mbi, amba onene Mwene?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu akavaweela, “Yunaa akhodobya mokate mwibakuli palomwi nane, oyoo amwenee alangalokha. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Khapanga, Mwana wa Muntu alaafwa kete venaa yaleyandekhwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda, ila alakewona muntu oyoo yunaa alamogalokha Mwana wa Muntu. Angaamba visoga muntu oyoo angaakhalelwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Apenee Yuda yunaa amwenee alamogalokha Yesu, akamoweela, “Molaangi, mbi, a onene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu akamoweela, “Ogwegwe wapalaga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Endya ya Mwene yandajwaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Vakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Panaa valevakholya endya, Yesu asolaa mokate akamosongela Matuunda, apenee agomegan'ya no khovapeela vahemba vakwe, no khovaweela, “Solagi, molyee, ogo a mowele gwaane.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Khanke, asolaa kekhombe kenaa angile ketite divai, akamosongela Matuunda, no khovaweela, “Ng'welagi vensi khwa kekhombe eke.” <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />“Kho nguno eye a chaji yaane yenaa ekhwitekha kho nguno ya vantu vinki ili vawokelwee mabe gawe. Ne chaji eye ekholageela ilekhaano la Matuunda ne vantu. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nkhopooga momanye kete, khotopo niije ng'weele khanke divai ya mozabibu mpakha nsiko yenaa ndang'wela divai mpya palomwi nanyu kho owami wa Daada yaane.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Khanke panaa valevamalya khwemba nyembo ja khomokolya Matuunda, vakawookha no khopeta kho ketonda cha Mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhopaala kete Petelo alamosita</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Yesu akavaweela vahemba vakwe, “Otiko wa leelo onywenywe vensi molakembela no khondekha. Elaawa kete venaa Matuunda aleapalaa kho Maandekho gakwe kete, ‘Ndamowolaga mosoongi wa nkholo, ne nkholo jelasambala.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Ila panaa ndafufokha, ndavalongole khopeta Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petulo akamoweela Yesu, “Ninga mbe vensi valakholekha, onene khotopo niije nkholeke ninga nsiko yemwii.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu akamoweela Petulo, “Nkhokhoweela khapanga kete, otiko wa leelo panaa njogolo elaawa ekhale khowekha, olaawa wansitaga mala jetato kete okhanimanya onene.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Ila Petulo akamoweela Yesu khanke, “Ninga mbe ndapogiwa nfwee palomwi nagwe, khotopo niije nkhosite ninga kedo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Ne vahemba vaange vensi valevapaala avivyoo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akholoomba okhoo Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe, valevapeta kho lwande yemwii yenaa ekhwetwa Getisemane. Yesu akavaweela, “Mwikhale epa, onene nipetile epoo paolongolo kholoomba.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Akavasolaa Petulo palomwi ne vana vawele va Zebedayo. Apenee Yesu aleandyaa khosaaya no khotaanka momooyo gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Epoo Yesu akavaweela, “Mooyo gwaane gotite osaati mokolo wonaa gokhonkenkelelya ninga khofwa. Mwikhale epa mokeyole palomwi nane.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Apenee omwenee atelelaa paolongolo kedo, atungamaa no khosunamya itwe lakwe panse no kholoomba, “Daada yaane, mbe nekhowolekhaa, nkhokholoomba ombokelye kekhombe eke cha magayo. Ila okhanoje kete venaa onene nkhopooga, ila nojaa kete venaa ogwegwe khopooga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Apenee Yesu atuwaa panaa angile avalekhagaa vahemba vakwe evoo vatato, avapikhaa vagonaga ndoolo. Akamowolya Petulo, “Mbi, mwakonyaga khwikhala miso palomwi nane ninga khwa ituungo lemwii? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Keyolagi no khomoloomba Matuunda ili mogakinde magemo, kho nguno moye gokhopooga khonoja vento vesoga, ila mowele gotokhola ngulu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Yesu akavalekha apaponye no khotuuwa khanke akhokhonye khwa mala ya owele khomoloomba Matuunda khwa khopaala, “Daada yaane, mbe kekhombe eke cha magayo kekhakhowolekha khowochwaa khwaane, gechoo, nogajaa venaa okhopooga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Panaa aleatuwaa khwa vahemba vakwe evoo vatato, akavapikha vagonaga ndoolo khanke, kho nguno angile vatite ndoolo nyinki.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yesu akavalekha khanke, apetaa khomoloomba Matuunda khwa mala ya otato, atuwelelya kholoomba maloombi agagoo. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Apenee atuwaa khwa vahemba vakwe no khovaweela, “Mokhale mogonile no khosuupa? Kunagi, ituungo lapikhaga no Mwana wa Muntu akholekhwa agweelwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Lawelagi khopete. Kunagi, ijilee oyoo yunaa alangalokha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhogweelwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu panaa angile akhale khopalaa nanevo, apaponye, Yuda yomwii wa vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele, ijaa palomwi ne idale ikolo la vantu vanaa vatite mpanga ne malungu. Ewa vensi angile vatomilwe ne valaala va vapumya matambekho ne vakhoombi valaala va Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda yunaa alamogalokha Yesu, angile avapelagaa lomekho vantu evoo kete, “Yunaa ndamosona mokhono amwenee ayoyoo, momogwele.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Apaponye, Yuda apetaa khwa Yesu no khomoweela, “Ole mopanga Molaangi.” Apenee amosonaa mokhono.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu akamoweela, “Molashane, nogajaa kenaa okhopooga khonoja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Apaponye vantu evoo viija khomogweela Yesu no khomotuunga. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Apaponye yomwii wa vamoonga vanaa angile vapwale palomwi no Yesu, akasomola nsiime yakwe nkolo no khomokowa motomami molaala wa vapumya matambekho no khomodomola itwi lakwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Ila Yesu akamoweela, “Tuvyaa nsiime yakhoo mo mofukho gwakwe, kho nguno muntu yeyensi yunaa khotomelaa nsiime ili awolage, nanoyo alawolagwa khwa nsiime. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Mbi, mokhamanya kete angaankhowola khomoloomba Daada yaane anyalye? Nanoyo ituungo lemwii angaalantomela masinjala wa vatomami vakwe va pachanya madale makolo ikomi ne gawele no khokelelyaa? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Mbi, mbe anganojee gechoo, angagalakhowola mbi khodugama ganaa gandekhagwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda? Avyenee venaa gakhopogiwa gapumeele.”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Apenee Yesu akavaweela vantu va idale eloo, “Mbi, mwijaga ne nsiime nkolo ne malungu khongweela kete onene nde mosuki? Nsiko jensi angile nkholiga kho ibololo la Nyoomba ya Matuunda, kho kee mokhangwele okhoo? <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ila mpola eji jensi japumelaga ili Maandekho ga valooti va Matuunda gakhowole khodugama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Apenee vahemba vakwe vensi vakamolekha Yesu epoo no khokembela.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhokenkhwa kho ivanza la Vayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maluko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Vantu vanaa angile vamogwelaga Yesu, alevamokenkha khwa mopumya matambekho molaala, yunaa akhwetwa Kayafa. Okhoo valevakonganaga valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne valaala va Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petulo aleamolondaa khwa otale, mpakha kho lukiinga khwa mopumya matambekho molaala, ikhalaa palomwi ne valindeleli ili akhowole khowona kenaa kelapumela. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Valaala vapumya matambekho ne vakhombe va ivanza lensi valevapooga owoni wa opepi khomositachaa Yesu, ili vakhowole khomowolaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Valeviija vawoni va opepi vinki, ila valevakhapata owoni wewensi wa khokweela. Paudugo valeviija vawoni vawele, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />no khopaala, “Muntu oyo aleapalaa kete, ‘Ndakhowola khobomola Nyoomba ya Matuunda no khoejeenga khanke khwa nsiko jetato.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Apenee molaala wa vapumya matambekho imelelaa no khomowolya Yesu, “Mbi, ogwegwe okhakhopaala mpola yeyensi khwa ganaa vantu ewa vakhokhositachaa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ila Yesu aleapombolaa mya topo. Khanke molaala wa vapumya matambekho oyoo akamowolya Yesu, “Lapaa khwa lina la Matuunda yunaa mopanga kete, ogwegwe amwenee Kilisto, Mwana wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu akamoweela, “Ogwegwe amwenee wapalaga. Ila nkhokhoweela, khwandelya seji, molamowona Mwana wa Muntu ikhalagaa kho lwande lwa molyelo lwa Matuunda owa ngulu, ijilee khochanya mwiluunde, khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Yesu panaa alepalaa gechoo, molaala wa vapumya matambekho oyoo, akademola myenda jakwe no khopaala, “Muntu oyo amotokhagaa Matundaa! Khokhaloma khanke owoni wewensi. Kho nguno ninga nanyu mwamotegelaga venaa akhomotokha Matuunda. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Gechoo, onywenywe mokhopaala mbi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Nanevo vakapaala, “Akhopogiwaa awolagwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Apenee vandyaa khomotyeela Yesu matye kho osho, no khomokowa. Ne vaange vamopatolanga mankhofi, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />no khomoweela, “Ogwegwe Kilisto, lotelaa ananuu yunaa akhokowagaa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo akhomosiita Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maluko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petulo panaa angile akhale ikhalagaa kho lukiinga oloo, apenee motomami yomwii wa kekhiima akamotelela Petulo no khomoweela, “Ninga nagwe angile ole palomwi no Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Ila Petulo akasiita paolongolo ya vantu vensi vanaa angile vapwale epoo, no khopaala, “Nkhamanya kenaa opkhopaala.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Petulo panaa angile akhopuma pamolyango, motomami yoonge wa kekhiima amowonaa, nanoyo akavaweela vanaa angile vapwale epoo, “Muntu oyo angile apwale palomwi no Yesu wa kho Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petulo akasiita khanke no kholapa khwa khopaala, “Nkhamomanya muntu oyoo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Khatuungo khakupe, vantu vanaa angile vapwale epoo, vakamopetela Petulo no khomoweela, “Khapanga, ninga nagwe ole yomwii wawe, kho nguno ninga venaa okhopaala topo, okholageela avyenee avivyoo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Apenee Petulo andyaa khopaala, “Matuunda andigite mbe nkhopaala opepi, nkholapa khwa lina la Matuunda kete, nkhamomanya muntu oyoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Apaponye, njogolo yawekhaa, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />apaponye Petulo akombolaa mpola jenaa Yesu angile amowelagaa kete, “Panaa njogolo alaawa akhale khowekha, olapala mala jetato kete, okhanimanya.” Apenee Petulo apumaa panji, andyaa khokoota khwa osaati mokolo.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhokenkhwa khwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maluko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luka 23:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Igolo lakwe melawo ya makingilima, valaala va vapumya matambekho ne vakhoombi valaala va Vayahudi palomwi ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa valevigombyaa khomowolaga Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Apenee vakamotuunga ngosa no khomokenkha khwa Pilato, yunaa angile molaala wa Kelumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ncha ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18">Manoji 1:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Epoo, Yuda yunaa aleamogalokhaa Yesu, panaa aleawonaa Yesu atengemekhagwaa ili awolage, mooyo gwakwe alegwamosaata modugo. Asolaa vechele evyoo vya madini ga feza, no khojetuvya khwa valaala va vapumya matambekho ne vakhoombi valaala va Vayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Yuda akavaweela, “Nanogajaa obe khwa khomopumya muntu oyo yunaa atokhola ibe lelensi khowolagwa.” Ila evenee vakamoweela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">“Egoo osweswe gakhatoloma, eloo a ilamoli lakhoo gwegwee.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Apenee Yuda avesombelaa vechele evyoo kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda, no khopeta khwiniga.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Valaala va vapumya matambekho vasolangela vechele evyoo no khopaala, “Vechele evi vekhapogiwa khotoolwa ne vechele vya Nyoomba ya Matuunda, kho nguno vechele evi angile malepo ga khomowolaga muntu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Apenee valevapalana no khwigombya khosola vechele evyoo no khogolela mogoonda gwa mowoombi wa nyoongo, ili gowee mogoonda gwa khozyekela vahenja. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Eye ayenee nguno ya mogoonda ogoo khwetwa, “Mogoonda gwa Chaji” mpakha seji.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Gechoo, mpola ja molooti Yelemia jalejadugama jenaa jalejapaalwa, “Valevasola vechele makomi gatato ga madini ga feza, jenaa Vaizilaeli valevagooomba kholepa kho nguno yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Valevajetomela vechele evyoo khwa khogolela mogoonda gwa mowoombi wa nyoongo, kete venaa Mwene Matuunda aleandagelelajaa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato akhomowolya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maluko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Yesu panaa aleakenkhwaa paolongolo wa Pilato, yunaa angile molaala wa ihala la Kelumi no yunaa aleatulwaa ne Valumi. Oyoo molaala wa ihala akamowolya Yesu, “Mbi, ogwegwe amwenee mwami wa Vayahudi?” Yesu akamoweela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">“Ogwegwe wapalaga?” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ila valaala va vapumya matambekho ne vakhoombi valaala va Vayahudi panaa valevamositachaa, Yesu aleakhapala chechensi. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Apenee Pilato akamowolya Yesu khanke, “Mbi, okhagategela egoo gensi ganaa vakhokhositachaa?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ila Yesu aleakhapala chechensi, no Pilato akumyaa modugo.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhotengemekhwa khofwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Kho nsiko ya Pasakha, molaala wa Kelumi angile atite omanyani wa khomolekolela motungwa yomwii yunaa vantu angile vakhomopooga. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />No kho nsiko ejoo, angile apwale motungwa yomwii yunaa angile vantu vamomanyile modugo, yunaa akhwetwa Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Gechoo, vantu panaa alevakonganaga palomwi, Pilato avawolya, “Mokhopooga nevatungolele ananuu movamoonga mo ewa vawele? Nevatungolele Balaba ao Yesu, yunaa akhwetwa Kilisto?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilato aleawolya gechoo, kho nguno angile amanyile kete valaala va Vayahudi valevamoleeta Yesu khwakwe kho nguno ya wiilu wawe topo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato panaa angile ikhalagaa pa kegoda cha matengemekho, molijakwe amotomelaa okhombe wonaa angile okhopaala, “Okhamonojele obe wewensi muntu oyoo, kho nguno atokhola obe wewensi, kho nguno otiko nagayaga modugo mo ndoti kho nguno yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ila valaala va vapumya matambekho ne valaala va Vayahudi valevakhosongan'ya vantu vamolombe Pilato amodigolele Balaba apete, no Yesu awolagwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilato akavawolya khanke, “Mbi, ananuu yunaa mokhopooga nemolekolele apete movamoonga mwa ewa vawele?” Nanevo vakamoweela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">“Khokhopooga omolekolele Balaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato akavawolya khanke, “Nemonoje kee Yesu, yunaa akhwetwa Kilisto?” Vantu vensi valevajoma no khopaala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">“Ananamolwe pachanya pamosalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato akavawolya khanke, “Anogajaa obe kee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ila evenee vendelela khojoma no khopaala, “Ananamolwe pachanya pamosalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato panaa aleawonaa kete akhakhowola khogalolya maheewo ga vantu evoo, ne avivyoo vandajaa iwo, asolaa meje no khokhalawa mekhono paolongolo wa idale la vantu, akapaala, “Onene ntapoya, ncha yakwe molamanya nywenywe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Vantu vensi vakapaala, “Chaji yakwe ewaage khwisu sweswee no khwa vana visu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Apenee Pilato akavalekolela Balaba, khanke akavalagelelya masinjala vakwe vamofwembe Yesu menyepo ja ntila no khopeta khomonanamola pachanya pamosalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masinjala vakhomoletela makelege Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maluko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Yohana 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Apenee masinjala va Pilato vakamosola Yesu no khomokenkha mokhate ya ikolo ya molaala wa ihala, idale lensi la masinjala lakongana no khomopilima Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Vamolyola myenda jakwe no khomolyekha mwenda mokhasuku. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Khanke vanogelelya nkhata ya miiya no khomolyekha khwiitwe, no khomotolela nkhome ya mwanzi kho mokhono gwakwe gwa molyelo, ili iigele kete mwami. Vakamotungamela paolongolo wakwe no khomoletela makelege, apenee vandya khomolamochaa khwa khopaala, “Tokhokholamochaa Mwami wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Vamotyela matye no khosola nkhome eyoo ya mwanzi no khomokowela naneyo khwiitwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Masinjala evoo panaa valevamalya khomobyeda, vamolyola mwenda gwa kewami no khomolyekha khanke myenda jakwe. Apenee vamopumya panji ya ikolo ya molaala wa ihala no khowookha nanoyo khopeta khomokowelela pamosalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhonanamolwa pamosalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Masinjala panaa valevapwale monjela, valevitaanga no muntu yomwii yunaa khwetwaa Simoni, yunaa akhopumela ihala la Kilene. Nanoyo vamong'ang'anelya akepole mosalaba gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Panaa valevapikha lwande yenaa ekhwetwa Goligota, emaana yakwe, “Ibanka la Motwe”. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Apenee masinjala vakamopeela Yesu divai yenaa esalenkine no ogaanga okhakha wa khopongolya osaati, ila panaa aleagemaa, asitaa khong'weela.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Panaa valevamalya khomonanamola Yesu pamosalaba, vigawela myenda jakwe khwa khojekowela ndiku. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Apenee masinjala evoo vikhala epoo ili khomolindelelya. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Pachanya ya itwe pa mosalaba, valevandekha nguno ya omwene khowolagwa, “Oyo a Yesu Mwami wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Yesu aleananamolwa pamosalaba palomwi ne vasuki vawele, kela yomwii pa mosalaba gwakwe palomwi no Yesu, yomwii aleapwale lwande lwa molyelo wa Yesu no yoonge lwande lwa mokege wa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Vantu vanaa angile vakhokela epoo, valevayongan'yaa mitwe jawe no khomotokha Yesu khwa khopaala, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Ogwegwee alewapaala, nokhowola khobomola Nyoomba ya Matuunda no khoejeenga khwa nsiko jetato topo. Mbe ogwegwee ole Mwana wa Matuunda, wipon'ye gwegwee no khwitelemola pamosalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Avivyoo, valaala va vapumya matambekho ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa palomwi ne valaala va Vayahudi angile vakhomobyeeda no khopaala, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Aleavayawola vantu vaange, ila akonyagaa khwiyawola mwenee. Mbe khapanga omwene a mwami wa Vayahudi. Gechoo, atelemokhe pamosalaba, apenee naswi kholamogomba. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Omwene akhomosowelela Matuunda, gechoo Matuunda amoyawole pamosalaba, mbe Matuunda amotogilwe kho nguno angile akhopaala onene a Mwana wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Avivyoo, ninga vasuki vanaa angile vananamolagwa kho mesalaba palomwi no Yesu, nanevo angile vakhomotokha kete venaa ne vaange angile vakhomotokha.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhofwa pamosalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Khwandelya ituungo lenaa lyonse angile lepwale pakhate, kiiti yaleyaigubekha nse yensi mpakha panaa yalelapikha ituungo la saa kenda ya lyonse. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Panaa yaleyapikha saa kenda ya lyonse, Yesu aleajomaa no khopaala, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakitani?” Emaana yakwe, “Matuunda waane, Matuunda waane, kho kee wandekhaga?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Vamoonga va vantu vanaa angile vemaga epoo, panaa valevategeela gechoo, valevapaala, “Motegeleli, akhomwetaa Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Apaponye muntu yomwii aleakembelaa lowelo, ijaa adobya idodoki mo divai yenaa angile yasasaga, asopekhaa pachanya ya mwanzi anyanyolaa no khomopeela Yesu ili ang'weele.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Ila vaange valevapaala, “Lekhaa khowone mbe Eliya aliija khomoyawola.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Epoo, Yesu aleakotaa khanke khwa khojoma, papenee afwaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ituungo aleloo, lepazia lenaa angile lepwale kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda, lalelademokha mabaande gawele khwandelya pachanya mpakha panse. Avivyoo, lalelapumeela ilindimya lenaa lalelakenkelelya mapampa khodemokha. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Makhabuli galegadigokha ne mewele minki ja vantu va Matuunda vanaa angile vafwaaga, valevafufolwa, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />vakapuma mo makhabuli gawe. Yesu panaa alefufokha, vingela kho Yelusalemu ihala la Matuunda, no vantu vinki valevavawona.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Mwimeleli wa masinjala palomwi ne vanaa angile vakhomolindelelya Yesu, panaa valevawona ilindimya la nse ne gaange gensi ganaa galegapumeela, valevatungumala modugo, no khopaala, “Khapanga, muntu oyo angile Mwana wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Ne epoo valevapwale vakhiima vinki vanaa angile vakhomoloonda Yesu khopuma kho Galilaya, angile vakhomwalya. Vakhiima evoo angile vimelelaga khotale vakhokuuna gensi ganaa angile gakhonojekha. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mo vakhiima evoo, valevapwale Malia wa kho Magidala no Malia nyinya wa Yakobo no Yosefu, palomwi no moliji wa Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khozyeekhwa khwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Panaa yaleyapikha mesee, aleijaa muntu yomwii mosawi yunaa akhwetwaa Yosefu, yunaa mwikhali wa ihala la Alimataya, omwenee nanoyo angile mohemba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Yosefu aleapetaa khwa Pilato, no khomoloomba movimba gwa Yesu. Apenee Pilato akavalagelelya masinjala vakwe vamopele movimba ogoo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosefu agosolaa movimba ogoo no khogopilingelya mo shanda, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />no khogotuula mokhabuli, lenaa angile leponjilwe pi ipampa. Papenee abilingityaa ibwee ikolo, no khokundekela pamolyango wa khabuli. Panaa aleamalya khonoja gechoo, akawookha. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Malia wa kho Magidala palomwi no Malia oyoo yoonge, angile vikhalaga epoo vakhokuuna khabuli.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masinjala vakholindelelya khabuli la Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Igolo lakwe, yenaa angile Nsiko ya Khosuupa, valaala va vapumya matambekho palomwi ne Mafalisayo valevamopetela Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />no khomoweela, “Meyaa, khokombwike kete oyoo mopepi panaa angile akhale mopanga, aleapalaa, ‘Kho nsiko ya otato, ndafufokha.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Gechoo, khokholoomba ovalagelelye masinjala vakhoo valindelelye khabuli mpakha nsiko ya otato. Mbe olalekha khotoola valindeleli, vahemba vakwe navakhowola khwija no khwiwa movimba gwakwe no khopeta khovapepela vantu kete afufokhagaa. Mbe valanoja gechoo, opepi owoo wa odugo olaawa mobe khokela owoo mwandyo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato akavaweela, “Solagi masinjala mopete molindelelye khabuli visoga venaa mokhowile.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Apenee vapeta kho khabuli no khotoola kelageeli kho ibwee, ili mbe muntu alabilingitya ibwee eloo, vakhowole khomanya, no khovatoola masinjala epoo ili valelindelelye khabuli eloo.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akhofufokha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maluko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Nsiko ya Khosuupa panaa yaleyakela, igolo lakwe makingilima nsiko ya mwandyo wa juma, Malia wa kho Magidala palomwi no Malia oyoo yoonge, valevapeta khokuuna khabuli eloo. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Apaponye, lalelapumeela ilindimya ikolo, kho nguno motomami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda aleatelemokhaa khopuma khochanya, akatelela pepi ne khabuli, abilingityaa ibwee eloo pampelo, no kholekhalela. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Motomami oyoo wa khochanya khwa Matuunda angile akhong'alala kete lopwiito, ne myenda jakwe angile myelo pee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Masinjala vanaa angile vakholindelelya khabuli eloo, valevatungumala modugo, viigela kete vafwaaga.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Motomami oyoo wa khochanya khwa Matuunda akavaweela vakhiima evoo, “Mokhatungumale, kho nguno manyile kete mokhomopooga Yesu yunaa aleananamolagwa pamosalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Omwenee atapoya epa, afufokhagaa, kete venaa aleapaalaa. Mwiije mokuune panaa movimba alegopwale. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Gechoo, petagi nyango movawele vahemba vakwe kete, ‘Yesu afufokhagaa, ne seji akhovalongola khopeta Galilaya. Okhoo akhwenee molamopikha.’ Echoo achenee kenaa nijaga khovaweela.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Papenee vakhiima evoo vawookha nyango epoo pikhabuli, oko vatungumile palomwi no otogwi mokolo. Vakembela lowelo khopeta khovaweela vahemba va Yesu ganaa motomami wa khochanya khwa Matuunda avawelagaa. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Panaa angile vapetile lowelo khovaweela vahemba vakwe, apaponye Yesu itangaa nanevo, avalamochaa, “Molevapanga.” Vakhiima evoo vakamotelela, vamotungamela no khowaamba megolo jakwe no khomokumbekha. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Apenee Yesu akavaweela, “Mokhatungumale, petagi movawele vadogwane vapete Galilaya, okhoo akhwenee valanipikha.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masinjala vakhopaala ganaa valevagawona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Vakhiima evoo panaa angile vapetile, valindeleli vamoonga va khabuli eloo, valevapeta kho ihala khovaweela valaala va vapumya matambekho mpola jensi jenaa angile japumelaga. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Apenee valaala va vapumya matambekho evoo valevitaanga palomwi ne valaala va Vayahudi, vapalana no kholamola venaa valanoja. Vavapeela masinjala evoo mpia nyinki, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />no khovaweela, “Mbe muntu yeyensi alavawolya khwa ganaa gapumelaga, mowelagi geeeke, otiko panaa angile khogonile ndoolo, vahemba vakwe valeviija no khwiwa movimba gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ne mbe Pilato alategela mpola eye, osweswe kholapala nanoyo ili onywenywe mokhiije motengemekwe.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Papenee masinjala vasola mpia ejoo no khonoja kete venaa valevaweelwa ne valaala va Vayahudi. Mpola jawe ja opepi jasambaala khwa Vayahudi vensi mpakha leelo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akhovapumeela vahemba vakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Manoji 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Vahemba evoo ikomi no yomwii va Yesu, valevapeta Galilaya kho ketonda kenaa Yesu aleavalagelelya. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Panaa valevamowona Yesu, vakamokumbekha, ila vamoonga va vahemba evoo valevakhagomba kete a Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Apenee Yesu akavatelela no khovaweela, “Matuunda anipelagaa olaala wensi wa khochanya khwa Matuunda ne wa liwelelo. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Gechoo, petagi kho nse jensi movanoje vantu vawee vahemba vaane. Mopete monojee gechoo khwa khovabatijaa khwa lina la Daada, ne la Mwana, ne la Moye wa Matuunda, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />no khovaliga khogaloonda malagelelyo gensi ganaa nalenavalagelelajaa onywenywe. Manyagi kete, nane ndaawa palomwi nanyu nsiko jensi, mpakha kho odugo wa liwelelo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>